(20, 'Karungali Mala - 108 Beads, 8mm', 'karungali-mala-108-beads-8mm', 1499.00, 899.00, '18,6', 'This Karungali Mala is made with natural Karungali beads, traditionally used for prayer, meditation, and chanting. It is believed to help calm the mind, improve focus, and support spiritual growth. Designed for daily use, this mala is perfect for anyone who wants a simple, meaningful tool for regular chanting or mindful practice.\n\nWho Is This For?\n\nPeople practicing meditation or chanting\n\nThose seeking better concentration and calm\n\nIndividuals who want a spiritual accessory\n\nAnyone looking for a reliable prayer mala\n\nHow to Wear?\n\nFor Female\n\nHand: Wrap it on your Left Hand\n\nWear: Around the neck or hold in hand during chanting\n\n📅 Preferred Day: Tuesday (Recommended) / Saturday (Alternative)\n\n🕉️ Mantra: Anyone that you prefer or chant Om Sham Shanicharaya Namah\n\nFor Male\n\nHand: Wrap it on your Right Hand\n\nWear: Around the neck or hold in hand during chanting\n\n📅 Preferred Day: Tuesday (Recommended) / Saturday (Alternative)\n\n🕉️ Mantra: Anyone that you prefer or chant Om Sham Shanicharaya Namah\n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Ebony Wood \n\nDimension\n\n108 Beads, 8mm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear around neck or use during prayer, chanting, or meditation\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from water, perfumes, and chemicals; store in a clean, dry place', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-mala-108-beads-8mm', 'karungali-mala_1.jpg', 'karungali-mala_2.jpg', 'karungali-mala_3.jpg', 'karungali-mala_4.jpg', 'karungali-mala_5.jpg', 'karungali-mala_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(21, 'Sampoorna Yantra', 'sampoorna-yantra', 1999.00, 799.00, '22,45', 'When different areas of life feel aligned, everything flows more smoothly. The Sampoorna Yantra represents wholeness, supporting harmony across personal, professional, and emotional spaces. Designed as per Vastu by Astrologer RaajeevG, the Sampoorna Yantra is structured using precise geometric patterns that represent balance and alignment. In traditional geometric science, these symmetrical forms are believed to influence spatial harmony, helping create an environment of stability, clarity, and steady energy within your home or workspace.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who need a balance between personal and professional life\n\nHomeowners who value harmony within their living space\n\nAny person who’s drawn to Vastu-aligned spiritual décor\n\nAnyone choosing a thoughtful gift for overall wellbeing', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'sampoorna-yantra', 'sampoorna-yantra_1.jpg', 'sampoorna-yantra_2.jpg', 'sampoorna-yantra_3.jpg', 'sampoorna-yantra_4.jpg', 'sampoorna-yantra_5.jpg', 'sampoorna-yantra_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
