(27, '7 Horses on Raw Pyrite Frame', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 1999.00, 1049.00, '5,21,22', 'This 7 Horses on Raw Pyrite Frame symbolizes strength, speed, and steady progress, the qualities a business owner needs for growth and achievement. In traditional symbolism, seven horses are also associated with the Sun’s energy, representing power, momentum, and consistent forward movement. Set on a natural raw pyrite base, it reflects confidence and financial ambition. Place it in your workspace or home to support focus, drive, and determine business growth.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nProfessionals who are working toward career growth and recognition\n\nBusiness owners aiming for steady and visible progress\n\nIndividuals seeking motivation within their workspace\n\nAnyone choosing symbolic décor for ambition and success', 'Inspires unstoppable progress to achieve your goals.\nRaw pyrite energizes space with prosperity and protective vibrations.\nEnhances decor while aligning energy flow for growth and balance.\nEncourages clarity of purpose, confidence, and a forward-moving mindset.', 'Place the frame facing east or north to invite progress and success.\nHang it on a clean wall, or keep it on a desk, or altar, but never on the floor.\nMaintain energy flow by avoiding clutter or dark corners nearby.\nWipe gently with a dry cloth to retain its shine and energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame_1.jpg', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame_2.jpg', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame_3.jpg', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame_4.jpg', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame_5.jpg', '7-horses-on-raw-pyrite-frame_8.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(28, 'Karungali Bracelet - 24 Beads, 6mm', 'karungali-bracelet-24-beads-6mm', 1499.00, 699.00, '7,18', 'Embrace the spiritual vibe with this original Karungali Bracelet created from deep-black ebony wood beads. The sleek bracelet design combines timeless protection and modern ease, perfect for daily wear or gifting. Let its grounding energy sharpen your focus, enhance calm, and elevate your style.', 'Made from genuine ebony wood for powerful spiritual grounding.\nShields aura and repels negative energies throughout the day.\nPromotes mental clarity, focus, and inner calm naturally.\nElegant design blends with both spiritual practice and everyday style.', 'Wear the bracelet on your dominant wrist during meditation or casual wear.\nSet your intention or mantra while touching each bead for focus.\nAvoid water, perfume, or soap contact to preserve the beads.\nWhen not in use, store the Mala in a clean cloth pouch or your puja space to preserve its sacred energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-bracelet-24-beads-6mm', 'karungali-bracelet_1.jpg', 'karungali-bracelet_2.jpg', 'karungali-bracelet_3.jpg', 'karungali-bracelet_5.jpg', 'karungali-bracelet_6.jpg', 'karungali-bracelet_7.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(29, 'Amethyst Bracelet', 'amethyst-bracelet', 1999.00, 699.00, '33,7,30,27,43', 'Loved for its calming and grounding presence, this Amethyst Bracelet features 22 natural amethyst crystals. It gently soothes overthinking and supports clear, composed thoughts. Wear it daily to invite inner stillness, improve focus, and embrace a relaxed mindset. A premium, stylish choice for mindful living.\n\nWho Is This For?\n\nAnyone seeking mental calm and emotional balance in everyday life\n\nIndividuals who feel stressed, overwhelmed, or mentally drained\n\nPractitioners of meditation, mindfulness, or spiritual routines\n\nThose looking for a thoughtful, calming gift\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural amethyst crystal beads\n\nDimension\n\n22 Bead (8mm)\nDiameter - 7 cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear on the dominant wrist to experience the grounding energy\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from moisture, perfumes, and clean gently', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-bracelet', 'amethyst-bracelet_1.jpg', 'amethyst-bracelet_2.jpg', 'amethyst-bracelet_3.jpg', 'amethyst-bracelet_4.jpg', 'amethyst-bracelet_5.png', 'amethyst-bracelet_7.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(30, 'Green Aventurine Bracelet', 'green-aventurine-bracelet', 1999.00, 699.00, '7,28,34', 'Known as the “Stone of Opportunity”, Green Aventurine plays an important role to attracts opportunities and supporting personal growth. Crafted with 22 natural crystal beads, this green aventurine bracelet helps you stay motivated, confident, and emotionally steady. Daily use of this bracelet balances energy and supports positive decision-making. The unisex design of this bracelet makes it the most loved accessory for those seeking progress and harmony.\n\nWho Is This For?\n\nAnyone seeking growth, luck, and positive life opportunities\n\nPeople want emotional balance and confident decision-making\n\nProfessionals focused on progress, motivation, and steady success\n\nAnyone looking for a thoughtful gift option with meaningful energy\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural green aventurine crystal beads\n\nDimension\n\nFree size stretchable\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear on the dominant wrist during daily activities\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfumes, and store separately after use', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'green-aventurine-bracelet', 'green-aventurine-bracelet_1.jpg', 'green-aventurine-bracelet_2.jpg', 'green-aventurine-bracelet_4.jpg', 'green-aventurine-bracelet_6.jpg', 'green-aventurine-bracelet_7.jpg', 'green-aventurine-bracelet_8.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(31, 'Karungali Mala 108 Beads & Bracelet Combo - 6mm Beads', 'karungali-mala-108-beads-and-bracelet-combo-6mm-beads', 1999.00, 1099.00, '14,18,6', 'Experience spiritual harmony with the Karungali Malai 108 Beads & Karungali Bracelet Combo. Perfect for meditation and daily wear, this set promotes positive energy and inner peace. Crafted with care, it combines tradition and elegance, making it a meaningful gift for yourself or your loved ones seeking balance and focus.', '1.Enhances meditation experience and brings inner peace naturally every day.\n2.Promotes positive energy flow and spiritual balance for daily life.\n3.The combo set offers both a 108-bead mala and a matching bracelet elegantly.\n4.Makes a thoughtful gift for spiritual practitioners and loved ones alike.', 'Use the 108-bead mala for daily chanting or meditation practice easily.\nWear the Karungali bracelet on your wrist to maintain positive energy.\nKeep them in a clean, dry place to preserve the beads’ quality.\nGently wipe the beads with a soft cloth to maintain natural shine.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-mala-108-beads-and-bracelet-combo-6mm-beads', 'karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_1.png', 'karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_2.png', 'karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_3.png', 'karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_4.png', 'karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_6.png', 'karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_7.png', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(32, 'Evil Eye Anklet', 'evil-eye-anklet', 1200.00, 699.00, '19,4', 'This Evil Eye Anklet is designed to guard your energy while you move through life. The black evil eye anklet combines spiritual protection with style, helping you stay grounded and confident. Wearing this anklet is believed to gently shield you from negative vibrations, so you feel lighter, calmer, and spiritually supported wherever you go.\n\nWho is this for?\n\nAnyone who prefers daily spiritual protection.\n\nStyle lovers who want protection with modern appeal.\n\nWomen who are searching for an anklet that suits every outfit.\n\nPeople who are looking for meaningful blessings as a gift option.\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nBlack tourmaline beads, Authentic Evil Eye Charm, and High Class Metal\n\nDimension\n\nAdjustable ankle fit\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear on the right ankle throughout the day for protection\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from water and perfume, and clean gently with a soft cloth', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There’s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-anklet', 'evil-eye-anklet_1.png', 'evil-eye-anklet_2.png', 'evil-eye-anklet_3.png', 'evil-eye-anklet_4.png', 'evil-eye-anklet_7.png', 'evil-eye-anklet_8.png', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(33, 'White Moonstone Bracelet', 'white-moonstone-bracelet', 2499.00, 799.00, '7,35,9,27,31', 'Get rid of all darkness in your life with this elegant White Moonstone Bracelet, which is made with premium natural beads. Known for their subtle glow, moonstone crystals symbolize purity and new beginnings. With its timeless design, this graceful moonstone bracelet supports inner balance while adding elegance to your look.', 'Promotes calmness and emotional balance in daily life. \nEnhances intuition and strengthens spiritual awareness. \nEncourages new beginnings and personal growth.', 'Chant the mantra \"Om Chandraya Namah\" 11 times and then wear it. \nUse during meditation to deepen intuition and support spiritual connection. \nRecharge under moonlight to amplify its glow and healing properties. \nWear it on Mondays.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'white-moonstone-bracelet', 'white-moonstone-bracelet_1.jpg', 'white-moonstone-bracelet_2.jpg', 'white-moonstone-bracelet_3.jpg', 'white-moonstone-bracelet_4.jpg', 'white-moonstone-bracelet_5.jpg', 'white-moonstone-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1);
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `product_name`, `slug`, `price`, `sale_price`, `categories`, `description`, `benefit`, `how_to_use`, `return_exchange`, `disclaimer`, `photo_folder`, `photo1`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `is_in_stock`, `product_review`, `is_ratti`, `is_active`) VALUES
(34, '7 Chakra Bracelet', '7-chakra-bracelet', 1999.00, 699.00, '7,30,27', 'The beautiful 7 Chakra Bracelet features seven colors, authentic gemstone beads designed to balance energy centers throughout your body. This original 7 chakra bracelet aligns all the chakras from the root to crown, which helps promote harmony, emotional healing, and spiritual connection. Wear it daily for grounding, vitality, and inner clarity.\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nLapis Lazuli, Rose Quartz, Carnelian, Citrine, Amethyst, Black Onyx, Turquoise, Tiger’s Eye, Hematite\n\nDimension\n\n22 Beads (8mm)\nDiameter: 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nHang at the entrance; place the idol in the pooja or living area\n\nCare Instruction\n\nClean gently with a dry cloth; avoid moisture; use brass polish to maintain the idol\'s shine.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-bracelet', '7-chakra-bracelet_1.jpg', '7-chakra-bracelet_2.jpg', '7-chakra-bracelet_3.jpg', '7-chakra-bracelet_4.jpg', '7-chakra-bracelet_5.jpg', '7-chakra-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(35, 'Brass Ganesh Idol', 'brass-ganesh-idol', 999.00, 999.00, '5', 'The brass Ganesh idol is a beautifully crafted piece, symbolizing wisdom, prosperity, and protection. This premium-quality Ganpati murti or idol radiates positivity, making it a perfect addition to your home, puja room, or as a gift. With its aesthetic and divine design, this brass Ganpati idol adds blessings, harmony, and elegance to any sacred or living space.', 'Attracts the divine blessings of Lord Ganesha for prosperity and wisdom.\nEnhances positivity, peace, and harmony in your home or office.\nActs as a protective symbol, removing obstacles from life’s path.', 'Place the brass Ganesh idol in your pooja room, entrance, or living space to invite blessings.\nKeep it in your workspace for success, focus, and prosperity.\nClean gently with a dry, soft cloth to maintain its shine and divine aura.\nAvoid using harsh chemicals or water for cleaning.\nPosition facing east or north for auspicious energy flow.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'brass-ganesh-idol', 'brass-ganesh-idol_1.jpg', 'brass-ganesh-idol_2.jpg', 'brass-ganesh-idol_3.jpg', 'brass-ganesh-idol_5.png', 'brass-ganesh-idol_6.jpg', 'brass-ganesh-idol_7.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(36, 'Money Magnet Bracelet', 'money-magnet-bracelet', 1999.00, 499.00, '7,28', 'Money Magnet Bracelet is designed using silver hematite that is believed to attract wealth and prosperity. Each bead is made from 100% natural hematite stone that channels abundant energy and aligns your vibes with financial growth. Get this bracelet today and attain the balance you need to deal with all the ups and downs of your life.\n\nMaterial\n\nHematite\n\nDimension\n\n22 Beads (8mm)\nDiameter: 7cm\n\nHow to wear\n\n \n\nWear on the dominant wrist during daily activities\n \n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '1. Attracts wealth and supports money-making opportunities. \n2. Promotes confidence in financial decisions. \n3. Reduces negativity around success and prosperity.', '1. Wear on your left wrist to invite wealth-attracting vibrations daily. \n2. Keep close while working or during financial planning for focus. \n3. Cleanse monthly with clean water or sage smoke for fresh energy. \n4. Recharge under moonlight on a selenite plate to amplify its money magnet benefits.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'money-magnet-bracelet', 'money-magnet-bracelet_1.jpg', 'money-magnet-bracelet_2.jpg', 'money-magnet-bracelet_3.jpg', 'money-magnet-bracelet_4.jpg', 'money-magnet-bracelet_5.png', 'money-magnet-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(37, 'Gold-Plated Karungali Mala with Hanuman Kavach Pendant', 'goldplated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant', 1499.00, 899.00, '18,6', 'Gold-Plated Karungali Mala with Hanuman Kavach Pendant is designed for those who prefer traditional & meaningful spiritual accessories. The mala is made using natural karungali wood beads, known for their strong and grounding presence, and comes with a Hanuman Kavach pendant, which is often associated with courage, protection, and devotion. The gold-plated finish adds a clean and refined look, making it suitable for daily wear as well as prayer or meditation. Its simple design allows it to be worn comfortably while keeping a spiritual touch close.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nDevotees of Lord Hanuman\n\nPeople who wear spiritual malas\n\nIndividuals who prefer traditional accessories\n\nAnyone looking for meaningful daily wear\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nPremium Metal, Natural Karungali Wood, Hanuman Kavach\n\nDimension\n\nHanuman Kavach Diameter - 3cm, Karungali mala - 35 - 37 cm\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear around neck daily\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from water, perfumes, & harsh chemicals. Clean it with a dry cloth.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'goldplated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant', 'gold-plated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant_1.jpg', 'gold-plated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant_2.jpg', 'gold-plated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant_3.jpg', 'gold-plated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant_4.jpg', 'gold-plated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant_5.jpg', 'gold-plated-karungali-mala-with-hanuman-kavach-pendant_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(38, 'Pyrite Tortoise with Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra Combo for Wealth & Business Growth', 'pyrite-tortoise-with-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo-for-wealth-and-business-growth', 1499.00, 899.00, '14,4,21,22', 'True success is not rushed; it is built steadily over time. This meaningful pairing of the Pyrite Tortoise and Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra by Astrologer RaajeevG symbolizes stability, protection, and consistent financial progress. Together, they help you to be a bit more patient to make thoughtful decisions, and nurture business growth with balance, resilience, and long-term vision.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nBusiness owners who are seeking steady and stable financial growth\n\nEntrepreneurs who are building long-term money security with patience\n\nPeople who are creating a balanced and positive workspace environment\n\nIndividuals who want authentic spiritual décor for offices and homes, or are looking for premium gift options.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-tortoise-with-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo-for-wealth-and-business-growth', 'pyrite-tortoise-vyapar-vriddhi-combo_1.jpg', 'pyrite-tortoise-vyapar-vriddhi-combo_2.jpg', 'pyrite-tortoise-vyapar-vriddhi-combo_3.jpg', 'pyrite-tortoise-vyapar-vriddhi-combo_4.jpg', 'pyrite-tortoise-vyapar-vriddhi-combo_5.webp', 'pyrite-tortoise-vyapar-vriddhi-combo_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(39, 'Evil Eye Charging Plate', 'evil-eye-charging-plate', 999.00, 899.00, '19', 'The Evil Eye Charging Plate is designed with a concept to recharge your spiritual products with a shield from negativity. Made from powerful Selenite with an Evil Eye design, it is used for cleansing, purifying, and recharging all your spiritual items.', '1. Cleanses and recharges any spiritual or crystal-based product.\n2. Removes negative energy and restores natural energetic vibration.\n3. Promotes peace, clarity, and high-frequency healing as made of Selenite.\n4. Evil Eye design adds symbolic protection for your sacred space.\n5. Helps maintain the long-term effectiveness of your spiritual tools.', '1. Place your evil eye pendants, bracelets, or charms on the charging plate overnight.\n2. For best results, keep the plate near natural light or under moonlight to enhance the cleansing process.\n3. Keep it on for altars, desks, or bedside tables.\n4. Use it regularly to maintain the potency and protection of your spiritual accessories.\n5. Wipe gently with a soft cloth to keep the plate radiant and energetically clear.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-charging-plate', 'evil-eye-plate_1.jpg', 'evil-eye-plate_2.jpg', 'evil-eye-plate_3.jpg', 'evil-eye-plate_4.jpg', 'evil-eye-plate_5.jpg', 'evil-eye-plate_6.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(40, 'Triple Protection Bracelet', 'triple-protection-bracelet', 1999.00, 599.00, '7,29', 'Step out each day feeling protected and steady with this Triple Protection Bracelet which brings together three natural stones - Black Tourmaline, Tiger Eye, and Silver Hematite, known for shielding energy and bringing balance. Designed mindfully for everyday wear, it blocks negativity, promotes grounding, and adds aesthetic appeal to your overall outfit. \n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who need protection from negative influences\n\nProfessionals going through high-stress environments daily\n\nThose who value meaningful daily spiritual accessories\n\nAnyone choosing a thoughtful protection-focused gift\n\nMaterial\n\nBlack Onyx, Tiger’s Eye, Hematite\n\nDimension\n\n22 Beads (8mm)\nDiameter: 7cm\n\nHow to wear\n\nWear on the dominant wrist during daily activities\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfumes, and store separately after use', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'triple-protection-bracelet', 'triple-protection-bracelet_1.jpg', 'triple-protection-bracelet_2.jpg', 'triple-protection-bracelet_3.jpg', 'triple-protection-bracelet_6.jpg', 'triple-protection-bracelet_7.jpg', 'triple-protection-bracelet_8.jpg', 1, '4', '0', 1),
(41, 'Sampoorna With Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra Combo', 'sampoorna-with-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo', 2299.00, 1149.00, '14,22', 'True success feels complete when life and work move in harmony. This thoughtfully curated combo by Astrologer RaajeevG is inspired by traditional Vedic principles. This pairing of the Sampooran Yantra and Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra represents overall harmony along with focused business progress. \n\nTogether, they help create a space that feels stable, supportive, and aligned for personal and business growth. The positive vibes of this product also make it an ideal gift option for the auspicious occasion\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nBusiness owners who are seeking balanced and focused business growth\n\nIndividuals who are working toward overall life stability and progress\n\nPeople who are willing to create a calm and positive environment\n\nIndividuals who want to buy authentic spiritual décor for homes and offices.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'sampoorna-with-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo', 'sampoorna-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo_1.jpg', 'sampoorna-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo_2.jpg', 'sampoorna-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo_3.jpg', 'sampoorna-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo_4.jpg', 'sampoorna-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo_5.jpg', 'sampoorna-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-combo_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(42, 'Siddh 5 Mukhi Rudraksha Mala - 108 Beads, 8mm', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala-108-beads-8mm', 1500.00, 1249.00, '16', 'The Siddh 5 Mukhi Rudraksha, also known as Panchmukhi Rudraksha or Five-Face Rudraksha, is a premium spiritual bead known for its divine energy. Ideal for meditation, prayers, and daily wear, it helps promote well-being, harmony, confidence, and protection. This 5 Mukhi Rudraksha mala has been charged and energized through sacred Vedic rituals at a temple, which bring positive energy and spiritual upliftment into your life.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala-108-beads-8mm', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala_1.jpg', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala_2.jpg', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala_3.jpg', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala_4.jpg', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala_6.jpg', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha-mala_7.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(43, 'Laxmi Charan', 'laxmi-charan', 649.00, 649.00, '4,5', 'The Lakshmi Charan Paduka is a sacred symbol representing the divine footprints of Goddess Lakshmi, embodying prosperity, peace, and abundance. Crafted in brass, this aesthetic and trendy idol radiates positivity, attracting wealth and harmony to your home or office. Place it in your puja space, cash box, or entrance for continuous blessings.', 'Attracts prosperity, wealth, and abundance into your life.\nCreates a divine, positive, and peaceful environment at home or work.\nEnhances spiritual vibrations during puja, meditation, and daily rituals.\nSymbolizes the presence of Goddess Lakshmi’s blessings.', 'Place the Lakshmi Charan Paduka in your puja room, cash box, or near the main entrance for divine blessings.\nKeep it in your office desk, shop counter, or locker for prosperity.\nClean regularly with a soft cloth; avoid harsh chemicals to maintain its shine.\nFor best results, light a diya near the Laxmi Charan brass idol daily.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'laxmi-charan', 'laxmi-charan_1.jpg', 'laxmi-charan_2.jpg', 'laxmi-charan_3.jpg', 'laxmi-charan_4.jpg', 'laxmi-charan_5.png', 'laxmi-charan_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(44, '5 Mukhi Rudraksha Bracelet', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet', 1999.00, 549.00, '7', 'This 5 Mukhi Rudraksha bracelet is made with authentic Rudraksha beads, known for their natural texture and sacred origin. The bracelet is handcrafted and carries spiritual significance with a traditional touch. 5 Mukhi Rudraksha is perfect for daily wear, meditation, or gifting with blessings.\n\nNo. of Beads\n\n19\n\nBead Size\n4 mm\n\nDiameter\n8 cm', 'Brings peace of mind and reduces stress naturally. Supports spiritual growth and deepens meditation practices. Promotes overall well-being by balancing inner energies. Sacred accessory symbolizing protection and divine blessings.', 'Wear on your right wrist daily to connect with divine energy. \nUse during prayer or meditation for focus and inner calmness. \nCleanse by rinsing in sacred Ganges water and gently wiping with a cloth. \nRecharge by keeping it in the temple space or under moonlight overnight.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet_1.jpg', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet_2.jpg', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet_3.jpg', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet_4.jpg', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet_5.jpg', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
