(46, 'Laxmi Ganesh Idols', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols', 1999.00, 1799.00, '5', 'Invite prosperity, wisdom, and positive energy into your home or office with the Laxmi & Ganesh Combo. This handcrafted brass Laxmi Ganesh Murti features both deities on a beautiful lotus base, symbolizing wealth, knowledge, and harmony. Luxurious and elegant, it is ideal for puja, festive decor, or as a thoughtful gift to bless loved ones with abundance and positivity.', 'Combines brass Laxmi and Ganesh idols for wealth, wisdom, and harmony.\nEnhances spiritual energy and positive vibrations in homes or workplaces.\nHandcrafted design adds elegance and a traditional touch to decor.', 'Place the idols on a clean, elevated altar or puja temple facing east.\nOffer incenses, flowers, and light a diya during daily prayers or festivals.\nKeep the set in living rooms, offices, or shops to attract prosperity.\nUse during Diwali, Ganesh Chaturthi, or other auspicious occasions for blessings.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols_1.jpg', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols_2.jpg', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols_3.jpg', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols_4.jpg', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols_5.jpg', 'laxmi-ganesh-idols_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(47, 'Silver Plated Karungali Bracelet', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet', 1499.00, 799.00, '7,18', 'Made from original karungali wood with silver-plated accents, this bracelet brings together tradition and style. It protects your aura, balances energy, and elevates your everyday look. Purchase it for yourself to feel calm and confident, or gift it to someone who seeks both fashion and spiritual well-being.', 'Genuine karungali wood beads promote grounding and positive energy.\nSilver-plated detailing adds elegant charm and elevated visual appeal.\nProtects from negative influences while supporting mental clarity.\nIdeal gift accessory that fuses spiritual depth and refined style.', 'Wear the bracelet on either wrist, daily or during meditation or prayer.\nSet your intention or mantra while touching each bead for focused energy.\nKeep away from water, perfume, or harsh chemicals to maintain shine.\nWhen not in use, store the Mala in a clean cloth pouch or your puja space to preserve its sacred energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet_1.jpg', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet_2.jpg', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet_3.jpg', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet_4.jpg', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet_6.jpg', 'silver-plated-karungali-bracelet_7.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
