(60, 'Selenite Charging Plate for Crystals', 'selenite-charging-plate-for-crystals', 1199.00, 699.00, '5', 'The Selenite Charging Plate for Crystals is a natural tool for cleansing and recharging your spiritual items. This large selenite charging plate gently restores energy to crystals, jewelry, or other spiritual accessories. Perfect for meditation or home use, it helps maintain positive vibes and keeps your sacred items energized, making your daily rituals simple, effective, and calming.', '1. Cleanses negative energy from spiritual items naturally and easily\n2. Maintains positive energy in your home, workspace, or meditation areas\n3. Helps recharge crystals, jewelry, and other spiritual accessories effortlessly\n4. Supports calm, focus, and peaceful energy during meditation or daily routines', '1. Place your crystals or jewelry on the selenite charging plate to restore energy\n2. Keep it on a table or shelf where your spiritual items are stored\n3. Use during meditation or spiritual practices for continuous positive energy\n4. Clean gently with a dry cloth and avoid water to protect the plate', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'selenite-charging-plate-for-crystals', 'selenite-plate_1.png', 'selenite-plate_2.png', 'selenite-plate_3.png', 'selenite-plate_4.png', 'selenite-plate_6.png', 'selenite-plate_7.png', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(61, 'Blue Evil Eye Hanging', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging', 1499.00, 849.00, '19', 'This blue evil eye hanging is perfectly designed for everyday use. Provides a protective shield against the evil eye 24/7. Its minimal size makes it suitable for doors, cars, or small corners, adding a blue accent that blends easily with different decor styles while remaining easy to hang and maintain.', 'Compact size that fits well in small spaces without looking overwhelming\nYour everyday protection charm, the blue evil eye \nLightweight design makes the charm easy to hang anywhere.\nSuitable for house decor or small gifting purposes', 'Hang near doors, windows, shelves, or small wall hooks.\nSuitable for car rearview mirrors without blocking visibility\nAvoid direct contact with water to maintain its finish\nWipe gently using a dry cloth to remove dust', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging_1.jpg', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging_2.jpg', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging_3.jpg', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging_4.jpg', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging_5.jpg', 'blue-evil-eye-hanging_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(62, 'Brass Diya Set of 2', 'brass-diya-set-of-2', 649.00, 499.00, '5', 'The Brass Diya Set of 2 is crafted from quality brass, blending tradition with elegance. Perfect for pooja, meditation, or festive decor, these brass diyas radiate positivity and light. Stylish, durable, and aesthetic, this brass diya set enhances your spiritual rituals while adding a timeless charm to your home.', 'Creates a sacred and positive atmosphere during pooja and prayers.\nEnhances focus, peace, and spiritual connection when lit.\nBrings traditional yet stylish, aesthetic decor to any space.\nDurable and long-lasting brass diya design.\nPerfect as a spiritual gift or festive accessory.', 'Fill the brass diya with oil or ghee, and place a cotton wick at the center.\nLight during pooja, meditation, or aarti to invite divine blessings.\nKeep the brass deepam in your temple, living room, or workspace.\nClean with mild soap and a soft cloth to maintain shine.\nRecharge by placing it on a selenite plate or in sunlight for a few minutes.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'brass-diya-set-of-2', 'brass-diya-set-of-2_1.jpg', 'brass-diya-set-of-2_2.jpg', 'brass-diya-set-of-2_4.jpg', 'brass-diya-set-of-2_5.png', 'brass-diya-set-of-2_6.jpg', 'brass-diya-set-of-2_7.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(63, 'Siddh OM Shiva Trishool Karungali Mala - 54 Beads, 6mm', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mala-54-beads-6mm', 1999.00, 1099.00, '16', 'This Siddh Karungali Mala is a sacred spiritual necklace made from natural Karungali wood beads. The Om Shiva Trishool charm adds a meaningful and beautiful touch. The beads have been spiritually charged by an experienced priest through sacred Vedic rituals at the temple. Designed for devotees of Lord Shiva, it supports daily prayers, meditation, and spiritual practices. Wearing this mala helps bring calmness, focus, and devotion, while perfectly fitting your spiritual routine and traditional attire for everyday worship at home or in temples.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mala-54-beads-6mm', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mal_1.jpg', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mal_2.jpg', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mal_4.jpg', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mal_5.jpg', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mal_8.jpg', 'siddh-om-shiva-trishool-karungali-mal_9.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(64, 'Black Obsidian Bracelet', 'black-obsidian-bracelet', 749.00, 599.00, '7,30,39', 'Black Obsidian Bracelet is made from natural Black Obsidian beads, known for their deep glossy finish. Traditionally valued for strength and protection, Black Obsidian is both elegant and powerful. A must buy bracelet to complement the style you carry with the addition of extra aura through natural grounding energy.', 'Protects against negativity and unwanted influences. \nPromotes grounding, stability, and inner strength. \nEncourages clarity by removing confusion and self-doubt.', 'Wear on your left wrist to stay grounded and shielded from negativity. \nChant a protection mantra like \"Om Hum Hanumate Namah\" 11 times. \nCleanse monthly by rinsing under water with a pinch of sea salt or Himalayan salt.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'black-obsidian-bracelet', 'black-obsidian-bracelet_1.jpg', 'black-obsidian-bracelet_2.jpg', 'black-obsidian-bracelet_3.jpg', 'black-obsidian-bracelet_4.jpg', 'black-obsidian-bracelet_5.jpg', 'black-obsidian-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(65, 'Dhan Yog Bracelet & The Real Money Magnet Bracelet', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-and-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet', 2999.00, 1249.00, '7,14,4', 'This trendy bracelet combo brings together the Dhan Yog Bracelet’s wealth-enhancing charm and the Real Money Magnet Bracelet’s abundance-attracting energy. Full of aesthetic appeal, you can wear this combo of bracelets daily to elevate prosperity vibes while keeping a fashionable, meaningful accessory close at hand.', 'Dhan Yog Bracelet supports financial growth and long-term prosperity naturally.\nReal Money Magnet Bracelet attracts immediate abundance and positive money energy.\nComfortable and durable, ideal for daily wear with any outfit.', 'Wear the bracelets on your dominant hand to maximize energy flow effectively.\nRecharge regularly under sunlight or moonlight to maintain positive energies.\nClean gently with a soft cloth to preserve aesthetics and durability.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-and-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet_1.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet_2.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet_3.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet_4.png', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet_5.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-the-real-money-magnet-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(66, 'Shree Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame', 'shree-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 1999.00, 999.00, '5,21,22', 'Elevate your space with this Raw Pyrite - Shree Yantra Frame that blends sacred geometry and natural crystal texture. vibrant Colorful-Hue pyrite frame complements the Shree Yantra symbol, inviting prosperity, balance, and motivation into your home or office. A powerful decor piece crafted for spiritual clarity and abundance.', 'Combines raw pyrite’s grounding energy with the Shree Yantra’s sacred power.\nEnhances focus, clarity, and decision-making in daily life and work.\nHarmonizes the energy flow in your space and supports Vastu balance.\nEnables a stylish yet spiritually meaningful addition to your decor.', 'Keep chanting “Om Shreem Hreem Shreem Kamale Kamalalaye Praseed Praseed, Om Shreem Hreem Shreem Mahalakshmaye Namah” to set clear intentions and continuous energy flow.\nPosition the frame on a clean wall or altar facing inward to the room.\nPlace it at eye-level or slightly higher on a pedestal for the best effect.\nLight a small diya or incense in front of it to activate its energy.\nGently wipe the surface with a soft, dry cloth to keep it shiny.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'shree-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 'shree-yantra-frame_1.jpg', 'shree-yantra-frame_2.jpg', 'shree-yantra-frame_3.jpg', 'shree-yantra-frame_4.jpg', 'shree-yantra-frame_5.jpg', 'shree-yantra-frame_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1);
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `product_name`, `slug`, `price`, `sale_price`, `categories`, `description`, `benefit`, `how_to_use`, `return_exchange`, `disclaimer`, `photo_folder`, `photo1`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `is_in_stock`, `product_review`, `is_ratti`, `is_active`) VALUES
(67, 'Citrine Bracelet', 'citrine-bracelet', 2499.00, 699.00, '7,9,28', 'This citrine bracelet is crafted from natural citrine crystals, known for attracting success and prosperity. A powerful energy booster, it brings joy, confidence, and clarity to your daily life. Ideal for anyone seeking abundance and positivity with the power of citrine.', 'Attracts wealth, success, and positive opportunities Boosts self-confidence, creativity, and personal power Encourages a positive mindset and emotional clarity A stylish accessory with powerful energy benefits', 'Wear the citrine bracelet on your right hand to attract wealth \nWash under lukewarm, soapy water using a soft cloth, then rinse it thoroughly \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight or moonlight for a few hours monthly \nUse during goal-setting or work for added motivation and clarity', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'citrine-bracelet', 'citrine-bracelet_1.jpg', 'citrine-bracelet_2.jpg', 'citrine-bracelet_3.jpg', 'citrine-bracelet_4.jpg', 'citrine-bracelet_5.jpg', 'citrine-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(68, '3 Item Brass Gift Set', '3-item-brass-gift-set', 2699.00, 2699.00, '4,5', 'Invite prosperity, wisdom, and divine blessings into your life with the Laxmi, Ganesh & Charan Combo. Featuring brass Laxmi and Ganesh idols along with auspicious Laxmi Charan, this set symbolizes wealth, success, and positivity. Ideal for worship, festive rituals, or home decor, it also makes a premium gift option for loved ones on special occasions and celebrations.', 'A rare brass combo of Laxmi idol, Ganesh idol, and Laxmi Charan together.\nCreates a divine atmosphere at home, in the office, or in a place of worship.\nSymbolizes prosperity, wisdom, wealth, and the removal of obstacles.\nA premium devotional combo, ideal for gifting on special occasions.', 'Place idols and Laxmi Charan on a clean, decorated altar or puja space.\nOffer incense, flowers, and a diya daily while chanting simple prayers or mantras.\nKeep Laxmi Charan near the entrance or temple for blessings of prosperity.\nUse the Set During different festivals, puja rituals, or just to share the divine blessings with your loved ones.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '3-item-brass-gift-set', 'brass-gift-combo_1.jpg', 'brass-gift-combo_2.png', 'brass-gift-combo_3.jpg', 'brass-gift-combo_5.jpg', 'brass-gift-combo_6.jpg', 'brass-gift-combo_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(69, 'Dhan Varsha Bracelet', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet', 2499.00, 799.00, '7,28', 'The Dhan Varsha Bracelet is designed to attract wealth, prosperity, and success. Made with premium beads, this bracelet symbolizes abundance while keeping your energy positive. Comfortable to wear every day, the Dhan Varsha Bracelet supports financial growth and confidence, making it both meaningful and stylish.', '1. Attracts prosperity and supports financial stability in your daily life. \n2. Boosts positive energy while reducing stress and negativity around you. \n3. Encourages confidence and clarity when making important financial decisions.', '1. Wear the Dhan Varsha Bracelet on the left wrist to receive money and on the right wrist to chase success. \n2. Gently remove before sleeping to keep the energy balanced. \n3. Place it under full moon overnight, on selenite, or in morning sunlight for charging. \n4. Soak in warm water with sea salt or Ganga Jal and milk, then rinse and dry gently.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet_1.jpg', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet_2.jpg', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet_3.jpg', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet_4.jpg', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet_5.jpg', 'dhan-varsha-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(70, 'Shree Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 1999.00, 999.00, '5,21,22', 'Enhance your business success with the Shree Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra on a Raw Pyrite frame. Known for promoting growth, prosperity, and financial stability, this sacred yantra supports entrepreneurs and professionals seeking progress. The natural pyrite crystal amplifies wealth-attracting energy, helping remove obstacles and encourage consistent business expansion.', 'Promotes steady business growth and financial prosperity.\nEnergized with pyrite’s powerful wealth-attracting vibrations.\nHelps remove hurdles blocking professional success.\nInspires confidence, clarity, and positive decision-making.', 'Set a clear intention and chant the “Om Aakarshaye Swaha” mantra for attraction and success\nPlace the yantra in your office, shop, or workspace facing east or north.\nKeep it on a clean table, altar, or wall at eye level for balanced energy.\nLight incense or a diya near it daily to maintain spiritual vibration.\nClean with a soft, dry cloth to maintain its shine and energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame_1.jpg', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame_2.jpg', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame_3.jpg', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame_4.jpg', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame_5.jpg', 'shree-vyapar-vriddhi-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(71, 'Rose Quartz Pendant', 'rose-quartz-pendant', 1499.00, 849.00, '38,27,24', 'This Rose Quartz Pendant is made for times when you need warmth, comfort, and emotional ease. Curated using an original rose quartz crystal, this pendant has an elegant water drop shape that perfectly complements all outfits. Wearing this pendant regularly supports gentle self-love, harmonious relationships, and peaceful feelings. It is an aesthetically pleasing piece with a soothing touch. \n\nWho Is This For?\n\nAnyone wanting emotional comfort and a softer, calmer mindset.\n\nPeople working on self-love and personal relationship healing journey.\n\nThose who prefer meaningful jewelry with a gentle look.\n\nAnyone looking for a thoughtful gift option filled with warmth.\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nOriginal rose quartz with premium metal\n\nDimension\n\n18 to 20 inch chain\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear close to heart for emotional comfort\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfumes, and store separately after use', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rose-quartz-pendant', 'rose-quartz-drop-pendant_1.png', 'rose-quartz-drop-pendant_2.png', 'rose-quartz-drop-pendant_3.png', 'rose-quartz-drop-pendant_5.jpg', 'rose-quartz-drop-pendant_6.png', 'rose-quartz-drop-pendant_7.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(72, 'Amethyst Pendant', 'amethyst-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '30,27,24,43', 'This elegant Amethyst Pendant with a chain adds a touch of beauty and calm to your style. Known for its soothing energy, the amethyst pendant makes every outfit more graceful. Perfect for daily wear or special occasions, it also makes a thoughtful gift for any occasion or festival.', 'Reduces stress and anxiety, promoting a calmer, more relaxed state of mind. \nImproves sleep quality, helping you rest better and feel more refreshed. \nEnhances spiritual awareness and intuition, deepening your connection to inner wisdom. \nProtects from the negative energies, creating a shield of positive vibes.', 'Wear the Pisces Amethyst Pendant daily to strengthen your zodiac connection.\nPair with outfits to add elegance and a touch of spiritual charm.\nClean gently with a soft cloth to maintain shine and durability.\nStore pendant safely when not in use to protect the stone’s surface.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-pendant', 'amethyst-pendant_1.jpg', 'amethyst-pendant_2.jpg', 'amethyst-pendant_3.jpg', 'amethyst-pendant_4.jpg', 'amethyst-pendant_5.jpg', 'amethyst-pendant_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(73, 'Dhan Vriddhi Bracelet', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet', 1399.00, 699.00, '7', 'The Dhan Vriddhi Bracelet is designed to attract abundance and positive energy. Made with pyrite, jade, sunstone, quartz, red carnelian, and tiger eye, this bracelet supports wealth, confidence, and clarity. It’s perfect for daily wear, meditation, or as a meaningful gift. Keep it close to enhance focus, balance emotions, and invite prosperity into your life.', '1. Encourages abundance, wealth, and positive energy throughout daily life\n2. Supports emotional balance and mental clarity for better decision-making\n3. Strengthens confidence, motivation, and focus in personal and professional life\n4. Perfect for meditation, rituals, or as a thoughtful, meaningful gift', '1. Wear the Dhan Vriddhi bracelet on your wrist daily for energy support\n2. Keep it close during meditation or manifestation practices for focus\n3. Recharge the bracelet regularly using a selenite plate or sunlight exposure\n4. Avoid water and harsh chemicals to maintain stone quality and longevity', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet_1.png', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet_2.png', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet_3.png', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet_4.jpg', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet_6.png', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet_7.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(74, 'Dhan Yog Bracelet with Selenite Plate', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate', 1699.00, 999.00, '14', 'The Sampurn Dhan Combo brings together the Dhan Yog Bracelet and a selenite plate to attract abundance and positive energy. This combo helps maintain balanced energy, supports clarity, and enhances spiritual growth. Perfect for daily wear or home rituals, it keeps your spiritual tools energized and your environment calm, making it ideal for meditation, manifestation, or personal growth practices', '1.Attracts abundance, prosperity, and positive energy into daily life naturally\n2.Maintains balanced energy and clarity in home or workspace environments\n3.Cleanses and recharges spiritual tools like crystals and jewelry effectively\n4.Ideal for meditation, manifestation practices, and enhancing focus daily', '1.Wear the Dhan Yog Bracelet daily to invite abundance and positive energy\n2.Place the selenite plate in your home or workspace to cleanse energy\n3.Keep the bracelet on the selenite plate overnight for easy recharging\n4.Clean gently with a dry cloth and avoid water to protect the items', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate_1.png', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate_2.png', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate_3.png', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate_4.png', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate_6.png', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-with-selenite-plate_7.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(75, 'Dhan Vriddhi Gift Box', 'dhan-vriddhi-gift-box', 899.00, 899.00, '5', 'The Diya & Charan combo is a divine and aesthetic set that beautifully blends tradition with spirituality. It includes a Laxmi Charan Paduka symbolizing Goddess Lakshmi’s blessings, and two brass diyas that radiate light and positivity. Perfect for your pooja room, office, or as a festive gift, this combo adds charm, prosperity, and peace to your life.', 'Attracts prosperity, peace, and abundance with Laxmi Charan Paduka.\nCreates a sacred and positive environment with brass diyas.\nEnhances focus, devotion, and spiritual connection during puja and meditation.\nAesthetic, stylish, and timeless decor piece for home, shop, or office.', 'Place the Laxmi Charan Paduka in your puja room, cash box, or at the entrance for blessings.\nLight the brass diyas with oil or ghee and cotton wicks during pooja, meditation, or daily prayers.\nUse the combo during festivals like Diwali, Lakshmi Puja, or housewarming rituals for added auspiciousness.\nKeep the diyas and paduka clean with a soft cloth; avoid harsh chemicals to maintain their shine.\nFor positivity, place the set together in your home temple, shop counter, or office desk.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-vriddhi-gift-box', 'dhan-vridhi-gift-box_1.jpg', 'dhan-vridhi-gift-box_2.jpg', 'dhan-vridhi-gift-box_3.jpg', 'dhan-vridhi-gift-box_5.jpg', 'dhan-vridhi-gift-box_6.jpg', 'dhan-vridhi-gift-box_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(76, 'Red Jasper Bracelet', 'red-jasper-bracelet', 1999.00, 699.00, '7,35,29', 'This luxurious Red Jasper Bracelet is a beautiful red crystal bracelet designed to bring balance and positivity into your life. With its natural healing properties, this red jasper crystal bracelet is perfect for daily wear. It keeps you grounded, protected, and connected to inner strength.', 'Boosts energy and focus, helping you stay strong and overcome challenges. Provides stability and grounding, giving you a sense of security and peace. Protects against negativity, helping you stay emotionally balanced and positive. Reduces anxiety, promoting inner calm, and supporting a peaceful, secure mindset.', 'Wear the red jasper bracelet on your left hand for energy balance. \nCleanse the bracelet regularly by keeping it under running water briefly. \nRecharge its energy by placing the red crystal bracelet in sunlight. \nUse during meditation to connect with grounding and calming vibrations', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'red-jasper-bracelet', 'red-jasper-bracelet_1.jpg', 'red-jasper-bracelet_2.jpg', 'red-jasper-bracelet_3.jpg', 'red-jasper-bracelet_4.jpg', 'red-jasper-bracelet_5.jpg', 'red-jasper-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(77, 'Turquoise Bracelet', 'turquoise-bracelet', 1999.00, 599.00, '42,7,43', 'This turquoise bracelet is made with genuine turquoise beads, known for their protective and healing properties. It promotes calm, balance, and positive energy. A beautiful turquoise crystal bracelet that offers emotional strength, spiritual grounding, and everyday style for those who value wellness and peace.', 'Protects against negative energy Enhances communication, decision-making, and leadership skills Boosts confidence and inner strength daily Promotes calmness, emotional stability, and balance', 'Wear the turquoise bracelet on any of your wrists to invite positive energy \nCleanse the bracelet regularly with warm, soapy water and a soft-bristle brush. \nRecharge it in moonlight for a few hours monthly \nUse during meditation for emotional healing and clarity', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'turquoise-bracelet', 'turquoise-bracelet_1.jpg', 'turquoise-bracelet_2.jpg', 'turquoise-bracelet_3.jpg', 'turquoise-bracelet_4.jpg', 'turquoise-bracelet_5.jpg', 'turquoise-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(78, 'Siddh Karungali Mala 108 Beads & Bracelet Combo - 6mm Beads', 'siddh-karungali-mala-108-beads-and-bracelet-combo-6mm-beads', 1999.00, 1149.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple. Experience spiritual harmony with the Karungali Malai 108 Beads &; Karungali Bracelet Combo. Perfect for meditation and daily wear, this set promotes positive energy and inner peace. Crafted with care, it combines tradition and elegance, making it a meaningful gift for yourself or your loved ones seeking balance and focus.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-karungali-mala-108-beads-and-bracelet-combo-6mm-beads', 'siddh-karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_1.png', 'siddh-karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_2.png', 'siddh-karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_3.png', 'siddh-karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_4.png', 'siddh-karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_6.png', 'siddh-karungali-malai-108-beads-bracelet-combo_7.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(79, 'Rahu Ketu Bracelet', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet', 2999.00, 999.00, '7,29,31', 'The Rahu Ketu Bracelet is designed to bring balance, positivity, and protection into your life. Wearing this bracelet may help reduce negativity and create a calming energy around you. Crafted with care, it is ideal for those seeking peace, stability, and spiritual strength in daily life.', 'Helps balance planetary influences for improved peace and stability. \nProtects against negative energy and harmful vibrations. \nEnhances focus and supports emotional well-being throughout the day. \nEncourages spiritual growth and inner strength in challenging situations.', 'Wear the bracelet on your right hand to attract positive energy. \nDip it into the bowl of milk or the Gangajal, then rinse it with normal running water. \nRecharge under moonlight to strengthen its calming and protective vibrations. \nAvoid sharing with others to preserve personal energy alignment and benefits.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet_1.jpg', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet_2.jpg', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet_3.jpg', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet_4.jpg', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet_5.jpg', 'rahu-ketu-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(80, 'Pyrite Pendant', 'pyrite-pendant', 1499.00, 1099.00, '28,24,21', 'The trendy Pyrite Drop Pendant is known for attracting wealth, success, and protective energy. Often called “Fool’s Gold,” it radiates confidence and strength while keeping negativity away. Its metallic shine and included chain make it stylish, powerful, and perfect for everyday wear or a thoughtful gifting option.', 'Attracts financial growth, prosperity, and new opportunities with ease. \nProtects against negativity and unwanted energy influences. \nBoosts willpower, motivation, and self-confidence in daily challenges. \nA versatile pendant with a chain that blends elegant style and crystal healing properties.', 'Wear the pendant daily to attract money, luck, and protective vibrations. \nCleanse with incense or natural water to refresh its positive energy. \nRecharge it in sunlight, moonlight, or on selenite; avoid water, and use smoke or sound to cleanse. \nAvoid exposure to harsh chemicals, perfumes to preserve its natural golden sparkle', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-pendant', 'pyrite-drop-pendant_1.png', 'pyrite-drop-pendant_2.png', 'pyrite-drop-pendant_3.png', 'pyrite-drop-pendant_4.png', 'pyrite-drop-pendant_5.png', 'pyrite-drop-pendant_6.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(81, 'Citrine Pendant', 'citrine-pendant', 1499.00, 1199.00, '29,28,24', 'This stylish Citrine Pendant (along with the chain) is known as the stone of abundance and positivity. Wearing this pendant helps attract prosperity, success, and joy into your life. Its golden glow adds elegance while uplifting your spirit, making it an ideal choice for daily wear and a thoughtful gifting option', 'Attracts wealth, success, and opportunities for personal growth. \nBoosts confidence and encourages a positive, motivated outlook. \nPromotes emotional clarity and reduces stress in daily life. \nElegant accessory that carries uplifting, good luck vibrations.', 'Wear the pendant daily to invite prosperity, happiness, and positive energy. \nSoak the pendant in soapy water, scrub gently, rinse, and dry with a cloth. \nRecharge the pendant by keeping it under the sun or moon, or visualize positive intentions. \nAvoid rough handling to protect the crystal’s natural shine and structure.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'citrine-pendant', 'citrine-pendant_1.jpg', 'citrine-pendant_2.jpg', 'citrine-pendant_3.jpg', 'citrine-pendant_4.jpg', 'citrine-pendant_5.jpg', 'citrine-pendant_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(82, 'Brass Laxmi Idol', 'brass-laxmi-idol', 999.00, 999.00, '4,5', 'The brass Laxmi Idol is a beautifully crafted murti that radiates divine blessings, prosperity, and peace. Designed with premium-quality brass, this Lakshmi idol is perfect for pooja, home decor, or gifting. Aesthetic and trendy, it enhances positivity, attracts abundance, and brings harmony, making it an ideal addition to your sacred space.', 'Invites wealth, prosperity, and good fortune into your home or office.\nEnhances positivity, harmony, and divine energy in your surroundings.\nActs as an aesthetic and spiritual decor piece for homes, offices, or temples.\nBrings blessings of Goddess Lakshmi for success, abundance, and peace.', 'Place the Brass Lakshmi Idol in your pooja room, altar, or living area for divine blessings.\nKeep the Laxmi Murti clean and polished with a soft dry cloth to maintain its shine.\nUse during daily pooja or other auspicious rituals for prosperity.\nCombine with incense, diyas, or flowers to create a divine and aesthetic spiritual setup.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'brass-laxmi-idol', 'brass-laxmi-idol_1.jpg', 'brass-laxmi-idol_2.jpg', 'brass-laxmi-idol_3.jpg', 'brass-laxmi-idol_5.jpg', 'brass-laxmi-idol_6.jpg', 'brass-laxmi-idol_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
