(84, 'Raw Moroccan Selenite Plate', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate', 1199.00, 599.00, '5', 'The Raw Moroccan Selenite Plate is a natural crystal that is known for its calm and positive energy. It comes from Morocco and can be used to place your jewelry, crystals, or spiritual items to charge. Keep it nearby to refresh the energy in your home, office, or meditation area, helping you feel peaceful, relaxed, and focused every day.', '1.Helps cleanse negative energy from surrounding spaces naturally and gently.\n2.Supports a calm, peaceful atmosphere for daily routines and meditation.\n3.Useful for recharging crystals, jewelry, and spiritual accessories.\n4.Enhances decor with a raw, natural, and minimal crystal appearance.', '1.Place the raw Moroccan selenite plate in your room or workspace\n2.Keep crystals or jewelry on the plate to cleanse and recharge them\n3.Use during meditation by placing it nearby for a calming environment\n4.Clean gently using a dry cloth and avoid contact with water', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate_1.png', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate_2.png', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate_3.png', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate_4.png', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate_6.png', 'raw-moroccan-selenite-plate_7.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(85, 'Carnelian Bracelet', 'carnelian-bracelet', 1999.00, 499.00, '33,7', 'This bracelet features natural Carnelian beads paired with a zodiac charm for Aries. Known for its vibrant orange-red color, it symbolizes courage, vitality, and passion. Designed as a stylish accessory, it combines astrology and elegance, making it perfect for daily wear or as a gift item.', 'Boosts confidence and encourages bold decision-making. Enhances motivation and supports creativity in daily life. Promotes emotional balance and reduces feelings of doubt.', 'Wear on your left wrist to align with Aries energy and vitality. \nUse during meditation or affirmations to boost focus and motivation. \nCleanse regularly with clean water or sage to refresh crystal energy. \nRecharge under moonlight to restore Carnelian’s natural strength and positivity.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'carnelian-bracelet', 'carnelian-bracelet_1.jpg', 'carnelian-bracelet_2.jpg', 'carnelian-bracelet_3.jpg', 'carnelian-bracelet_4.jpg', 'carnelian-bracelet_5.jpg', 'carnelian-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
