(88, 'Virgo Combo', 'virgo-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4,37', 'The Virgo Combo features a Virgo Malachite Pendant and Virgo Malachite Bracelet designed to bring protection, transformation, and balance. Known as the stone of growth, Malachite helps Virgos embrace clarity and strength. This beautiful yet aesthetic set is also a perfect gifting choice for those who value meaningful jewelry.', 'Encourages transformation, emotional healing, and inner strength for Virgo natives.\n Aesthetic Malachite Bracelet and Pendant blending protective energy with stylish elegance.\n Shields against negativity while promoting clarity in thoughts and actions.', 'Wear the Malachite Bracelet on your right wrist to attract protection and positivity.\n Keep the Virgo Malachite Pendant close to your heart to embrace growth and balance.\n Wipe gently with a soft cloth to maintain shine and natural green hues.\n Recharge under sunlight on a selenite plate or incense smoke to restore the gemstone’s protective energies.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'virgo-combo', 'virgo-combo_1.jpg', 'virgo-combo_2.jpg', 'virgo-combo_3.jpg', 'virgo-combo_4.jpg', 'virgo-combo_5.jpg', 'virgo-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
