(95, 'Siddh 7 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant', 2499.00, 1149.00, '16', 'The 7 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant is known for bringing prosperity, wealth, and positive energy. It is believed to help reduce stress, balance emotions, and support overall well-being. This pendant has been energized by an experienced jyotish through sacred Vedic rituals at a temple, filling the pendant with positive vibrations. Beautifully crafted, it comes with a chain, making it easy to wear daily or gift to loved ones with blessings.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant_1.jpg', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant_2.jpg', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant_3.jpg', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant_4.jpg', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant_5.jpg', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(96, 'Cleansed Energy Nazar Set', 'cleansed-energy-nazar-set', 2998.00, 1099.00, '14,19', 'This trendy Evil Eye Bracelet with Evil Eye Charging Plate (A Selenite Plate with an Evil Eye Symbol) is your all-in-one protection booster combo. The Evil Eye Bracelet shields you from negativity, while the Selenite Plate recharges and cleanses its energy. Aesthetic, purposeful, and perfect for gifting, this combo balances protection with positive vibes every day.', 'Acts as a powerful protection booster by blocking negative energies around you.\nThe Selenite Charging Plate cleanses and recharges the bracelet’s healing energy.\nEnhances peace, positivity, and emotional balance throughout your day.\nA trendy, meaningful combo that’s also perfect for gifting loved ones.', 'Wear the Evil Eye Bracelet on your left wrist to attract positive energy.\nPlace the bracelet on the Evil Eye Selenite Charging Plate overnight to recharge its strength.\nCleanse both items regularly with incense smoke or moonlight for better results.\nAvoid contact with water or perfume to maintain the shine and quality.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'cleansed-energy-nazar-set', 'evil-eye-bracelet-charging-plate_1.png', 'evil-eye-bracelet-charging-plate_2.png', 'evil-eye-bracelet-charging-plate_3.png', 'evil-eye-bracelet-charging-plate_4.png', 'evil-eye-bracelet-charging-plate_5.png', 'evil-eye-bracelet-charging-plate_6.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(97, 'Navgrah Bracelet & Raw Pyrite Bracelet', 'navgrah-bracelet-and-raw-pyrite-bracelet', 2999.00, 1449.00, '7,14,4,21', 'This stylish bracelet combo brings together the Navgrah Bracelet for balanced energy and the Raw Pyrite Bracelet for grounding and focus. Wear daily to stay centered, enhance confidence, and add a meaningful accessory to your look.', 'Navgrah Bracelet enhances harmony by balancing energies naturally and effectively.\nRaw Pyrite Bracelet supports confidence, mental clarity, and focus in daily life.\nDurable and lightweight, perfect for adding style and positive energy every day.', 'Wear the bracelets together or separately on your dominant hand to stabilize energy flow.\nUse during meditation or yoga for enhanced focus and grounding.\nCleanse the combo by placing it under the moonlight to restore its energy and maximize its benefits.\nGently wipe with a soft cloth to maintain the natural shine of the stones and ensure long-lasting durability.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'navgrah-bracelet-and-raw-pyrite-bracelet', 'navgrah-bracelet-raw-pyrite-bracelet_1.jpg', 'navgrah-bracelet-raw-pyrite-bracelet_2.jpg', 'navgrah-bracelet-raw-pyrite-bracelet_3.png', 'navgrah-bracelet-raw-pyrite-bracelet_4.jpg', 'navgrah-bracelet-raw-pyrite-bracelet_5.jpg', 'navgrah-bracelet-raw-pyrite-bracelet_6.png', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(98, 'Navgrah Bracelet & Rose Quartz Bracelet', 'navgrah-bracelet-and-rose-quartz-bracelet', 2999.00, 1249.00, '14', 'This visually appealing bracelet duo combines the Navgrah Bracelet’s balanced energy with the Rose Quartz Bracelet’s soothing charm. Aesthetic and stylish, this combo is perfect to rock any outfit while keeping positive and harmonious vibes close. Consider it a meaningful and fashionable accessory that brings positivity.', 'Navgrah Bracelet helps maintain energetic balance for overall well-being daily.\nRose Quartz Bracelet promotes calmness, self-love, and emotional harmony naturally.\nLightweight and durable, suitable for everyday wear with any outfit.', 'Wear the bracelets on your dominant hand to channel energies effectively.\nKeep them close to your skin for optimal energy absorption and balance.\nRecharge under sunlight or moonlight on a selenite regularly to maintain positive vibes.\nClean gently with a soft cloth to preserve aesthetics and longevity.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'navgrah-bracelet-and-rose-quartz-bracelet', 'navgrah-rose-quartz-bracelet_1.jpg', 'navgrah-rose-quartz-bracelet_2.jpg', 'navgrah-rose-quartz-bracelet_3.jpg', 'navgrah-rose-quartz-bracelet_4.png', 'navgrah-rose-quartz-bracelet_5.jpg', 'navgrah-rose-quartz-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(99, 'Howlite Bracelet', 'howlite-bracelet', 1999.00, 599.00, '7,41', 'Make the Howlite Bracelet your companion for peace and calm. Each bead works to ease stress, quiet restless thoughts, and bring balance to your emotions. A gentle boost of positivity flows through this crystal bracelet, helping you stay centered and composed. Wear it, feel lighter, live calmer.', 'Attracts good luck and prosperity Supports relaxation and centeredness Stimulates knowledge and aids meditation Enhances mental clarity and improves sleep', 'Wear the bracelet on your dominant wrist. \nRecharge it overnight under moonlight. \nOccasionally, place it in salt (or salt water) to cleanse and activate its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'howlite-bracelet', 'howlite-bracelet_1.jpg', 'howlite-bracelet_2.jpg', 'howlite-bracelet_3.jpg', 'howlite-bracelet_4.jpg', 'howlite-bracelet_5.jpg', 'howlite-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(100, 'Money Coin', 'money-coin', 699.00, 649.00, '28', 'Bring wealth and prosperity into your life with the Money Coin. This powerful coin is believed to attract financial success and good fortune. Whether placed at home, in your wallet, or at your office desk, it’s a simple yet effective way to invite abundance and positive energy into your life.', 'Helps attract wealth and financial opportunities into your life. \nActs as a powerful magnet for good fortune and prosperity. \nEnergizes your surroundings, promoting financial well-being.', 'Place the coin in your wallet, purse, or cash box for financial luck. \nKeep it in your office or business space to attract wealth and growth. \nRecharge it under the full moon or on a selenite plate for enhanced energy. \nCarry it with you during important meetings or transactions for success.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'money-coin', 'money-coin_1.jpg', 'money-coin_2.jpg', 'money-coin_3.jpg', 'money-coin_4.jpg', 'money-coin_5.jpg', 'money-coin_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1);
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `product_name`, `slug`, `price`, `sale_price`, `categories`, `description`, `benefit`, `how_to_use`, `return_exchange`, `disclaimer`, `photo_folder`, `photo1`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `is_in_stock`, `product_review`, `is_ratti`, `is_active`) VALUES
(101, 'Shree Dhan Samriddhi Box', 'shree-dhan-samriddhi-box', 999.00, 799.00, '5', 'Enhance prosperity, positivity, and business growth with the Diya & Yantra Combo. Featuring the Vyapar Vruddhi Yantra (aka Mahalaxmi Yantra) and traditional brass diyas, this set attracts wealth, success, and divine blessings. Ideal for homes, offices, or shops, it also makes a thoughtful gift option for loved ones seeking abundance, stability, and spiritual energy in their daily lives.', 'Combo of a brass diya with Vyapar Vruddhi Yantra is crafted to bring wealth and prosperity.\nInvites positive energy and abundance into homes, offices, or shops.\nHelps strengthen financial growth and business opportunities effectively.\nMakes a meaningful and thoughtful gift for loved ones or clients.', 'Place the yantra on a clean altar and diyas nearby, facing east.\nLight the diya with ghee or oil while performing daily prayers or rituals.\nChant simple mantras to energize the Vyapar Vruddhi Yantra for the best results.\nKeep the combo in shops or offices to enhance financial and spiritual energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'shree-dhan-samriddhi-box', 'shree-dhan-samriddhi-box_1.jpg', 'shree-dhan-samriddhi-box_2.jpg', 'shree-dhan-samriddhi-box_5.jpg', 'shree-dhan-samriddhi-box_6.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(102, 'Pyrite Raw Stone', 'pyrite-raw-stone', 999.00, 799.00, '28,21', 'The Raw Pyrite Stone is known for its natural ability to attract wealth, abundance, and prosperity. Often called “Fool’s Gold,” this powerful stone enhances confidence and helps in manifesting financial success. Its raw form maintains the stone’s natural energy, making it a perfect tool for grounding and protection.', 'Pyrite stone helps attract wealth and financial prosperity into your life. \nKnown for boosting confidence, motivation, and positive energy. \nProtects against negative energy and promotes an optimistic mindset.', 'Place the raw Pyrite stone in your business space or workspace to boost financial growth. \nKeep the Pyrite stone in your wallet or cash box to attract prosperity and wealth. \nRecharge the stone on a selenite plate or under the full moon to enhance its energy. \nUse during meditation to clear negativity and invite positive financial energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-raw-stone', 'pyrite-raw-stone_1.jpg', 'pyrite-raw-stone_2.jpg', 'pyrite-raw-stone_3.jpg', 'pyrite-raw-stone_4.jpg', 'pyrite-raw-stone_5.jpg', 'pyrite-raw-stone_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(103, 'Lord Murugan Vel Pendant | Silver Cap Karungali Mala', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala', 1499.00, 849.00, '18,6', 'The Karungali Mala with Divine Lord Murugan Vel Pendant is a traditional accessory designed for those who like spiritual symbols in their daily wear. The mala is made with natural karungali wood beads, often used in devotional accessories, and comes with a Vel pendant linked with Lord Murugan, which represents courage, discipline, and protection. The simple design makes it comfortable to wear during prayer, travel, or daily routine while keeping a devotional symbol close.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nDevotees of Lord Murugan\n\nPeople who wear spiritual malas\n\nIndividuals who prefer traditional accessories\n\nAnyone looking for devotional daily wear\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nKarungali Wood Beads with Premium Metal Vel Pendant\n\nDimension\n\n54 Beads\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear around the neck daily\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala_1.jpg', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala_2.jpg', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala_3.jpg', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala_4.jpg', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala_5.jpg', 'lord-murugan-vel-pendant-silver-cap-karungali-mala_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(104, 'Gemini Combo', 'gemini-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,9,2004', 'The Gemini Combo features a Gemini Lapis Lazuli Pendant and Gemini Lapis Lazuli Bracelet designed to bring wisdom, clarity, and positivity. This trendy and aesthetic set enhances communication skills while complementing your style. A thoughtful keepsake, it also makes a perfect gifting choice for Gemini natives or gemstone lovers.', 'Boosts wisdom, clarity of thought, and better decision-making abilities.\n Enhances communication skills, creativity, and self-expression for Geminis.\n Aesthetic gemstone jewelry that blends healing with fashionable everyday wear.\n Perfect gifting option for Gemini friends who value both style and energy.', 'Wear the Lapis Lazuli bracelet on your right wrist to attract positive vibrations.\n Keep the Lapis Lazuli pendant near your heart to encourage clarity and wisdom.\n Clean regularly with a soft cloth to maintain gemstone shine and aesthetic look.\n Recharge under moonlight on a selenite plate or incense smoke every few weeks for renewed effectiveness.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gemini-combo', 'gemini-combo_1.jpg', 'gemini-combo_2.jpg', 'gemini-combo_3.jpg', 'gemini-combo_4.png', 'gemini-combo_5.jpg', 'gemini-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(105, 'Aries Combo', 'aries-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '33,14,4', 'Empower your zodiac energy with our Aries Combo, featuring an Aries Carnelian Pendant and Aries Carnelian Bracelet. Carnelian is known for boosting courage, motivation, and vitality. This thoughtfully curated Aries set makes a stylish accessory and a meaningful gift for those born under the Aries zodiac sign.', 'Aries Combo includes Carnelian Pendant and Bracelet for complete zodiac balance.\n Carnelian stone believed to boost courage, energy, and personal strength.\n Stylish accessory set blending gemstone beauty with zodiac alignment.\n Thoughtful gift choice for Aries birthdays, festivals, and special occasions.', 'Wear the Aries Carnelian Pendant to carry protective and empowering energies.\n Pair the Aries Carnelian Bracelet daily for courage and motivational support.\n Combine pendant and bracelet for enhanced zodiac alignment and positive energy.\n Clean both jewelry pieces gently with a soft cloth to maintain shine.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'aries-combo', 'aries-combo_1.jpg', 'aries-combo_2.jpg', 'aries-combo_3.jpg', 'aries-combo_4.jpg', 'aries-combo_5.jpg', 'aries-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(106, 'Copper Karungali Mala - 54 Beads, 8mm', 'copper-karungali-mala-54-beads-8mm', 999.00, 699.00, '18,6', 'The Copper Karungali Mala without cap  made for those who prefer simple spiritual accessories with a neat and traditional look. The mala is crafted with authentic karungali wood beads, which are commonly used in devotional malas, and finished with gold-plated elements that give it a clean and polished appearance. Many people wear karungali malas during prayer, meditation, or their daily routine as a reminder to stay calm and steady. The lightweight design makes it comfortable to wear for long hours without feeling heavy.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nPeople who wear spiritual malas\n\nIndividuals who like traditional accessories\n\nDevotees who use a mala during prayer\n\nAnyone looking for a daily wear mala\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nKarungali Wood Beads with Premium copper\n\nDimension\n\n54 Beads\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear around the neck daily\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'copper-karungali-mala-54-beads-8mm', 'copper-karungali-mala_1.jpg', 'copper-karungali-mala_2.jpg', 'copper-karungali-mala_3.jpg', 'copper-karungali-mala_4.jpg', 'copper-karungali-mala_5.jpg', 'copper-karungali-mala_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(107, 'Dhan Yog Bracelet Full Power Set', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-full-power-set', 2499.00, 1549.00, '14', 'Focused wealth-building requires both action and energetic clarity. The Dhan Yog Bracelet, made from natural stones - Citrine, Tiger Eye, Clear Quartz, Green Jade, Green Aventurine, and a Raw Pyrite are associated with attracting financial success and strengthening abundance-focused intentions. And, with it, the Charging Plate will cleanse and recharge your bracelet to maintain clarity and alignment. Together, this combo supports disciplined effort, refreshed energy, and steady financial focus in your personal growth journey.\n\n \n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Individuals focused on attracting wealth opportunities\n\nProfessionals building financial discipline\n\nThose who prefer recharging their spiritual accessories\n\nAnyone seeking a prosperity-focused personal set\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Citrine, Tiger Eye, Clear Quartz, Green Jade, Green Aventurine, and a Raw Pyrite\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm Bead, Dia - 7cm, Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nHow to use\n\nWear bracelet daily; keep plate in clean personal space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place bracelet on plate overnight for cleansing', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-full-power-set', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-raw-moroccan-selenite-plate-combo_1.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-raw-moroccan-selenite-plate-combo_2.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-raw-moroccan-selenite-plate-combo_3.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-raw-moroccan-selenite-plate-combo_4.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-raw-moroccan-selenite-plate-combo_6.jpg', 'dhan-yog-bracelet-raw-moroccan-selenite-plate-combo_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(108, 'Dhan Vriddhi Bracelet & Selenite Plate Combo', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-and-selenite-plate-combo', 1999.00, 799.00, '14', 'Growth feels stronger when it is supported with intention. This combination of the Dhan Vridhi Bracelet and Selenite Plate allows you to wear your wealth focus daily and refresh its energy regularly.\nMade using natural stones, the bracelet represents discipline, confidence, and financial growth. The Selenite Plate, valued for its cleansing properties, helps maintain energetic clarity,keeping your wealth intentions aligned and renewed.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals focused on structured and consistent wealth growth\n\nProfessionals who value both intention and discipline\n\nThose who prefer certified product with a recharging option\n\nAnyone choosing a complete prosperity-inspired gift set\n\nMaterial\n\nClear Quartz, Pyrite, Carnelian, Tiger’s Eye, Black Onyx, Green Aventurine, Rose Quartz and Selenite Charging Plate for Crystals\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm Bead, Dia - 7cm, Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-and-selenite-plate-combo', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-selenite-plate-combo_1.jpg', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-selenite-plate-combo_2.jpg', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-selenite-plate-combo_3.jpg', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-selenite-plate-combo_4.jpg', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-selenite-plate-combo_5.jpg', 'dhan-vriddhi-bracelet-selenite-plate-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(109, 'Sagittarius combo', 'sagittarius-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4,40', 'The Sagittarius Combo features a Sagittarius Labradorite Pendant and Sagittarius Labradorite Bracelet designed for adventure seekers and dreamers. Known as the stone of transformation, Labradorite inspires intuition and creativity. This eye catching jewelry set adds a mystical charm and makes a perfect gifting choice for free-spirited souls.', 'Sparks creativity and helps Sagittarius natives embrace their adventurous side.\n Aesthetic Labradorite Pendant and Bracelet that glow with natural mystical hues.\n Supports spiritual growth and strengthens intuitive abilities for better decisions.', 'Wear the Labradorite Bracelet on your wrist to enhance intuition and inner vision.\n Keep the Sagittarius Labradorite Pendant close to your heart to invite inspiration daily.\n Gently clean with a soft cloth to preserve its natural shimmering colors.\n Recharge by placing under moonlight on a selenite plate to restore its magical transformative energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'sagittarius-combo', 'sagittarius-combo_1.jpg', 'sagittarius-combo_2.jpg', 'sagittarius-combo_3.jpg', 'sagittarius-combo_4.jpg', 'sagittarius-combo_5.jpg', 'sagittarius-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(110, 'Taurus Combo', 'taurus-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4,34', 'This Taurus Combo features a beautiful combination of a Taurus Bracelet and Pendant made from Rhodonite. Known for bringing balance, love, and emotional strength, this set is designed especially for Taureans. If you\'re a Taurean, you can wear them daily or gift them to someone to enhance positivity, inner peace, and confidence while aligning with your zodiac energy.', 'Promotes emotional healing and helps maintain inner peace and stability.\n Boosts confidence, self-love, and nurtures healthier personal relationships.\n Attracts positive energy and aligns with Taurus zodiac vibrations.\n Supports stress relief and encourages a calm, balanced mindset.', 'Wear the Taurus bracelet on your right hand for best astrological benefits.\n Keep the Taurus pendant close to your heart to absorb calming Rhodonite energy.\n Cleanse the bracelet and pendant regularly using clean water and soft cloth.\n Recharge them by placing under moonlight or with gentle incense smoke occasionally.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'taurus-combo', 'taurus-combo_1.jpg', 'taurus-combo_2.jpg', 'taurus-combo_3.jpg', 'taurus-combo_4.jpg', 'taurus-combo_5.jpg', 'taurus-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(111, 'Lapis Lazuli Pendant', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '29,9,31,24', 'The lapis lazuli pendant is known for its deep blue beauty and powerful energy. It enhances wisdom, truth, and self-expression while calming the mind. This lightweight and aesthetically pleasing stainless steel-encased pendant is perfect for everyday wear and makes a great gift. Add elegance to your outfit while supporting emotional clarity and spiritual growth.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant_1.jpg', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant_2.jpg', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant_3.jpg', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant_4.jpg', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant_5.jpg', 'lapis-lazuli-pendant_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(112, 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet & Pendant Combo', 'gold-plated-evil-eye-bracelet-and-pendant-combo', 3999.00, 2499.00, '14,19,24', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet & Pendant Combo is designed for those who prefer simple, meaningful accessories for everyday wear. Many have experienced the power of the evil eye symbol for centuries and the way it has been protecting from negativity and bad vibes, making it a popular choice in daily jewelry.\n\nCrafted in pure brass with a gold-toned finish, both the bracelet and pendant offer a clean and minimal look that pairs easily with modern and traditional outfits. Wearing them together allows you to carry the symbol consistently throughout your day, whether at work, travel, or social occasions.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nThose who prefer minimal and symbolic jewelry\n\nIndividuals looking for everyday protection accessories\n\nPeople who like matching jewelry sets\n\nAnyone searching for a meaningful gift option\n\n \n\nAttribute\n\nDetails\n\nMaterial\n\nPure Brass with Gold Plating\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: Adjustable Fit\nPendant: Diameter - 2.3 cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear bracelet on wrist and pendant around your neck\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfume, and chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gold-plated-evil-eye-bracelet-and-pendant-combo', 'evil-eye-brass-bracelet-pendant-combo_1.jpg', 'evil-eye-brass-bracelet-pendant-combo_2.jpg', 'evil-eye-brass-bracelet-pendant-combo_3.jpg', 'evil-eye-brass-bracelet-pendant-combo_4.jpg', 'evil-eye-brass-bracelet-pendant-combo_5.jpg', 'evil-eye-brass-bracelet-pendant-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(113, 'Siddh Karungali Mala - 108 Beads, 8mm', 'siddh-karungali-mala-108-beads-8mm', 1499.00, 1149.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.Experience the divine power of the Karungali Mala, made from original ebony wood. This karungali mala 108 beads is known for its spiritual protection and positive vibrations. Perfect for meditation or daily wear, it helps balance energy, boost confidence, and attract prosperity while shielding against negative influences.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-karungali-mala-108-beads-8mm', 'siddh-karungali-mala_1.jpg', 'siddh-karungali-mala_2.jpg', 'siddh-karungali-mala_3.jpg', 'siddh-karungali-mala_4.jpg', 'siddh-karungali-mala_6.jpg', 'siddh-karungali-mala_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
