(117, 'Amethyst & Dhan Yog Bracelet', 'amethyst-and-dhan-yog-bracelet', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4', 'This Amethyst Bracelet & Dhan Yog Bracelet Combo blends style with purpose, making it an ideal choice for gifting bracelets or couple bracelets. The amethyst bracelet is valued for calmness and balance, while the dhan yog bracelet symbolizes prosperity and money magnetism. Together, these combo bracelets bring harmony, energy, and good fortune to the wearer’s life.', 'Enhances calmness, focus, and emotional balance in daily activities. \n Attracts money, prosperity, abundance, and stability for financial well-being. \n Strengthens relationships and makes a thoughtful, meaningful gifting option. \n Supports spiritual growth while maintaining harmony in personal life.', 'Wear both bracelets together or individually, depending on your energy needs. \n Keep them cleansed by gently wiping with a soft cloth after regular use. \n Recharge the amethyst bracelet under moonlight and dhan yog bracelet under sunlight once monthly. \n Store safely in a soft pouch to avoid scratches or energy disruption.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-and-dhan-yog-bracelet', 'amethyst-dhan-yog-bracelet_1.jpg', 'amethyst-dhan-yog-bracelet_2.jpg', 'amethyst-dhan-yog-bracelet_3.jpg', 'amethyst-dhan-yog-bracelet_4.jpg', 'amethyst-dhan-yog-bracelet_5.jpg', 'amethyst-dhan-yog-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(118, 'Capricorn Combo', 'capricorn-combo', 1999.00, 1549.00, '41,14', 'The Capricorn Combo includes a Capricorn Howlite Bracelet and a Capricorn Howlite Pendant, designed for calmness and focus. Known for its soothing energy, Howlite helps reduce stress and promotes clarity. With its classy and mesmerizing look, this combo is also a perfect gift for hardworking and ambitious Capricorns.', 'Brings emotional balance and supports Capricorns in handling daily challenges.\n Elegant Howlite Bracelet and Pendant crafted for both style and spiritual benefits.\n Enhances patience, focus, and promotes a calmer state of mind.', 'Wear the Howlite Bracelet on your wrist to encourage inner peace and focus.\n Keep the Capricorn Howlite Pendant close to the heart for balanced emotional energy.\n Clean gently with a soft dry cloth to maintain its natural white beauty.\n Recharge under moonlight on a selenite plate to restore calming vibrations.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'capricorn-combo', 'capricorn-combo_1.jpg', 'capricorn-combo_2.jpg', 'capricorn-combo_3.jpg', 'capricorn-combo_4.jpg', 'capricorn-combo_5.jpg', 'capricorn-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(119, 'Scorpius Combo', 'scorpius-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4,39', 'The Scorpius Black Obsidian Pendant and Scorpius Black Obsidian Bracelet form a bold combo designed for those who love elegance with purpose. Known for its deep black shine, this classy yet trendy gemstone jewelry adds strength to your look and is also a perfect gifting choice for the ones you care about.', 'Encourages determination and helps Scorpios stay focused on life goals.\n Aesthetic gemstone jewelry that doubles as a stylish everyday accessory.\n Boosts self-confidence while supporting resilience during emotional challenges.', 'Slip on the Black Obsidian Bracelet to complement outfits with protection and strength.\n Wear the Black Obsidian Pendant close to your chest for balance throughout the day.\n Avoid harsh chemicals while cleaning to preserve gemstone’s natural finish and brilliance.\n Place under moonlight occasionally on a selenite plate to renew its grounding and stabilizing energies.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'scorpius-combo', 'scorpio-combo_1.jpg', 'scorpio-combo_2.jpg', 'scorpio-combo_3.jpg', 'scorpio-combo_4.jpg', 'scorpio-combo_5.jpg', 'scorpio-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(120, 'Leo Combo', 'leo-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4,36', 'The Leo Combo includes a Leo Yellow Aventurine Bracelet and Yellow Aventurine Pendant, designed to boost confidence and vitality. Known as a stone of courage, Aventurine supports Leos in embracing leadership. This trendy and aesthetic combo is not only uplifting but also a perfect gifting choice for loved ones.', 'Boosts confidence, courage, and helps express natural Leo leadership qualities.\n Stylish and aesthetic accessory that pairs healing with everyday fashion.\n Attracts positivity and supports personal growth with Yellow Aventurine energy.', 'Wear the Aventurine Bracelet on your right wrist to channel confidence and positivity.\n Keep the Yellow Aventurine Pendant close to your heart for courage and strength.\n Clean gently with a soft cloth to maintain its shine and aesthetic appeal.\n Recharge under sunlight on a selenite plate to renew the stone’s natural energies.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'leo-combo', 'leo-combo_1.jpg', 'leo-combo_2.jpg', 'leo-combo_3.jpg', 'leo-combo_4.jpg', 'leo-combo_5.jpg', 'leo-combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(121, 'Malachite Bracelet', 'malachite-bracelet', 1999.00, 1249.00, '37', 'The Virgo Malachite Bracelet is a cool green malachite stone bracelet that enhances balance, clarity, and protection. Known for its powerful malachite bracelet benefits, it is especially supportive for Virgos but suitable for all zodiac signs. Stylish and meaningful, it makes a beautiful accessory for daily wear or gifting.', 'Encourages emotional balance and clears away stress and negative thoughts. Promotes clarity, focus, and grounding energy for daily decision-making. Protects against negative influences while strengthening inner courage and confidence. Supports personal growth, transformation, and overall spiritual and emotional well-being.', 'Wear the Virgo Malachite Bracelet on your left hand to receive calming energy. \nAvoid direct contact with perfumes or chemicals to maintain the stone’s natural shine. \nClean gently with a soft cloth to preserve its protective and healing properties. \nRecharge by placing it under moonlight or near plants to restore its vibrant energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'malachite-bracelet', 'malachite-bracelet_1.jpg', 'malachite-bracelet_2.jpg', 'malachite-bracelet_3.jpg', 'malachite-bracelet_4.jpg', 'malachite-bracelet_5.jpg', 'malachite-bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(122, 'Rhodonite Pendant', 'rhodonite-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '31,24,34', 'The rhodonite pendant is a trendy and aesthetic accessory that radiates healing energy. Known as the stone of compassion, the rhodonite crystal pendant encourages emotional balance, self-love, and forgiveness. Designed with a durable stainless steel chain, it’s perfect for daily wear, adding both beauty and positivity to your life.', 'The rhodonite crystal pendant promotes compassion, self-love, and emotional healing. \nEncourages forgiveness and clears emotional blockages. \nReduces stress, anxiety, and supports inner peace.', 'Wear your rhodonite crystal pendant daily around your neck to receive its calming and loving vibrations. \nKeep it close during meditation to encourage forgiveness, self-acceptance, and focus. \nCleanse regularly under running water or by smudging with sage. \nRecharge in natural moonlight or place it on a selenite plate to restore its soothing and balancing energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rhodonite-pendant', 'rhodonite-pendant_1.jpg', 'rhodonite-pendant_2.jpg', 'rhodonite-pendant_3.jpg', 'rhodonite-pendant_4.jpg', 'rhodonite-pendant_5.jpg', 'rhodonite-pendant_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(123, '7 Mukhi Rudraksha', '7-mukhi-rudraksha', 1077.00, 699.00, '20', 'The 7 Mukhi Rudraksha is a divine, spiritual bead renowned for its premium quality and powerful energy. Also known as the “7 Face Rudraksha,” it supports prosperity, self-confidence, and protection from negativity. Ideal for meditation, prayers, or daily wear, it harmonizes mind, body, and soul while attracting blessings and positivity.', 'Enhances self-confidence, willpower, and mental clarity. \nAttracts abundance, prosperity, and divine blessings. \nSupports spiritual growth, meditation, and inner balance. \nProtects from negative energies and emotional stress. \nStrengthens decision-making, focus, and leadership qualities.', 'Wear the 7 Mukhi Rudraksha original bead as a necklace or a bracelet on a thread or gold/silver chain to absorb its spiritual vibrations. \nUse during meditation, prayers, or worship to enhance focus, divine connection, and calmness. \nKeep in your sacred space or altar for continuous protection and positive energy. \nClean gently with clean water and a soft cloth occasionally. \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight for a few minutes or by chanting mantras near it.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-mukhi-rudraksha', '7-mukhi-rudraksha_1.jpg', '7-mukhi-rudraksha_2.jpg', '7-mukhi-rudraksha_4.jpg', '7-mukhi-rudraksha_5.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(124, 'Evil Eye Combo (Pendant & Bracelet)', 'evil-eye-combo-pendant-and-bracelet', 2998.00, 1149.00, '19,24', 'This stylish Evil Eye Combo includes an original evil eye bead bracelet and pendant crafted to shield you from negative energies. This unisex combo is designed to suit both men and women beautifully. Both pieces are premium, aesthetic, and crafted for daily wear. Perfect for gifting, this combo enhances positivity while keeping you protected in style.', 'Acts as a powerful protection booster against negative energies.\nEnhances your aura and promotes a sense of calm and focus.\nComplements any outfit with its trendy and elegant design.\nPerfect gift for loved ones to wish them positivity and safety.\nComes with an adjustable strap that comfortably fits any wrist size.', 'Wear the Evil Eye Bracelet on your left wrist for daily protection.\nPair it with the Evil Eye Pendant for a complete energy shield.\nRecharge it using saltwater, incense smoke, or by keeping it under moonlight.\nStore safely in a dry place when not in use to preserve its shine.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-combo-pendant-and-bracelet', 'Evil Eye Combo (Pendant & Bracelet)_1.png', 'Evil Eye Combo (Pendant & Bracelet)_2.png', 'Evil Eye Combo (Pendant & Bracelet)_3.png', 'Evil Eye Combo (Pendant & Bracelet)_4.png', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(125, 'Turquoise Pendant', 'turquoise-pendant', 1999.00, 999.00, '42,24', 'Add a touch of elegance with this Turquoise Pendant, designed for both style and energy. This aesthetic pendant showcases natural turquoise in a sleek design, making it perfect for gifting. Ideal for anyone who loves meaningful jewelry, it’s a trendy accessory for everyday wear or special occasions. The pendant comes with a matching chain, so it’s ready to wear right out of the box.', 'Wearing near the heart promotes emotional balance and a calming effect.\n Meditating with a pendant enhances self-expression and clear communication through the throat chakra.\n Supports deeper spiritual connection and alignment during meditation practices.\n Purifying under moonlight removes negative energies and recharges positive vibrations effectively.', 'Wear the pendant around your neck to enjoy its positive energy daily.\n Pair it with casual or formal outfits to enhance your overall style effortlessly.\n Keep the turquoise pendant away from harsh chemicals to maintain its natural shine.\n Store in a soft pouch when not in use to prevent scratches or damage.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'turquoise-pendant', 'Turquoise Pendant_1.jpg', 'Turquoise Pendant_2.jpg', 'Turquoise Pendant_3.jpg', 'Turquoise Pendant_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(126, 'Carnelian Pendant', 'carnelian-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '33,29,24', 'The Carnelian Pendant is a stone of courage and creativity. Known for its warm orange glow, it is believed to inspire motivation and boost confidence. This pendant comes with a chain, making it easy to wear daily. A beautiful piece of jewelry that also makes a thoughtful gift.', 'Encourages creativity, passion, and motivation in everyday activities. \nBoosts self-confidence and courage when facing new opportunities. \nBrings power and positive energy to balance your lifestyle.', 'Wear the pendant every day to inspire confidence, creativity, and positive energy. \nTo clean, gently wash with mild soap or soak in salt water, rinse well, and dry softly. \nTo charge, keep in sunlight or moonlight, or bury overnight and reconnect with natural energies. \nStore safely when not in use to protect both pendant and chain.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'carnelian-pendant', 'Carnelian Pendant_1.jpg', 'Carnelian Pendant_2.jpg', 'Carnelian Pendant_3.jpg', 'Carnelian Pendant_4.jpg', 'Carnelian Pendant_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(127, 'Black Tourmaline Tower', 'black-tourmaline-tower', 999.00, 599.00, '4', 'The Black Tourmaline Tower is known for its ability to protect and ground, keeping away negative energies and emotional stress from you. This sleek, dark crystal serves as a tourmaline tower that absorbs negative energies and transforms them into positive vibrations. Buy it for yourself or gift it to someone who needs emotional stability in life.', 'Acts as a powerful shield against negative energy and electromagnetic radiation. \nGrounds your energy, promoting a sense of calm and stability. \nCleanses the aura, providing protection from stress and anxiety.', 'Place the Black Tourmaline Tower in the corners of your home or office to create a protective shield around your space.\nKeep it on your desk or workspace to absorb negative energy and create a calm environment.\nUse it during meditation to ground your energy and enhance clarity.\nRecharge the tower by placing it under the moonlight or on a selenite plate to restore its protective power.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'black-tourmaline-tower', 'Black Tourmaline Tower_1.jpg', 'Black Tourmaline Tower_2.jpg', 'Black Tourmaline Tower_3.jpg', 'Black Tourmaline Tower_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
