(129, 'Rose Quartz Tumble', 'rose-quartz-tumble', 699.00, 549.00, '27,31', 'The Rose Quartz Tumble is a beautiful, soothing stone known for its loving and healing vibrations. These aesthetic and trendy rose quartz tumbled stones bring emotional balance, calmness, and positivity into your life. Perfect for meditation, decor, or daily use, they enhance relationships, self-love, and inner peace while adding an stylish touch.', 'Promotes love, compassion, and emotional healing. \nEncourages self-love, confidence, and harmony in relationships. \nHelps reduce stress, anxiety, and emotional blockages. \nBrings calming, soothing, and peaceful energy to any space. \nActs as a stylish and aesthetic crystal for decor and energy balance', 'Carry tumbled rose quartz in your pocket, purse, or bag to stay connected to its calming energy. \nPlace rose quartz tumbled stones on your work desk, bedside, or meditation altar for love and positivity. \nUse during meditation or relaxation practices to promote peace and healing. \nAdd them to home decor for a stylish, trendy, and aesthetic vibe while inviting harmony. \nCleanse with clean water and recharge by placing under moonlight or on a selenite plate.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rose-quartz-tumble', 'Rose Quartz Tumble_1.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Tumble_2.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Tumble_3.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Tumble_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(130, 'Energy Turtle Kit', 'energy-turtle-kit', 2499.00, 1349.00, '14,21', 'Steady growth begins with stability and balanced energy. The Pyrite Kachhcua symbolizes grounded progress and financial strength, making it ideal for your desk or personal space. Paired with the 7 Chakra Charging Plate, it supports energetic balance and alignment. Together, this kit is designed to enhance focus, attract wealth-oriented stability, and create a calm, growth-focused environment for personal success.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals building financial discipline and focus\n\nProfessionals seeking stable growth energy\n\nThose who value chakra balance with prosperity symbolism\n\nAnyone creating a wealth-focused personal space\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Pyrite & Selenite\n\nDimension\n\nTortoise : 7cm, Plate: 8 cm \n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace in personal workspace or study area\n\nCare Instruction\n\nWipe gently with a dry cloth; avoid moisture', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'energy-turtle-kit', 'Energy Turtle Kit_1.jpg', 'Energy Turtle Kit_2.jpg', 'Energy Turtle Kit_3.jpg', 'Energy Turtle Kit_4.jpg', 'Energy Turtle Kit_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(131, '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo', '7-horses-raw-pyrite-frame-with-vyapar-vriddhi-frame-combo', 2299.00, 1249.00, '14,21,22', 'What if your workspace could quietly invite growth every single day? This thoughtfully paired combination of the 7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame and Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra by Astrologer RaajeevG promotes steady progress and keeps the financial energy balanced for business growth.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nBusiness owners aiming towards financial stability and growth\n\nIndividuals who are strengthening their financial foundation\n\nPeople who prefer a balanced and supportive work setting\n\nIndividuals who are looking for meaningful and premium gift options', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-horses-raw-pyrite-frame-with-vyapar-vriddhi-frame-combo', '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo_1.jpg', '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo_2.jpg', '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo_3.jpg', '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo_4.jpg', '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo_5.jpg', '7 Horses Raw Pyrite Frame with Vyapar Vriddhi Frame Combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(132, 'Hamsa Harmony Hanging Combo', 'hamsa-harmony-hanging-combo', 2499.00, 1399.00, '14,19', 'This combo includes a big blue and small white-based evil eye hanging paired with a hamsa hand evil eye keychain. Designed for everyday use, it can be attached to keys, bags, or zippers, adding a decorative element that suits both personal use and gifting.', 'A combo of the 3 products for 4/7 protection on the go. \nCompact design makes it easy to carry on keys or bags\nAdds a subtle decorative accent to everyday accessories\nSuitable for daily use or thoughtful gifting purposes', 'Attach the keychain to house keys, car keys, or handbags for a handy search.\nCan be used as a hanging charm for backpacks or small spaces.\nKeep away from water to maintain the finish and charm quality.\nClean gently using a soft, dry cloth when required.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'hamsa-harmony-hanging-combo', 'Hamsa Harmony Hanging Combo_1.jpg', 'Hamsa Harmony Hanging Combo_2.jpg', 'Hamsa Harmony Hanging Combo_3.jpg', 'Hamsa Harmony Hanging Combo_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(133, 'Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses', 'pyrite-frame-of-rainbow-7-horses', 2499.00, 1749.00, '21,22', 'Bring home the Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses, a stunning seven running horses painting that radiates energy, balance, and triumph. These 7 running horses symbolize determination and success, while the pyrite frame channels prosperity and positivity. Perfect for homes and offices, it inspires motivation, growth, and harmony in every corner.', 'Symbolizes speed, energy, and unstoppable progress in life.\nAttracts prosperity and shields against negativity with the energy of pyrite.\nEncourages motivation and emotional stability.\nIdeal for uplifting home, office, or meditation spaces with the aura of seven running horses.', 'Place the 7 horses frame facing east or north to invite positive energy and growth.\nKeep it in your living room, workspace, or entrance for best results.\nAvoid hanging it near bathrooms or cluttered corners to ensure clean energy flow.\nWipe gently with a dry cloth to retain the brilliance and energy of your 7 running horses painting.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-frame-of-rainbow-7-horses', 'Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses_1.jpg', 'Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses_2.jpg', 'Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses_3.jpg', 'Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses_4.jpg', 'Pyrite Frame of Rainbow 7 Horses_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1);
