(134, 'Black Tourmaline', 'black-tourmaline', 699.00, 649.00, '41,30', 'Protect your energy with the powerful Black Tourmaline crystal, a widely cherished black healing stone. Known for protecting against negativity and balancing emotions, this black crystal is perfect for meditation, Reiki, or daily use. Easy to carry and versatile, Black Tourmaline also makes a meaningful and thoughtful gifting option.', 'Protects from negative energy and promotes emotional stability daily. \nEnhances grounding, balance, and focus during meditation practices. \nSupports stress relief and improves overall mental clarity naturally. \nActs as a powerful black Reiki stone for energy healing.', 'Carry Black Tourmaline crystal in your pocket for all-day protection and balance.\nPlace it near entrances or workspaces to protect against unwanted negative energy.\nHold during Reiki sessions or meditation to enhance healing and grounding energies.\nKeep under your pillow or bedside for restful sleep and calming vibrations.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'black-tourmaline', 'Black Tourmaline_1.jpg', 'Black Tourmaline_2.jpg', 'Black Tourmaline_3.jpg', 'Black Tourmaline_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(135, 'Amethyst Tumble', 'amethyst-tumble', 699.00, 649.00, '30', 'The Amethyst Crystal Tumbled stone is a stylish and aesthetic healing crystal known for its calming energy and protective properties. This premium-quality tumble supports stress relief, inner peace, and clarity of mind. Perfect for meditation, décor, or daily use, it brings balance, positivity, and trendy vibes into your life.', 'Promotes relaxation, stress relief, and emotional balance. \nEncourages focus, clarity, and spiritual awareness. \nHelps reduce fear, anxiety, negativity, and restless thoughts. \nAttracts protection, peace, and positive vibrations. \nEnhances sleep quality and supports meditation practices.', 'Keep Amethyst Crystal Tumbled stones in your home, office, or bedroom for calming and protective vibes. \nHold during meditation or place near your yoga mat to enhance focus and deepen your spiritual connection. \nCarry it in your pocket or purse as a stylish and trendy crystal companion. \nPlace it on your work desk to boost clarity and reduce stress. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and gently wipe with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by placing it on a selenite plate or keeping it under moonlight', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-tumble', 'Amethyst Tumble_1.jpg', 'Amethyst Tumble_2.jpg', 'Amethyst Tumble_3.jpg', 'Amethyst Tumble_4.jpg', 'Amethyst Tumble_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(136, 'Malachite Pendant', 'malachite-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '30,28,24,37', 'The cool and trendy Malachite Pendant is known as a stone of protection and transformation. Its rich green swirls are believed to absorb negative energy and promote emotional balance. The pendant comes with a chain, making it easy to wear daily. A stylish accessory that also makes a meaningful gift.', 'Absorbs negativity and provides strong emotional balance every day. \nSupports transformation and encourages positive changes. \nPromotes inner balance and helps reduce stress or worry. \nAttractive pendant with a chain that blends beauty with natural healing power.', 'Wear the pendant daily to protect yourself from negativity and emotional stress. \nGently wipe with a soft cloth to clean dust; use mild soap and wash it under running water for tougher dirt. \nRecharge malachite under moonlight or by visualizing pure light energy. \nHandle carefully to protect both the malachite stone and the included chain.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'malachite-pendant', 'Malachite Pendant_1.jpg', 'Malachite Pendant_2.jpg', 'Malachite Pendant_3.jpg', 'Malachite Pendant_4.jpg', 'Malachite Pendant_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(137, 'Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet', 'karungali-rudraksha-damru-bracelet', 999.00, 649.00, '7,18', 'Our Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet combines traditional elements that are often linked with strength, grounding, and spiritual discipline. Made using Natural Karungali wood beads and rudraksha, along with a damru charm, this bracelet represents balance, focus, and inner stability. This bracelet is worn by people who prefer meaningful accessories that remind them to stay calm, confident, and steady in life. Its simple design makes it suitable for regular wear without feeling heavy or complicated.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nFor devotees of Lord Shiva & Lord Murugan\n\nPeople who admire spiritual bracelets\n\nAnyone looking for meaningful daily wear\n\nFor people who are willing to bring focus, clarity, and stability in life\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nKarungali Wood beads, Rudraksha beads\n\nDimension\n\n22 Beads (8mm)\nDiameter: 7cm\n\nHow to Wear\n\nSlide on your dominant wrist. \n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from perfumes & harsh chemicals, clean it with a dry cloth, use a selenite plate for charging.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-rudraksha-damru-bracelet', 'Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet_4.jpg', 'Karungali Rudraksha Damru Bracelet_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(138, 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit', 'premium-nazar-shield-kit', 2499.00, 1499.00, '19,4', 'Protection feels more reassuring when it stays with you and surrounds your home at the same time. This Premium Nazar Shield Kit brings together two Evil Eye Hangings for your house entrance and a bracelet for everyday wear. A perfect combo of protection that is drawn from protective symbolism. You can add the aesthetic appeal to your outfit and to your home while making sure that the negativity stays away every day.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n• Homeowners wanting stronger protection around their entrance spaces\n• Individuals who prefer wearing meaningful daily protection symbols\n• Families looking to maintain a calmer and more secure home environment\n• Anyone choosing a thoughtful protection-inspired gift option', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'premium-nazar-shield-kit', 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit_1.jpg', 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit_2.jpg', 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit_3.png', 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit_4.jpg', 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit_5.jpg', 'Premium Nazar Shield Kit_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(139, 'Siddh 7 Chakra Rudraksha Bracelet', 'siddh-7-chakra-rudraksha-bracelet', 1999.00, 999.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.This auspicious 7 chakra rudraksha bracelet combines natural rudraksha beads with chakra stones to promote harmony and balance. It helps align your body’s energy, bringing peace, positivity, and focus. Stylish and comfortable, this bracelet is perfect for daily wear, supporting both spiritual growth and emotional well-being.', 'Balances seven chakras to improve energy flow and inner harmony. \nRudraksha beads support calmness, peace, and spiritual connection. \nStylish design makes it perfect for casual wear and meditation. \nHelps reduce stress while enhancing clarity and emotional stability.', 'Wear the 7 chakra rudraksha bracelet on your right hand for energy balance. \nRemove before sleeping. \nRecharge by placing it under sunlight or moonlight for a few hours regularly. \nWipe gently with a clean cloth, avoiding water to preserve the natural quality.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-7-chakra-rudraksha-bracelet', 'Siddh 7 Chakra Rudraksha Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Siddh 7 Chakra Rudraksha Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Siddh 7 Chakra Rudraksha Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Siddh 7 Chakra Rudraksha Bracelet_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(140, 'Lucky Charm Travel Combo', 'lucky-charm-travel-combo', 2999.00, 1949.00, '14,19', 'The Evil Eye Bracelet and Keychain Combo is designed for everyday protection and thoughtful gifting. This set includes one stylish bracelet and three matching keychains, making it easy to carry symbolic protection wherever you go. Simple in design, which blends easily with daily wear and accessories.', 'Offers symbolic protection against negative intentions in daily surroundings\nA Bracelet and keychains provide convenience for personal use and gifting\nLightweight design makes it suitable for everyday wear and travel\nComplements casual outfits, bags, and keys without standing out excessively', 'Wear the evil eye bracelet on either hand based on comfort\nAttach keychains to house keys, car keys, or bags\nKeep away from water to maintain the finish and durability\nClean gently with a soft dry cloth when needed', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lucky-charm-travel-combo', 'Lucky Charm Travel Combo_1.jpg', 'Lucky Charm Travel Combo_2.jpg', 'Lucky Charm Travel Combo_3.jpg', 'Lucky Charm Travel Combo_4.jpg', 'Lucky Charm Travel Combo_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(141, 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet & Pyramid Combo', 'raw-pyrite-bracelet-and-pyramid-combo', 2999.00, 1799.00, '28,21', 'Invite wealth, protection, and positive transformation into your life with the Raw Pyrite Bracelet & Pyramid Combo. Pyrite, often known as Fool’s Gold, symbolizes abundance, power, and manifestation. This unique pairing combines the wearable energy of a trendy Pyrite Bracelet with the focused vibrancy of a dynamic Pyrite Pyramid, making it perfect for both personal use and gifting.', 'Pyrite is known for drawing prosperity, abundance, and financial stability.\nEncourages motivation, willpower, and decision-making strength.\nActs as an energetic shield against stress and negative influences.\nSupports clarity, ambition, and determination in professional goals', 'Place the Pyrite Pyramid in the north or northeast direction of your home or workspace.\nKeep both items cleansed by gently wiping them with a soft cloth or smudging with sage.\nSet your intention for wealth and protection before using them for the best results.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'raw-pyrite-bracelet-and-pyramid-combo', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet & Pyramid Combo_1.png', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet & Pyramid Combo_2.png', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet & Pyramid Combo_3.png', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet & Pyramid Combo_4.png', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(142, 'Kuber Coin', 'kuber-coin', 599.00, 599.00, '5', 'Bring prosperity and financial stability into your life with the sacred Kuber Coin. Made from brass metal, this coin symbolizes Lord Kuber’s divine blessings for wealth and abundance. Keep it close to yourself as a token of good fortune and a reminder of continual growth and success.', 'Attracts wealth, prosperity, and financial growth into your life.\nEnhances spiritual energy and invites the blessings of Lord Kuber.\nPromotes savings, wise investments, and stability in finances.\nIdeal for gifting during festivals or auspicious beginnings.', 'Energize it by lighting a diya or chanting “Om Hreem Shreem Kuberaya Namah.”\nPlace the coin in your wallet, cash box, or business drawer for prosperity.\nIf placing it in a cash box or on an altar, ensure keeping it in the north direction, associated with Lord Kuber, for wealth energy.\nClean gently with a soft cloth and avoid exposure to water or chemicals.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product', 'kuber-coin', 'Kuber Coin_1.jpg', 'Kuber Coin_2.jpg', 'Kuber Coin_3.jpg', 'Kuber Coin_4.jpg', 'Kuber Coin_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(143, 'Lakshmi Ganesh & Diya Gift Set', 'lakshmi-ganesh-and-diya-gift-set', 2499.00, 2299.00, '4,5', 'Celebrate positivity, prosperity, and new beginnings with the Laxmi, Ganesh & Diya Combo. This beautiful brass idol set features Goddess Laxmi for wealth, Lord Ganesh for wisdom, and traditional diyas symbolizing light and purity. Perfect for auspicious events or daily worship, this combo is also a thoughtful gift option to bring blessings, harmony, and good fortune to loved ones.', 'Combines Laxmi, Ganesh idols with brass diyas for divine blessings.\nEnhances home decor with a traditional and auspicious touch. Ideal gift options for festivals, auspicious occasions, or for those embarking on new beginnings\nUse during daily pooja, festival celebrations, or auspicious occasions to invite prosperity and positivity.', 'Place idols and diyas on a clean, decorated worship place, facing the east direction.\nLight the brass diyas with ghee or oil during prayer rituals daily.\nOffer flowers, incense, and sweets to seek the blessings of Laxmi and Ganesh.\nUse during daily pooja, festival celebrations, or auspicious occasions to invite prosperity and positivity.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lakshmi-ganesh-and-diya-gift-set', 'Lakshmi Ganesh & Diya Gift Set_1.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ganesh & Diya Gift Set_2.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ganesh & Diya Gift Set_3.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ganesh & Diya Gift Set_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(144, 'Labradorite Pendant', 'labradorite-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '24,40', 'Add elegance and positive energy to your look with our Labradorite Pendant. Known for its stunning iridescent glow, labradorite is believed to enhance intuition and protection. This beautiful pendant makes a thoughtful gift and a stylish accessory for everyday wear or special occasions.', 'Labradorite pendant enhances intuition, clarity, and inner spiritual growth.\n Stylish accessory that blends natural beauty with elegant design.\n Known to protect from negativity and encourage positive energy flow.\n Perfect gift for loved ones who appreciate healing crystal jewelry.', 'Wear the Labradorite Pendant daily to experience its protective healing energies.\n Pair with any outfit to add elegance and a spiritual touch.\n Clean gently with a soft cloth to maintain shine and durability.\n Keep the pendant close to your heart for maximum energetic benefits.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'labradorite-pendant', 'Labradorite Pendant_1.jpg', 'Labradorite Pendant_2.jpg', 'Labradorite Pendant_3.jpg', 'Labradorite Pendant_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(145, 'Cancer Combo', 'cancer-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '35,14,4', 'The Cancer Combo brings together a Cancer Moonstone Pendant and Cancer Moonstone Bracelet crafted for emotional balance and intuition. Known for its calming energy, Moonstone helps Cancer natives embrace inner harmony. This trendy, aesthetic set doubles as a meaningful keepsake and is also a perfect gifting choice for loved ones.', 'Encourages emotional balance and strengthens intuition for Cancer zodiac natives.\n Aesthetic gemstone jewelry that enhances both inner peace and personal style.\n Promotes calmness, stability, and positive vibrations in daily life.', 'Wear the Moonstone bracelet on your right wrist to attract soothing lunar energy.\n Keep the Moonstone pendant near your heart to strengthen intuition and emotional clarity.\n Clean gently with a soft cloth to preserve its natural shine and beauty.\n Recharge under moonlight on a selenite plate regularly to renew the stone’s calming and healing properties.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'cancer-combo', 'Cancer Combo_1.jpg', 'Cancer Combo_2.jpg', 'Cancer Combo_3.jpg', 'Cancer Combo_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(146, 'Pyrite Dome Tree', 'pyrite-dome-tree', 1999.00, 1649.00, '4,28,21,25', 'The Pyrite Dome Tree is a captivating decorative piece that combines the vibe of natural pyrite crystals with the elegance of a glass dome. A perfect eye candy because of its shimmering golden hue, this tree symbolizes abundance, prosperity, and protection. Present it as a thoughtful gift to friends or loved ones embarking on new ventures.', 'Pyrite is believed to draw financial prosperity and success. \nShields against negative energies and environmental pollutants. \nBoosts self-assurance and willpower. \nStimulates the intellect and enhances memory.', 'Place the tree on your altar or desk to focus on intentions and goals.\nPosition it in the southeast corner of your home or office to attract abundance.\nKeep it nearby during meditation to enhance clarity and concentration.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-dome-tree', 'Pyrite Dome Tree_1.jpg', 'Pyrite Dome Tree_2.jpg', 'Pyrite Dome Tree_3.jpg', 'Pyrite Dome Tree_4.jpg', 'Pyrite Dome Tree_5.png', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(147, 'Yellow Aventurine Bracelet', 'yellow-aventurine-bracelet', 1999.00, 1249.00, '7,36', 'The Yellow Aventurine Bracelet is crafted to bring balance, confidence, and positivity. Known as the stone of self-reflection and inner strength, this yellow aventurine bracelet supports clarity in decision-making while calming the mind. A stylish and meaningful accessory, it helps and others embrace optimism, boost energy, and attract good fortune in daily life.', 'Encourages confidence, self-esteem, and emotional balance in everyday life. \nPromotes decision-making clarity and helps reduce unnecessary stress. \nBoosts creativity, energy, and optimism for personal and professional growth. \nSupports overall well-being by aligning mind, body, and spirit.', 'Wear the yellow aventurine bracelet on your left wrist for positive energy. \nCleanse it occasionally with water and mild soap to maintain its shine. \nRecharge the stone by placing it under sunlight or moonlight for a few hours. \nAvoid harsh chemicals and store safely in a soft pouch when not worn.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'yellow-aventurine-bracelet', 'Yellow Aventurine Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Bracelet_4.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Bracelet_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(148, 'Sandalwood Incense Stick', 'sandalwood-incense-stick', 299.00, 249.00, '5', '<p>Experience the timeless aroma of pure sandalwood incense sticks crafted for peace and harmony. Known as the best sandalwood agarbatti, these sticks bring a warm, earthy fragrance that calms the senses. Perfect for meditation, prayer, or daily use, they also make a thoughtful and traditional gifting option.</p>', 'Promotes relaxation with the soothing woody fragrance of pure sandalwood incense. \nCreates a peaceful, positive environment ideal for prayers or meditation. \nNatural aroma helps reduce stress and instantly uplifts mood. \nLong-lasting fragrance makes it the best sandalwood agarbatti choice.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'sandalwood-incense-stick', 'Sandalwood Incense Stick_1.jpg', 'Sandalwood Incense Stick_2.jpg', 'Sandalwood Incense Stick_3.jpg', 'Sandalwood Incense Stick_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(149, '5 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant', 1999.00, 749.00, '24,20', 'The 5 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant is known for spiritual growth, inner peace, and well-being. It represents Lord Shiva’s blessings and helps bring calmness and positivity into life. Beautifully crafted, this pendant comes with a chain, making it convenient to wear daily or gift as a sacred token of protection.', 'Promotes inner peace, calmness, and balance for mind and body. \nStrengthens concentration, focus, and clarity in everyday thoughts and decisions. \nBrings protection, positivity, and harmony by reducing stress and negativity. \nSupports spiritual growth and enhances connection with divine energies.', 'Wear the pendant daily to invite positivity and spiritual blessings. \nAvoid contact with chemicals, soaps, or perfumes to preserve energy and shine. \nCleanse with Ganga water or milk, gently wipe with a soft cloth to maintain its purity and sacredness. \nTo charge, place in a sacred space, light incense, and chant “Om Namah Shivaya” 108 times.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '5-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant', '5 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant_1.png', '', '', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(150, 'Karungali Elastic Bracelet - 22 Beads, 8mm', 'karungali-elastic-bracelet-22-beads-8mm', 999.00, 599.00, '7,18', 'Staying calm and protected becomes easier when your energy feels steady. This Karungali Bracelet is made from natural ebony wood, traditionally valued for its grounding and protective qualities. Known for its deep black tone and strong spiritual association, Karungali is often worn to maintain balance, reduce negative influence, and support mental clarity.\nDesigned for everyday wear, the bracelet keeps a simple and natural look while carrying symbolic strength. Whether worn during prayer, meditation, or daily routine, it works as a steady reminder to stay focused, calm, and protected.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who want protection from negative energy\n\nPeople who practice meditation, prayer, or spiritual routines\n\nThose who prefer natural and meaningful accessories\n\nAnyone choosing a thoughtful spiritual gift\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nKarungali Wood Beads \n\nDimension\n\n22 Beads (8mm),Diameter: 7cm\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear on dominant wrist\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-elastic-bracelet-22-beads-8mm', 'Karungali Elastic Bracelet - 22 Beads, 8mm_1.jpg', 'Karungali Elastic Bracelet - 22 Beads, 8mm_2.jpg', 'Karungali Elastic Bracelet - 22 Beads, 8mm_3.jpg', 'Karungali Elastic Bracelet - 22 Beads, 8mm_4.jpg', 'Karungali Elastic Bracelet - 22 Beads, 8mm_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(151, 'OM Bead Karungali Mala', 'om-bead-karungali-mala', 999.00, 749.00, '18,6', 'Astroyogi’s OM Bead Karungali Mala is made for those who like wearing traditional malas during prayer, meditation, or their daily routine. The mala is crafted using authentic karungali beads along with an Om bead, which is often linked with peace, balance, and spiritual focus. Many people wear such malas while chanting, meditating, or simply as part of their daily wear to stay calm and steady. The simple design makes it comfortable to wear for long hours without feeling heavy, while the natural beads give it a classic and devotional look.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n People who chant or meditate regularly\n\nIndividuals who wear spiritual malas\n\nDevotees who prefer traditional accessories\n\nAnyone looking for a daily wear mala \n\nA devotional gift option for men & women\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Karungali Wood Beads with Premium Metal Om Bead\n\nDimension\n\n33cm\n\nHow to Wear / Use\n\nWear around neck or use during prayer\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'om-bead-karungali-mala', 'OM Bead Karungali Mala_1.jpg', 'OM Bead Karungali Mala_2.jpg', 'OM Bead Karungali Mala_3.jpg', 'OM Bead Karungali Mala_5.jpg', 'OM Bead Karungali Mala_6.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(152, 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo', 'vyapar-vriddhi-combo', 2499.00, 1399.00, '14,22', 'Strengthen your workspace with the Vyapar Vriddhi Combo. This combo includes the 7 Horses Frame, symbolizing speed, success, and forward movement, along with the Vyapar Vriddhi Yantra, known for supporting business growth and financial stability. Together, they help create a focused and positive environment, encouraging confidence, steady progress, and prosperity in professional and business life.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nBusiness owners focused on growth and stability\n\nProfessionals aiming for career progress\n\nShop or office owners setting up workspace décor\n\nAnyone seeking prosperity-focused yantra symbols\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nMetal Yantra Frame\n\nDimension\n\nLength - 19cm, Width - 19cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nOffice, shop, cabin, or workspace wall\n\nCare Instruction\n\nClean with a dry cloth; avoid moisture', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'vyapar-vriddhi-combo', 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo_1.jpg', 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo_2.jpg', 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo_3.jpg', 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo_4.jpg', 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo_5.jpg', 'Vyapar Vriddhi Combo_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(153, 'Evil Eye Duo Shield', 'evil-eye-duo-shield', 1999.00, 1149.00, '19,4', 'Your space feels safer when it is protected from every direction. Created for modern spiritual living by Astroyogi, this combination of two Evil Eye Hangings is drawn from the concept of evil eye which historically valued for its protective meaning and repelling all kinds of negative influences. Place it at your doorway, and they’ll create a sense of safety, balance, and calm so that your home feels more secure and energetically protected.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n• Homeowners wanting stronger protection around their entrance area\n• Families who prefer a calm and secure atmosphere indoors\n• Those drawn to symbolic décor with protective meaning\n• Anyone looking for a thoughtful housewarming or home-care gift', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-duo-shield', 'Evil Eye Duo Shield_1.jpg', 'Evil Eye Duo Shield_2.jpg', 'Evil Eye Duo Shield_3.jpg', 'Evil Eye Duo Shield_4.jpg', 'Evil Eye Duo Shield_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(154, 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 54 Beads, 6mm', 'siddh-karungali-beads-silver-cap-mala-54-beads-6mm', 1499.00, 1149.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.This Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala is a blend of elegance and protection and features 54 genuine ebony wood beads, finished with shining silver caps. Perfect for meditation or daily wear, it balances your energy, enhances confidence, and adds a sophisticated spiritual touch to your look.', 'Combines powerful energy with refined, elegant design.\nOffers protection from negativity and emotional imbalance.\nBoosts focus, calmness, and inner strength during meditation.\nIdeal spiritual accessory for style, confidence, and peace.', 'Wear around your neck during meditation, prayers, or daily activities.\nChant mantras using each of the 54 beads for spiritual alignment.\nKeep away from water or perfume to preserve the wood and silver finish.\nWhen not in use, store the Mala in a clean cloth pouch or your puja space to preserve its sacred energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', '', 'siddh-karungali-beads-silver-cap-mala-54-beads-6mm', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 54 Beads, 6mm_1.jpg', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 54 Beads, 6mm_2.jpg', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 54 Beads, 6mm_3.jpg', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 54 Beads, 6mm_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(155, 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 55 Beads, 18mm', 'siddh-karungali-beads-silver-cap-mala-55-beads-18mm', 1999.00, 999.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.This Original Karungali Bead Mala is crafted using original Karungali from black ebony wood beads. Known for their natural look and smooth finish, these Karungali Malai wood beads are ideal for daily wear, meditation, or spiritual routines, offering a traditional and calming experience for regular use', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-karungali-beads-silver-cap-mala-55-beads-18mm', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 55 Beads, 18mm_1.png', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 55 Beads, 18mm_2.png', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 55 Beads, 18mm_3.png', 'Siddh Karungali Beads Silver Cap Mala - 55 Beads, 18mm_4.png', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(156, 'Sampoorna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame', 'sampoorna-lakshmi-ganesh-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 1999.00, 999.00, '5,21,22', 'Experience divine blessings with the Sampurna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra on a Raw Pyrite base frame. This sacred combination unites Goddess Lakshmi’s prosperity with Lord Ganesha’s wisdom, empowering your home or workplace with abundance, success, and protection. The pyrite background radiates positivity, making it an auspicious spiritual decor piece.', 'Combines the prosperity and the wisdom in one frame.\nCrafted on natural pyrite, known to attract wealth and positive energy.\nBrings harmony, success, and protection from negative influences.\nA stunning decor accent, symbolizing spiritual and material fulfillment.', 'Keep chanting “Om Shreem Mahalakshmiyei Namaha” to set clear intentions and continuous energy flow.\nPlace the frame in your home temple, office, or living room facing east.\nKeep it at eye level on a clean surface or altar for ideal energy flow.\nOffer flowers or light a diya daily while chanting Lakshmi-Ganesha mantras.\nClean with a soft, dry cloth to maintain its golden shine and energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'sampoorna-lakshmi-ganesh-yantra-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 'Sampoorna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame_1.jpg', 'Sampoorna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame_2.jpg', 'Sampoorna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame_3.jpg', 'Sampoorna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame_4.jpg', 'Sampoorna Lakshmi Ganesh Yantra On Raw Pyrite Frame_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(157, 'Labradorite Bracelet', 'labradorite-bracelet', 1999.00, 1099.00, '7,40', 'Elevate your style and spirit with our Sagittarius Labradorite Bracelet. Celebrated for its protective and transformative powers, labradorite is believed to inspire confidence, intuition, and positivity. Designed with Sagittarius energy in mind, this bracelet is a meaningful zodiac accessory, perfect as a thoughtful gift or for everyday spiritual wear.', 'Sagittarius Labradorite Bracelet promotes intuition, strength, and emotional balance.\n Protects Sagittarians from negative energies and enhances positive vibrations.\n Stylish bracelet that combines beauty, spirituality, and everyday elegance.\n Makes a thoughtful zodiac gift for Sagittarius birthdays and special occasions.', 'Wear the Sagittarius Labradorite Bracelet daily to strengthen your zodiac energy.\n Pair with casual or formal outfits for a stylish and spiritual look.\n Clean gently with a soft cloth to maintain the stone’s natural glow.\n Store the bracelet safely when not wearing to avoid scratches or damage.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'labradorite-bracelet', 'Labradorite Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Labradorite Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Labradorite Bracelet_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(158, 'Libra Combo', 'libra-combo', 2999.00, 1549.00, '14,4,38', 'This Libra Combo is a special combination of a premium Rose Quartz Pendant including a beautiful chain along with a Rose Quartz Bracelet crafted to evoke romance, love and attraction in an exclusive Black Gift Box. This elegant gift is the perfect gifting choice for your special someone this year. Limited Stocks Available.', 'Enhances self-love, compassion, and emotional well-being for Libra zodiac natives.\n Aesthetic Rose Quartz Pendant and Bracelet that combine healing with fashionable elegance.\n Strengthens bonds and attracts positive, loving energy into relationships.', 'Return and Exchange\n Disclaimer\n Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'libra-combo', 'Libra Combo_1.jpg', 'Libra Combo_2.jpg', 'Libra Combo_3.jpg', 'Libra Combo_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(159, '7 Chakra Tower', '7-chakra-tower', 999.00, 849.00, '4', 'The 7 Chakra Tower is a beautifully designed crystal tower that flawlessly aligns and balances your seven chakras. Each chakra point is represented by a vibrant gemstone, bringing healing and harmony to your body and mind. This chakra tower is ideal for gifting to individuals seeking to deepen their spiritual journey, promote overall wellness, and clear energy blockages.', 'Clears energy blockages and promotes the smooth flow of energy throughout your body. \nEnhances mindfulness and meditation, helping you connect with your inner self. \nIdeal for healing, protection, and creating a positive energy environment.', 'Place the 7 Chakra Tower on your altar, drawing room, or work desk. \nKeep it in your living room or bedroom to promote energy flow and balance throughout your home. \nUse it during meditation to open, balance, and align your chakras for greater clarity and focus. \nRecharge the tower by placing it under moonlight or on a selenite plate to restore its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-tower', '7 Chakra Tower_1.jpg', '7 Chakra Tower_2.jpg', '7 Chakra Tower_3.jpg', '7 Chakra Tower_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(160, 'Tiger Eye Tumble', 'tiger-eye-tumble', 699.00, 599.00, '23', 'The Tiger Eye Tumble is a captivating gemstone that resembles the strength and resilience of a tiger. With its rich golden-brown hues and silky luster, it serves as a powerful companion in enhancing personal power, focus, and determination. This stone can be a decorative piece and even a tool for grounding and protection.', 'Anchors your energy, promoting stability and balance. \nSharpens concentration, aiding in decision-making and clarity. \nAssists in releasing fear and anxiety, fostering courage. \nSupports financial growth by encouraging wise decisions', 'Keep the Tiger Eye Tumble on your workspace to stay focused and motivated throughout the day. \nCarry it in your pocket or wallet to feel grounded and confident, especially when facing challenges. \nPlace it in direct sunlight or on a selenite plate to cleanse and recharge its energy. \nHold it during meditation to connect with your inner strength and enhance clarity.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'tiger-eye-tumble', 'Tiger Eye Tumble_1.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Tumble_2.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Tumble_3.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Tumble_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(161, 'Lavender & Mogra Incense Sticks', 'lavender-mogra-incense-sticks', 598.00, 399.00, '5', '<p>Fill your space with calming fragrance using our combo of Sandalwood incense sticks &amp; Rose Incense Sticks. Blending the earthy warmth of sandal dhoop sticks and the gentle floral aroma of rose dhoop sticks, these incense sticks create a soothing atmosphere. They are also the best gift option for loved ones.</p>', 'Promotes relaxation with calming sandalwood and soothing rose fragrance. \nCreates a peaceful environment for meditation, prayer, or daily rituals. \nNatural aromas help refresh rooms and instantly uplift the mood. \nPerfect for reducing stress and enhancing spiritual connection.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'lavender-and-mogra-incense-sticks', 'Lavender & Mogra Incense Sticks_1.jpg', 'Lavender & Mogra Incense Sticks_2.jpg', 'Lavender & Mogra Incense Sticks_3.jpg', 'Lavender & Mogra Incense Sticks_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(162, 'Evil Eye Dome Tree', 'evil-eye-dome-tree', 1999.00, 1549.00, '19,4,25', 'Bring positivity and protection into your space with the Evil Eye Dome Tree. Beautifully crafted, it makes a thoughtful gift for loved ones and a charming decor piece for your home or office. This tree is believed to ward off negativity while enhancing peace and harmony around you.', 'Protects your surroundings by warding off negative energies and thoughts. \nEnhances peace, harmony, and positive vibrations in your surrounding environment. \nStylish decorative piece that adds beauty and spiritual meaning together. \nPromotes focus, calmness, and a balanced atmosphere for daily living/work', 'Place the Evil Eye Dome Tree in your living room or office for positivity. \nKeep it near your entrance to invite protection and block negative influences. \nClean occasionally with a dry cloth to maintain its shine and energy flow. \nRecharge its positive vibrations by placing it under natural sunlight for a few hours.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-dome-tree', 'Evil Eye Dome Tree_1.jpg', 'Evil Eye Dome Tree_2.jpg', 'Evil Eye Dome Tree_3.jpg', 'Evil Eye Dome Tree_4.jpg', 'Evil Eye Dome Tree_5.jpg', 'Evil Eye Dome Tree_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(163, 'Shree Yantra Frame', 'shree-yantra-frame', 1999.00, 999.00, '22', 'The Shree Yantra is a powerful symbol of prosperity, harmony, and spiritual growth. Known for attracting positive energies, it helps balance the mind and soul while inviting abundance into life. Recognized for centuries, Shree Yantra benefits include clarity, peace, and success, making it a sacred addition to homes, offices, or personal spiritual practices.', 'Attracts wealth, prosperity, and abundance into personal and professional life. Promotes mental clarity, inner peace, and emotional stability. Removes obstacles and negative energies from the environment. Enhances spiritual connection and supports meditation practices.', 'Place the Shree Yantra in your home or office facing east for prosperity. \nKeep it on a clean altar or sacred space for maximum spiritual benefits. \nCleanse it regularly with water or a cloth to maintain positive vibrations. \nMeditate daily by focusing on the Shree Yantra to channel spiritual energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'shree-yantra-frame', 'Shree Yantra Frame_1.jpg', 'Shree Yantra Frame_2.png', 'Shree Yantra Frame_3.png', 'Shree Yantra Frame_4.png', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(164, 'Karungali Trishul with Stand', 'karungali-trishul-with-stand', 999.00, 599.00, '18', 'The Karungali Trishul with Stand is made from natural karungali ebony wood and is designed as a devotional symbol for home, workspace, or vehicle. The trishul is often linked with strength, discipline, and protection, and many people keep such symbols nearby as part of their spiritual routine. The attached stand allows the trishul to be placed easily on a table, dashboard, or shelf without support. Its natural wooden finish gives it a simple and traditional appearance, making it suitable for everyday placement.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nDevotees who worship or keep spiritual symbols\n\nPeople who need to decorate the pooja ghar or the workspace\n\nIndividuals who like natural wooden devotional items\n\nAnyone looking for symbolic desk décor\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Karungali (Ebony) Wood\n\nDimension\n\n9.5cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace on desk, shelf, or dashboard\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-trishul-with-stand', 'Karungali Trishul with Stand_1.jpg', 'Karungali Trishul with Stand_2.jpg', 'Karungali Trishul with Stand_3.jpg', 'Karungali Trishul with Stand_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(165, 'Lapis Lazuli Tortoise', 'lapis-lazuli-tortoise', 999.00, 699.00, '4', 'Astrologer RaajeevG experts have designed the Lapis Lazuli Tortoise as a decorative symbol of wisdom, balance, and steady progress. Lapis lazuli is often associated with clear thinking and inner awareness, while the tortoise represents patience, stability, and long-term growth. It makes a meaningful piece for your desk, study table, or workspace. Its compact size makes it easy to place anywhere, helping create a calm and focused environment for daily work and personal goals.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who want to bring better focus and clarity\n\nProfessionals who are working toward steady success\n\nPromotes clear thinking in students and encourages regular study habits.\n\nAnyone looking for a meaningful desk decor or thoughtful gift option.\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Lapis Lazuli Stone\n\nDimension\n\n 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace near the entrance, on the desk, study table, or workspace\n\nCare Instruction\n\nWipe with a dry cloth, avoiding moisture.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lapis-lazuli-tortoise', 'Lapis Lazuli Tortoise_1.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli Tortoise_2.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli Tortoise_3.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli Tortoise_5.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli Tortoise_6.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(166, 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet', 'gold-plated-evil-eye-bracelet', 2299.00, 1499.00, '19', 'The Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet is designed for those who want a stylish accessory with symbolic meaning made by Astrologer RaajeevG for women. The evil eye design is traditionally associated with protection from unwanted attention and negative influences. Made with pure brass with a gold-plated finish, this bracelet can be worn daily with both traditional and modern outfits. It is lightweight, simple, and suitable for regular use while adding a meaningful touch to your look.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nWomen who want jewelry items that block negativity\n\nWomen looking for elegant evil eye bracelets\n\nAnyone searching for a thoughtful gift\n\n \n\nAttribute\n\nDetails\n\nMaterial\n\nBrass\n\nDimension\n\nAdjustable Fit\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear on your dominant wrist daily\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfume, and chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gold-plated-evil-eye-bracelet', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet_4.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet_5.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Bracelet_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(167, 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate', 'raw-pyrite-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 2499.00, 1549.00, '14,21', 'Astrologer RaajeevG’s Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate is created for those who want to stay disciplined about their financial goals while maintaining clear and balanced energy. The Raw Pyrite Bracelet is often associated with confidence, determination, and a strong money mindset. The Selenite Charging Plate helps refresh the bracelet’s energy so it can be used regularly with focus and intention. Together, this set supports consistency, clarity, and a steady approach toward financial growth.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals working toward financial stability\n\nProfessionals focused on career growth\n\nPeople who wear crystal accessories daily\n\nAnyone building a disciplined money mindset\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nRaw Pyrite Stone & Raw Selenite Plate\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm Bead, Dia - 7cm, Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer 🎁 Add to cart for Free Gifts above ₹999 ₹1549 ₹2499 38% Off M.R.P. (incl of all taxes) Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate', 'raw-pyrite-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate_1.jpg', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate_2.jpg', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate_3.jpg', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate_4.jpg', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate_5.jpg', 'Raw Pyrite Bracelet with Charging Plate_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1);
