(168, 'Nazar Kavach: Home & Wrist Edition', 'nazar-kavach-home-and-wrist-edition', 2499.00, 1199.00, '19', 'Protection feels more complete when it surrounds both you and your space. Thoughtfully curated by Astrologer RaajeevG, this pairing of the Evil Eye Door Hanging and Evil Eye Bracelet is drawn from protective symbolism and guards against negative influences. When used together, many people have experienced that they help in maintaining a calm home environment while offering a personal symbol of guarded, positive energy.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n• Individuals who are seeking protection from negative energy in daily life\n• People who want a positive and peaceful home environment\n• Individuals who want an aesthetic yet meaningful accessory\n• People who are choosing thoughtful protection-inspired gift options', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'nazar-kavach-home-and-wrist-edition', 'Nazar Kavach Home & Wrist Edition_1.jpg', 'Nazar Kavach Home & Wrist Edition_2.jpg', 'Nazar Kavach Home & Wrist Edition_3.jpg', 'Nazar Kavach Home & Wrist Edition_4.jpg', 'Nazar Kavach Home & Wrist Edition_5.png', 'Nazar Kavach Home & Wrist Edition_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(169, 'Siddh 5 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha', 1200.00, 819.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 5 Mukhi Rudraksha, also known as Panchmukhi Rudraksha or Five-Face Rudraksha, is a premium spiritual bead renowned for its divine energy. Ideal for meditation, prayers, and daily wear, it promotes well-being, harmony, confidence, and protection. This sacred bead brings positivity, balance, and spiritual upliftment into your life.', 'Enhances focus, mental clarity, and decision-making.\n Supports overall well-being, energy, and vitality.\n Helps reduce stress, anxiety, and negative influences.\n Attracts divine protection, prosperity, and positive vibrations.\n Encourages spiritual growth, meditation, and inner strength.', 'Wear the 5 Mukhi Rudraksha on a thread or silver/gold chain as a necklace or a bracelet to absorb its divine vibrations. \n Use during meditation or prayers to enhance concentration, peace, and spiritual connection. \n Keep it in your worship space or personal altar for continuous blessings. \n Cleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-5-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 5 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 5 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 5 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(170, 'Siddh 6 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-6-mukhi-rudraksha', 1200.00, 919.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 6 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful bead known for its unique spiritual and healing properties. It’s recommended for those seeking to enhance mental clarity, personal growth, and emotional stability. This original 6 Mukhi Rudraksha is a trendy and aesthetic addition to your spiritual collection, offering benefits that go beyond protection. Perfect for gifting and personal use.', 'Promotes mental clarity, helping to remove confusion and stress. Supports spiritual growth and alignment of the inner self. Helps in controlling negative emotions and overcoming challenges in life.', 'Wear the 6 Mukhi Rudraksha as a pendant around your neck for continuous spiritual benefits.\nUse it as a mala during meditation to improve focus and inner peace.\nRecharge the Rudraksha by placing it on a selenite plate to cleanse and renew its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-6-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 6 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 6 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 6 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', 'Siddh 6 Mukhi Rudraksha_5.png', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(171, 'Siddh Karungali Bracelet - 24 Beads, 6mm', 'siddh-karungali-bracelet-24-beads-6mm', 1499.00, 899.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.Embrace the spiritual vibe with this original Karungali Bracelet created from deep-black ebony wood beads. The sleek bracelet design combines timeless protection and modern ease, perfect for daily wear or gifting. Let its grounding energy sharpen your focus, enhance calm, and elevate your style.', 'Made from genuine ebony wood for powerful spiritual grounding.\nShields aura and repels negative energies throughout the day.\nPromotes mental clarity, focus, and inner calm naturally.\nElegant design blends with both spiritual practice and everyday style.', 'Wear the bracelet on your dominant wrist during meditation or casual wear.\nSet your intention or mantra while touching each bead for focus.\nAvoid water, perfume, or soap contact to preserve the beads.\nWhen not in use, store the Mala in a clean cloth pouch or your puja space to preserve its sacred energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-karungali-bracelet-24-beads-6mm', 'Siddh Karungali Bracelet - 24 Beads, 6mm_1.jpg', 'Siddh Karungali Bracelet - 24 Beads, 6mm_2.jpg', 'Siddh Karungali Bracelet - 24 Beads, 6mm_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(172, '5 Mukhi Rudraksha', '5-mukhi-rudraksha', 763.00, 699.00, '20', 'The 5 Mukhi Rudraksha, also known as Panchmukhi Rudraksha or Five-Face Rudraksha, is a premium spiritual bead renowned for its divine energy. Ideal for meditation, prayers, and daily wear, it promotes well-being, harmony, confidence, and protection. This sacred bead brings positivity, balance, and spiritual upliftment into your life.', 'Enhances focus, mental clarity, and decision-making.\n Supports overall well-being, energy, and vitality.\n Helps reduce stress, anxiety, and negative influences.\n Attracts divine protection, prosperity, and positive vibrations.\n Encourages spiritual growth, meditation, and inner strength.', 'Wear the 5 Mukhi Rudraksha on a thread or silver/gold chain as a necklace or a bracelet to absorb its divine vibrations. \n Use during meditation or prayers to enhance concentration, peace, and spiritual connection. \n Keep it in your worship space or personal altar for continuous blessings. \n Cleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '5-mukhi-rudraksha', '5 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '5 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '5 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(173, 'Amethyst Tower', 'amethyst-tower', 999.00, 849.00, '30', 'The Amethyst Tower, with its rich purple hues, serves as a powerful source of spiritual energy and healing. Known for its calming and protective properties, this amethyst crystal tower amplifies the energy around it, bringing peace, balance, and clarity to your space. Perfect for gifting, this striking decor piece is a powerful tool for wellness and spiritual growth.', 'Provides protection from negative energy and emotional stress. \nCleanses and balances your aura, promoting emotional healing. \nIdeal for meditation, helping you achieve a deeper state of calm and focus.', 'Place it on your nightstand or dresser to create a peaceful and balanced environment. \nKeep it on your desk or workspace to clear negativity and improve focus. \nRecharge the tower by placing it in moonlight or near a selenite crystal to cleanse its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-tower', 'Amethyst Tower_1.jpg', 'Amethyst Tower_2.jpg', 'Amethyst Tower_3.jpg', 'Amethyst Tower_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(174, 'Clear Quartz Tumble', 'clear-quartz-tumble', 699.00, 599.00, '23', 'The Clear Quartz Tumble is a powerful crystal known for its ability to amplify energy and promote healing. Often called the “master healer,” this clear quartz stone enhances clarity, focus, and balance. A trendy and aesthetic addition to any collection, which boosts your spiritual energy and personal growth.', 'Amplifies energy and intentions, enhancing your spiritual growth. \nSupports physical and emotional well-being. \nPromotes mental clarity, focus, and emotional balance.', 'Keep the Clear Quartz Tumble close to you for enhanced focus and clarity throughout the day. \nUse it during meditation to amplify your intentions and energy. \nCarry it in your pocket or purse for a constant flow of positive energy. \nRecharge the clear quartz crystal by placing it on a selenite plate overnight to cleanse and restore its power.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'clear-quartz-tumble', 'Clear Quartz Tumble_1.jpg', 'Clear Quartz Tumble_2.jpg', 'Clear Quartz Tumble_3.jpg', 'Clear Quartz Tumble_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(175, 'Citrine Dome Tree', 'citrine-dome-tree', 1999.00, 1649.00, '29,28,25', 'The Citrine Dome Tree is a shiny centerpiece that channels the sun\'s warmth and energy into your space. Known as the \"Merchant’s Stone,\" this tree attracts prosperity, enhances creativity, and fosters emotional balance. Its vibrant golden color brings a sense of joy and optimism, making it a perfect addition to any environment seeking abundance and positive energy.', 'The Citrine crystal tree emits positive vibrations, dispelling negativity and creating a joyful atmosphere. \nCitrine’s connection to the solar plexus chakra empowers self-confidence and strengthens personal power. \nCitrine is known for improving mental clarity, concentration, and decision-making skills.', 'Place the Citrine Dome Tree on your altar or desk to focus intentions and goals. \nPosition it in the southeast corner of your home or office to attract abundance. \nKeep it nearby during meditation to enhance clarity and concentration.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'citrine-dome-tree', 'Citrine Dome Tree_1.png', 'Citrine Dome Tree_2.jpg', 'Citrine Dome Tree_3.jpg', 'Citrine Dome Tree_4.jpg', 'Citrine Dome Tree_5.jpg', 'Citrine Dome Tree_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(176, 'Sandalwood & Rose Incense Sticks', 'sandalwood-rose-incense-sticks', 598.00, 499.00, '5', '<p>Fill your space with calming fragrance using our combo of Sandalwood incense sticks &amp; Rose Incense Sticks. Blending the earthy warmth of sandal dhoop sticks and the gentle floral aroma of rose dhoop sticks, these incense sticks create a soothing atmosphere. They are also the best gift option for loved ones.</p>', 'Promotes relaxation with calming sandalwood and soothing rose fragrance. \nCreates a peaceful environment for meditation, prayer, or daily rituals. \nNatural aromas help refresh rooms and instantly uplift the mood. \nPerfect for reducing stress and enhancing spiritual connection.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'sandalwood-and-rose-incense-sticks', 'Sandalwood & Rose Incense Sticks_1.jpg', 'Sandalwood & Rose Incense Sticks_2.jpg', 'Sandalwood & Rose Incense Sticks_3.jpg', 'Sandalwood & Rose Incense Sticks_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(177, 'Lavender & Rose Incense Sticks', 'lavender-rose-incense-sticks', 598.00, 499.00, '5', '<p>The Lavender &amp; Rose Incense Stick Combo is crafted to create a calming and refreshing atmosphere. Lavender incense helps reduce stress and promotes relaxation, while rose incense brings warmth, love, and positivity. This incense stick combo is perfect for meditation, prayers, or simply refreshing your home with soothing and long-lasting natural fragrances every day.</p>', 'Promotes relaxation and relieves stress through a soothing lavender aroma. \nRose incense enhances positivity, love, and warmth in the surroundings. \nIdeal for meditation, prayers, and spiritual practices at home. \nNatural fragrance creates a refreshing, peaceful, and uplifting environment daily.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'lavender-and-rose-incense-sticks', 'Lavender & Rose Incense Sticks_1.jpg', 'Lavender & Rose Incense Sticks_2.jpg', 'Lavender & Rose Incense Sticks_3.jpg', 'Lavender & Rose Incense Sticks_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(178, 'Sandalwood, Lavender, Rose Incense Sticks', 'sandalwood-lavender-rose-incense-sticks', 999.00, 649.00, '5', '<p>This combo incense stick pack includes sandalwood incense sticks, lavender incense sticks, and rose incense sticks. Each fragrance is carefully crafted to uplift mood, purify spaces, and create a calming atmosphere. Perfect for meditation, relaxation, or daily rituals, this set makes an ideal addition to your home or for gifting.</p>', 'Sandalwood incense stick enhances focus and creates a serene, spiritual environment. \nLavender incense stick relieves stress and promotes restful sleep with soothing fragrance. \nRose incense sticks uplift mood and spread love, harmony, and positivity. \nCombo incense stick pack offers variety for meditation, rituals, and everyday relaxation.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'sandalwood-lavender-rose-incense-sticks', 'Sandalwood, Lavender, Rose Incense Sticks_1.jpg', 'Sandalwood, Lavender, Rose Incense Sticks_2.jpg', 'Sandalwood, Lavender, Rose Incense Sticks_3.jpg', 'Sandalwood, Lavender, Rose Incense Sticks_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(179, 'Yellow Aventurine Pendant', 'yellow-aventurine-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '36,24', 'The yellow aventurine pendant brings positive energy and emotional balance into your life. Its natural healing properties support confidence, focus, and inner calm. Lightweight, stylish, and set in a durable stainless steel frame with a matching chain, this pendant is perfect for daily wear. It enhances your overall well-being while adding a subtle, elegant touch to your outfit.', 'Promotes happiness, positivity, and emotional balance. \nSupports confidence, focus, and personal growth naturally. \nEnhances inner peace while reducing stress and negativity.', 'Wear the yellow aventurine pendant daily around your neck to absorb its healing vibrations. \nKeep it close during meditation for focus, clarity, and peaceful energy. \nCleanse it regularly with sage smoke or by placing it under clean running water for a few minutes. \nRecharge under moonlight or a selenite plate to restore its natural positive energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'yellow-aventurine-pendant', 'Yellow Aventurine Pendant_1.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Pendant_2.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Pendant_3.jpg', 'Yellow Aventurine Pendant_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(180, 'Red Coral/Moonga - Triangular (Italian)', 'red-coralmoonga-triangular-italian', 13891.00, 13891.00, '23', 'Italian Triangular Red Coral, also known as Moonga, is a striking gemstone recognized for its unique triangular shape and deep red color. Wearing this natural triangle coral stone is believed to boost courage, confidence, and energy. Along with its astrological benefits, its unique design makes it a meaningful and thoughtful gift for someone special.', 'Enhances courage and confidence, helping you face challenges with strength. Brings good luck, prosperity, and protection from harmful negative energies. Supports vitality and determination, improving focus on important life goals. Triangular Moonga benefits include balancing emotions and guiding toward inner stability.', 'Wear the triangular red coral in a gold or silver ring or the pendant for maximum benefits. \nConsult an astrologer to confirm the correct weight and the suitable finger for wearing. \nClean gently with a soft cloth, avoiding chemicals to keep the natural shine intact. \nRecharge by placing under moonlight overnight, restoring positive vibrations and healing energies.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'red-coralmoonga-triangular-italian', 'Red CoralMoonga - Triangular (Italian)_1.jpg', 'Red CoralMoonga - Triangular (Italian)_2.jpg', 'Red CoralMoonga - Triangular (Italian)_3.jpg', 'Red CoralMoonga - Triangular (Italian)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(181, 'Pyrite Tree', 'pyrite-tree', 1999.00, 1399.00, '4,28,21,25', 'Invite prosperity and protection into your space with this Pyrite Tree. Crafted with raw pyrite stones, it symbolizes wealth, confidence, and stability while adding elegance to your decor. A unique piece of natural beauty, this tree also makes an ideal gift option for loved ones.', 'Attracts prosperity and financial abundance into your home or office. \nPromotes confidence, motivation, and positive decision-making in daily life. \nProvides energetic protection against negativity and harmful influences. \nEnhances focus and determination for achieving personal and professional goals.', 'Place the Pyrite Tree in your home or office to invite wealth and prosperity. \nKeep it on your work desk to enhance confidence, focus, and success energies. \nCleanse occasionally with sage smoke or keep under moonlight for energy recharging. \nDust gently with a soft cloth to maintain shine and natural crystal appearance.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-tree', 'Pyrite Tree_1.jpg', 'Pyrite Tree_2.jpg', 'Pyrite Tree_3.jpg', 'Pyrite Tree_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(182, 'Tiger Eye Pyramid', 'tiger-eye-pyramid', 1999.00, 1549.00, '4', 'This trendy and aesthetic Tiger Eye Pyramid brings balance and positive energy to any space. Known for its natural beauty, it’s perfect for gifting and enhancing home décor. Its powerful energy helps promote focus, confidence, and inner strength, making it a thoughtful present for your loved ones.', '• Boosts confidence and courage while reducing stress and negativity. \n• Enhances focus and mental clarity for better decision making. \n• Attracts positive energy and brings balance to your surroundings.', 'Place the Tiger Eye Pyramid in your living room or workspace for positive vibes. \n• Keep it on your study or work desk to improve focus and concentration. \n• Recharge it by placing on a selenite plate or in natural moonlight overnight. \n• Clean gently with a soft dry cloth to maintain its natural shine and energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'tiger-eye-pyramid', 'Tiger Eye Pyramid_1.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Pyramid_2.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Pyramid_3.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Pyramid_4.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Pyramid_5.jpg', 'Tiger Eye Pyramid_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(183, 'Orange Carnelian Tumble', 'orange-carnelian-tumble', 699.00, 599.00, '29', 'The Orange Carnelian Tumble is a vibrant stone known for its energizing and creative properties. This beautiful orange stone enhances vitality and motivation, making it a perfect addition to your collection. Trendy and aesthetic, it’s ideal for those looking to boost energy and creativity in a natural, spiritual way.', 'Boosts creativity and productivity. \nEnhances vitality and helps in overcoming emotional blockages. \nKnown for promoting confidence and grounding your energy.', 'Keep the Orange Carnelian Tumble on your desk to stimulate creativity and energy. \nCarry it in your pocket or purse to feel energized throughout the day. \nUse it during meditation to increase focus and motivation. \nRecharge the stone by placing it on a selenite plate overnight for enhanced energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'orange-carnelian-tumble', 'Orange Carnelian Tumble_1.jpg', 'Orange Carnelian Tumble_2.jpg', 'Orange Carnelian Tumble_3.jpg', 'Orange Carnelian Tumble_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(184, '2 Mukhi Rudraksha', '2-mukhi-rudraksha', 932.00, 899.00, '20', 'The 2 Mukhi Rudraksha is a highly revered bead, known for its powerful ability to bring balance and harmony in relationships. It is considered ideal for fostering peace between partners and promoting emotional well-being. You can consider this original 2 Mukhi Rudraksha to clear blockages in both personal and professional aspects of your life.', 'Strengthens relationships by improving communication and understanding. \nPromotes harmony and peace between partners, both in love and business. \nBalances the energies of the mind and body for emotional well-being. \nEnhances inner peace and helps in resolving conflicts or misunderstandings.', 'Wear the “Do Mukhi Rudraksha” as a pendant or bracelet for continuous energy flow and protection. \nUse it during meditation to help foster harmony and strengthen personal connections. \nRecharge the Rudraksha by placing it on a selenite plate to cleanse its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '2-mukhi-rudraksha', '2 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '2 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '2 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(185, '6 Mukhi Rudraksha', '6-mukhi-rudraksha', 758.00, 799.00, '20', 'The 6 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful bead known for its unique spiritual and healing properties. It’s recommended for those seeking to enhance mental clarity, personal growth, and emotional stability. This original 6 Mukhi Rudraksha is a trendy and aesthetic addition to your spiritual collection, offering benefits that go beyond protection. Perfect for gifting and personal use.', 'Promotes mental clarity, helping to remove confusion and stress. Supports spiritual growth and alignment of the inner self. Helps in controlling negative emotions and overcoming challenges in life.', 'Wear the 6 Mukhi Rudraksha as a pendant around your neck for continuous spiritual benefits.\nUse it as a mala during meditation to improve focus and inner peace.\nRecharge the Rudraksha by placing it on a selenite plate to cleanse and renew its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '6-mukhi-rudraksha', '6 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '6 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '6 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '6 Mukhi Rudraksha_5.png', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(186, '3 Mukhi Rudraksha', '3-mukhi-rudraksha', 699.00, 699.00, '20', 'The 3 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and trendy sacred bead known for its divine energy. It enhances communication, confidence, and spiritual growth while promoting balance in mind, body, and soul. Ideal for meditation, daily wear, or worship, it brings positivity, protection, and prosperity into your life.', 'Boosts self-confidence, communication, and courage. \nEncourages spiritual growth, meditation, and inner wisdom. \nHelps reduce stress, anxiety, and emotional obstacles. \nAttracts prosperity, positivity, and divine blessings. \nMaintains harmony between mind, body, and soul.', 'Wear the 3 Mukhi Rudraksha on a thread or silver/gold chain close to your heart or as a bracelet to absorb its powerful energy. \nUse during meditation or prayers to strengthen focus, communication, and spiritual connection. \nPlace it in your worship space or workplace for constant positivity and protection. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and gently wipe with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by keeping it in sunlight, on a selenite plate, or by chanting mantras nearby.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '3-mukhi-rudraksha', '3 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.png', '3 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '3 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(187, 'Sambrani Cups', 'sambrani-cups', 799.00, 549.00, '5', '<p>Sambrani Cups are organic dhoop cups made from natural resins and herbs. Known for their low smoke and rich earthy fragrance, they help cleanse spaces, uplift moods, and invite positivity. Widely used in homes and temples, these sambrani dhoop cups create a peaceful spiritual atmosphere, ideal for rituals, meditation, or refreshing your surroundings with purity.</p>', 'Purifies the air and removes negative energies from surroundings. \nCreates a calming and peaceful atmosphere during prayers or meditation. \nTraditional fragrance uplifts mood and supports emotional balance. \nNatural ingredients ensure an authentic and long-lasting aromatic experience.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'sambrani-cups', 'Sambrani Cups_1.jpg', 'Sambrani Cups_2.jpg', 'Sambrani Cups_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(188, 'Mogra Incense Stick', 'mogra-incense-stick', 299.00, 249.00, '5', '<p>Bring home the calming fragrance of mogra incense sticks, known for their calming floral aroma. These premium mogra dhoop sticks create a refreshing atmosphere that uplifts the mood and helps you relax. Ideal for meditation, prayer, or daily use, they are also a thoughtful gift option for loved ones.</p>', 'Calms the senses with the natural floral aroma of mogra. \nCreates a peaceful environment perfect for prayers, meditation, and relaxation. \nHelps uplift mood and promote positivity throughout the day. \nLong-lasting fragrance makes daily rituals more refreshing and easier.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'mogra-incense-stick', 'Mogra Incense Stick_1.jpg', 'Mogra Incense Stick_2.jpg', 'Mogra Incense Stick_3.jpg', 'Mogra Incense Stick_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 0),
(189, '7 Chakra Black Tourmaline Bracelet', '7-chakra-black-tourmaline-bracelet', 1999.00, 699.00, '7', 'This bracelet is crafted with natural Black Tourmaline beads and 7 chakra stones. Black Tourmaline is valued for its grounding and protective qualities, while chakra stones encourage balance and harmony. Together, they create a powerful bracelet that grounds your energy and adds a touch of elegance to your look.', 'Protects against negativity and unwanted influences. \nBalances the seven chakras for energy flow and harmony. \nPromotes grounding and emotional stability in daily life.', 'Wear it on your left wrist to absorb grounding and balancing vibrations. \nUse during meditation or yoga for chakra alignment and inner stability. \nRecharge under moonlight to restore its natural protective and healing energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-black-tourmaline-bracelet', '7 Chakra Black Tourmaline Bracelet_1.jpg', '7 Chakra Black Tourmaline Bracelet_2.jpg', '7 Chakra Black Tourmaline Bracelet_3.jpg', '7 Chakra Black Tourmaline Bracelet_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(190, 'Howlite 7 Chakra Bracelet', 'howlite-7-chakra-bracelet', 1999.00, 499.00, '7', 'The Howlite 7 Chakra Bracelet features natural white Howlite beads combined with 7 chakra stones, creating a perfect blend of calmness and balance. Its smooth, marble-like finish adds elegance, while the chakra beads promote harmony. Call it a versatile accessory that has all the vibes for style while supporting spiritual and emotional well-being.', 'Helps reduce stress and brings calm, peaceful vibrations. \nBalances seven chakras for inner harmony and overall energy flow. \nEncourages patience and emotional stability in daily life.', 'Wear on your left wrist to connect with calming and balancing energies. \nUse during meditation or yoga to enhance focus and spiritual alignment. \nCleanse monthly by rinsing under water or using sage smoke gently. \nRecharge under moonlight to restore chakra energy and positive vibrations.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'howlite-7-chakra-bracelet', 'Howlite 7 Chakra Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Howlite 7 Chakra Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Howlite 7 Chakra Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Howlite 7 Chakra Bracelet_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(191, '7 Chakra Selenite Plate', '7-chakra-selenite-plate', 1999.00, 699.00, '5', 'The 7 Chakra Selenite Plate is a crystal plate designed with 7 chakra symbols engraved on it. Often used for keeping small spiritual items, bracelets, or stones. Selenite plates are commonly used as charging plates, where people place their accessories for some time as part of their routine. The engraved chakra symbols represent balance and alignment, making the plate suitable for a meditation space, desk, or personal shelf. Its smooth surface and simple design make it easy to use daily without any setup.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nPeople who are using crystal accessories\n\nIndividuals who meditate or chant\n\nAnyone setting up a spiritual space or meditation space. \n\nThose who are looking for authentic spiritual tools.\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Selenite Stone\n\nDimension\n\n8 cm \n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace on table, shelf, or altar\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from water & chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-selenite-plate', '7 Chakra Selenite Plate_1.jpg', '7 Chakra Selenite Plate_2.jpg', '7 Chakra Selenite Plate_3.jpg', '7 Chakra Selenite Plate_4.jpg', '7 Chakra Selenite Plate_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(192, 'Hanuman Keychain', 'hanuman-keychain', 499.00, 499.00, '18', 'The Hanuman Keychain is designed for those who like keeping devotional symbols with them in daily life. The design features Lord Hanuman’s gada, which is often linked with strength, courage, and protection. Many people keep such keychains with their bike keys, car keys, or house keys as a reminder to stay confident and fearless. Its compact size makes it easy to carry every day without adding extra weight, while the simple design gives it a traditional and meaningful look.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nDevotees of Lord Hanuman\n\nPeople who like spiritual accessories\n\nBike and car owners\n\nAnyone looking for a symbolic keychain\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nPremium Metal with Karungali Wood Finish\n\nDimension\n\nLength - 11 cm \n\nBest Use\n\nUse with bike, car, or house keys\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and away from chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'hanuman-keychain', 'Hanuman Keychain_1.jpg', 'Hanuman Keychain_2.jpg', 'Hanuman Keychain_3.jpg', 'Hanuman Keychain_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(193, 'Karungali Vel with Stand', 'karungali-vel-with-stand', 999.00, 749.00, '18', 'The Karungali Vel with Stand is made from natural Karungali wood, known for its grounding and protective significance in spiritual practices. The Vel, associated with divine power and courage, is a symbol of strength and protection. Designed with a stable stand, it can be placed in your home, workspace, or car to create a focused and spiritually balanced environment. Its compact and clean design makes it suitable for everyday placement while adding a meaningful presence to your space.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nDevotees who keep spiritual symbols in their space\n\nIndividuals seeking protection-focused décor\n\nPeople setting up pooja or meditation areas\n\nAnyone looking for a meaningful spiritual gift\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Karungali Ebony Wood\n\nDimension\n\n9.5cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace on work / study desk, pooja area, or dashboard of your car \n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and clean with soft cloth', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-vel-with-stand', 'Karungali Vel with Stand_1.jpg', 'Karungali Vel with Stand_2.jpg', 'Karungali Vel with Stand_3.jpg', 'Karungali Vel with Stand_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(194, 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise', 'vastu-dhan-yog-tortoise', 999.00, 699.00, '4', 'The Dhan Yog Tortoise is designed to represent stability, patience, and steady financial growth. Made using natural stones like raw pyrite, green aventurine, citrine, and amethyst, it combines symbols often associated with confidence, opportunity, clarity, and balance. The tortoise is traditionally linked with long-term progress and grounded success, making it suitable for workspaces, desks, or personal areas where focus and consistency are important.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals focused on financial growth\n\nProfessionals building long-term stability\n\nPeople setting up workspace décor\n\nAnyone who prefers symbolic desk accessories\n\nSomeone looking for a perfect gift option for a colleague\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Raw Pyrite, Natural Green Aventurine, Natural Citrine, Natural Amethyst\n\nDimension\n\n7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace on work desk, study table, or personal space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nClean with dry cloth; avoid moisture', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'vastu-dhan-yog-tortoise', 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise_1.jpg', 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise_2.jpg', 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise_3.jpg', 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise_4.jpg', 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise_5.jpg', 'Vastu Dhan Yog Tortoise_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(195, 'Diamond Cut Pyrite Bracelet', 'diamond-cut-pyrite-bracelet', 1499.00, 849.00, '7,21', 'Astrologer RaajeevG\'s Pyrite Bracelet Diamond Cut is designed for those who like accessories that combine style with meaning. The diamond-cut finish gives the beads a bright and sharp look. Pyrite is often linked with confidence, determination, and a strong approach toward goals. Many people wear pyrite bracelets as a reminder to stay focused and disciplined in their daily routine. Its stretchable design makes it easy to wear regularly, whether at work, traveling, or in personal time.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who are working toward financial goals\n\nProfessionals who prefer crystal bracelets\n\nMeaningful gift option for men & women \n\nAnyone looking for a daily wear bracelet \n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Pyrite Stone, Durable and strong elastic \n\nDimension\n\n22 Beads (8mm)\nDiameter: 7cm\n\nHow to Wear\n\nWear on your dominant wrist. \n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from water, perfumes, & harsh chemicals. Clean it with a dry cloth, and use a selenite plate for charging.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'diamond-cut-pyrite-bracelet', 'Diamond Cut Pyrite Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Diamond Cut Pyrite Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Diamond Cut Pyrite Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Diamond Cut Pyrite Bracelet_4.jpg', 'Diamond Cut Pyrite Bracelet_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(196, 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant', 'gold-plated-evil-eye-pendant', 1999.00, 1399.00, '19,24', 'The Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant is designed for those who prefer meaningful jewelry with a clean and minimal look. The evil eye symbol is traditionally associated with protection from unwanted attention and negative influences. Made from brass with a gold-plated finish, this pendant has a simple yet elegant design suitable for daily wear. It pairs easily with both modern and traditional outfits, making it a versatile accessory for regular use.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nWomen who prefer symbolic jewelry\n\nThose who like authentic evil eye accessories\n\nPeople looking for daily wear made of brass\n\nAnyone searching for a meaningful gift\n\nAttribute\n\nDetails\n\nMaterial\n\nBrass with Gold Plating\n\nDimension\n\nDiameter - 2.3 cm\n\nHow to wear\n\nWear around the neck \n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfume, and chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gold-plated-evil-eye-pendant', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant_1.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant_2.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant_3.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant_4.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant_5.jpg', 'Gold Plated Evil Eye Pendant_7.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(197, 'Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo', 'evil-eye-bracelet-and-anklet-combo', 2499.00, 1349.00, '14,19', 'Stay protected wherever you go with the Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo. The Evil Eye Bracelet and Evil Eye Anklet are designed to be worn daily as symbols of protection against negative influences. Together, they help maintain a positive mindset, emotional balance, and a sense of safety throughout the day. This combo is ideal for those who prefer meaningful accessories that combine style with protective symbolism.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who love to wear protective symbols\n\nThose who prefer wearable spiritual accessories\n\nPeople who travel or go out frequently\n\nAnyone looking for a meaningful gift option for their loved ones\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nMetal & Evil Eye Beads\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: Dia - 7cm, 8mm  and Adjustable ankle fit\n\nHow to wear\n\nWear a bracelet on the wrist and an anklet on your feet daily. \n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfume, and chemicals', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer 🎁 Add to cart for Free Gifts above ₹999 ₹1349 ₹2499 46% Off M.R.P. (incl of all taxes) Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo', 'evil-eye-bracelet-and-anklet-combo', 'Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo_1.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo_2.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo_3.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo_4.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet & Anklet Combo_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(198, 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate', 'amethyst-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 2499.00, 1549.00, '14', 'Astrologer RaajeevG’s Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate is made for those who want to stay calm, focused, and mentally clear in their daily life. The Amethyst Bracelet is often associated with clarity, awareness, and a steady mind, making it suitable for meditation, study, or work. The Selenite Charging Plate helps refresh the bracelet regularly so it can be worn with the same intention. Together, this set supports concentration, emotional balance, and a peaceful routine.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who are practicing meditation or mindfulness\n\nPeople willing to boost their mental clarity\n\nThose who prefer to wear crystal accessories daily\n\nAnyone seeking calm and focus\n\n \n\nAttribute\n\nDetails\n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Stone beads & Raw Selenite Plate\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 22 Beads (8mm), Diameter: 7cm\nCharging Plate: Diameter: 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate_1.jpg', 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate_2.jpg', 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate_3.jpg', 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate_5.jpg', 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate_6.png', 'Amethyst Bracelet with Charging Plate_7.png', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(199, 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate', 'rose-quartz-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 1999.00, 999.00, '14', 'Astrologer RaajeevG’s Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate is designed for those who want to stay connected with feelings of love, warmth, and emotional balance. The Rose Quartz Bracelet is known as a symbol of affection, harmony, and self-love, while the Selenite Charging Plate helps refresh and maintain the bracelet’s energy over time. Using them together supports a calm mindset, emotional clarity, and a steady sense of connection in daily life.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals seeking emotional balance\n\nPeople focusing on love and relationships\n\nThose who use charging plates for accessories\n\nAnyone who prefers meaningful daily wear\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Stone Bracelet & Selenite Plate\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm Bead, Dia - 7cm, Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rose-quartz-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate_1.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate_2.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate_3.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate_4.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate_5.png', 'Rose Quartz Bracelet with Charging Plate_6.png', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(200, 'Focus & Wealth Combo', 'focus-and-wealth-combo', 2499.00, 1349.00, '14', 'Success in business requires both steady action and a stable environment. The Focus & Wealth Business Combo brings together the Pyrite Tortoise and the Dhan Vriddhi Bracelet to support financial discipline and workplace focus. The Pyrite Tortoise is traditionally associated with stability, protection, and grounded growth. The Dhan Vriddhi Bracelet is made with natural stones like pyrite, jade, sunstone, quartz, red carnelian, and tiger eye. These stones are selected for their association with confidence, clarity, and disciplined wealth-building. \n\nJust wear the bracelet daily and keep the tortoise at your workstation or business desk, together they\'ll create a focused and growth-oriented business environment.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nBusiness owners focused on structured financial growth\n\nProfessionals who are building long-term career stability\n\nEntrepreneurs who value both action and environmental alignment\n\nAnyone setting up a new office or upgrading their workspace\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Pyrite, along with Jade, Sunstone, Quartz, Red Carnelian, and Tiger Eye\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: Dia - 7cm, 8mm Bead size, Tortoise: 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace tortoise on work desk; wear bracelet daily\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals. Clean gently with a dry cloth.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'focus-and-wealth-combo', 'Focus & Wealth Combo_1.jpg', 'Focus & Wealth Combo_2.jpg', 'Focus & Wealth Combo_3.jpg', 'Focus & Wealth Combo_4.jpg', 'Focus & Wealth Combo_5.jpg', 'Focus & Wealth Combo_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(201, 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo', 'vastu-protection-and-prosperity-combo', 2499.00, 1599.00, '14,19', 'A peaceful home begins with protected energy and steady prosperity. This combo brings together the Evil Eye Door Hanging and the Kachhua with 7 Chakra Charging Plate. The Evil Eye hanging helps shield your entrance from negative influences, while the pyrite tortoise symbolizes stability and long-term growth. Paired with the chakra charging plate, this set supports balanced energy and a positive environment within your living space.\n\n \n\nWho Is It For?\n\nHomeowners who need positive energy in their living space\n\nIndividuals who believe in Vastu-inspired home décor\n\nFamilies looking to create a peaceful and stable home environment\n\nAnyone looking for a meaningful housewarming gift\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Pyrite, Durable Glass, Authentic Selenite\n\nDimension\n\nTortoise : 7cm, Plate: 8 cm and Height: 20-22 cm, Diameter: 5-6cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nHang at entrance; place tortoise inside living space\n\nCare Instruction\n\n Wipe gently with a dry cloth; keep away from moisture', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'vastu-protection-and-prosperity-combo', 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo_1.jpg', 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo_2.jpg', 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo_3.jpg', 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo_4.jpg', 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo_5.jpg', 'Vastu Protection & Prosperity Combo_7.png', 1, '4.5', '0', 1);
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `product_name`, `slug`, `price`, `sale_price`, `categories`, `description`, `benefit`, `how_to_use`, `return_exchange`, `disclaimer`, `photo_folder`, `photo1`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `is_in_stock`, `product_review`, `is_ratti`, `is_active`) VALUES
(202, '1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra', '1-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant-with-mantra', 11999.00, 6999.00, '24,20', 'This 1 Mukhi Rudraksha locket is made with a natural Ek Mukhi Rudraksha and a Maa Lakshmi pendant, traditionally associated with clarity, prosperity, and spiritual focus. Worn close to the heart, it is believed to support disciplined thinking, inner calm, and mindful actions. The pendant has been energized and blessed by a priest through sacred Vedic rituals at a temple, filling the locket with positive energy. It is perfect for daily wear by anyone seeking balance and purpose\n\nWho Is This For?\n\nIndividuals on a spiritual or devotional path\n\nPeople who meditate, chant, or practice mindfulness\n\nThose seeking meaningful jewelry with spiritual value\n\nAnyone looking for a thoughtful and sacred gift', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '1-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant-with-mantra', '1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_1.png', '1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_2.png', '1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_3.png', '1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_4.png', '1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(203, 'Siddh 7 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha', 1500.00, 819.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 7 Mukhi Rudraksha is a divine, spiritual bead renowned for its premium quality and powerful energy. Also known as the “7 Face Rudraksha,” it supports prosperity, self-confidence, and protection from negativity. Ideal for meditation, prayers, or daily wear, it harmonizes mind, body, and soul while attracting blessings and positivity.', 'Enhances self-confidence, willpower, and mental clarity. \nAttracts abundance, prosperity, and divine blessings. \nSupports spiritual growth, meditation, and inner balance. \nProtects from negative energies and emotional stress. \nStrengthens decision-making, focus, and leadership qualities.', 'Wear the 7 Mukhi Rudraksha original bead as a necklace or a bracelet on a thread or gold/silver chain to absorb its spiritual vibrations. \nUse during meditation, prayers, or worship to enhance focus, divine connection, and calmness. \nKeep in your sacred space or altar for continuous protection and positive energy. \nClean gently with clean water and a soft cloth occasionally. \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight for a few minutes or by chanting mantras near it.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-7-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 7 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 7 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(204, 'Siddh Silver Plated Karungali Bracelet', 'siddh-silver-plated-karungali-bracelet', 1499.00, 999.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple. Made from original karungali wood with silver-plated accents, this bracelet brings together tradition and style. It protects your aura, balances energy, and elevates your everyday look. Purchase it for yourself to feel calm and confident, or gift it to someone who seeks both fashion and spiritual well-being.', 'Genuine karungali wood beads promote grounding and positive energy.\nSilver-plated detailing adds elegant charm and elevated visual appeal.\nProtects from negative influences while supporting mental clarity.\nIdeal gift accessory that fuses spiritual depth and refined style.', 'Wear the bracelet on either wrist, daily or during meditation or prayer.\nSet your intention or mantra while touching each bead for focused energy.\nKeep away from water, perfume, or harsh chemicals to maintain shine.\nWhen not in use, store the Mala in a clean cloth pouch or your puja space to preserve its sacred energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-silver-plated-karungali-bracelet', 'Siddh Silver Plated Karungali Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Siddh Silver Plated Karungali Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Siddh Silver Plated Karungali Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Siddh Silver Plated Karungali Bracelet_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(205, 'Evil Eye Jute Hanging', 'evil-eye-jute-hanging', 1499.00, 799.00, '19', 'The Evil Eye Jute Hanging symbolizes peace, clarity, and positive intentions. Traditionally associated with calm energy, the white evil eye is believed to promote emotional balance and harmony in surroundings. Its subtle design makes it ideal for homes, offices, or cars, adding a gentle decorative touch while reflecting mindful living and a thoughtful gifting option.', 'Neutral white design blends easily with different decor styles.\nIts size fits well in any space, without making it look crowded. \nLightweight makes it easy to hang in any place.\nSuitable for everyday decor or simple gifting purposes.', 'Hang near doors, windows, shelves, or wall hooks\nSuitable for car rearview mirrors without obstructing visibility\nKeep away from water to maintain the surface finish.\nClean gently using a soft, dry cloth', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-jute-hanging', 'Evil Eye Jute Hanging_1.jpg', 'Evil Eye Jute Hanging_2.jpg', 'Evil Eye Jute Hanging_3.png', 'Evil Eye Jute Hanging_4.jpg', 'Evil Eye Jute Hanging_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(206, 'Hamsa Evil Eye Hanging', 'hamsa-evil-eye-hanging', 1499.00, 899.00, '19', 'Protect your home with this beautiful Hamsa Evil Eye Hanging. Designed for doors or walls, it brings positive energy and wards off negative vibes. Made with durable materials, its vibrant design adds charm to any space. Perfect as a thoughtful gift or a decorative accent for your home.', 'Wards off negative energy and protects your home environment naturally.\nAdds a vibrant, decorative touch to doors or walls instantly.\nEasy to hang and fits perfectly in any home decor style.\nA premium yet budget friendly gift option for housewarming parties or for your loved ones.', 'Hang it on your main door to invite positive energy inside.\nPlace it on a wall in the living or study area easily.\nUse the rope for secure hanging without damaging walls or doors.\nClean gently with a soft cloth to maintain its vibrant design.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'hamsa-evil-eye-hanging', 'Hamsa Evil Eye Hanging_1.jpg', 'Hamsa Evil Eye Hanging_2.jpg', 'Hamsa Evil Eye Hanging_3.jpg', 'Hamsa Evil Eye Hanging_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(207, 'Pyrite Pyramid', 'pyrite-pyramid', 1999.00, 1249.00, '4,21', 'Elevate your space with this stylish and beautiful Pyrite Pyramid, a trendy piece ideal for gifting. Made from genuine pyrite, also known as fool’s gold, this pyramid is believed to attract abundance, success, and positive energy. Place it in your home or office to add a meaningful and striking décor accent filled with intention.', 'Invites wealth and financial growth to your home or workspace.\nBoosts confidence, will‑power, and clarity, supporting your goals.\nProvides an energy shield against negativity and blocks distractions.\nAmplifies manifestation through its symbolic pyramid shape and material.', 'Place the pyramid in the wealth zone (southeast corner) of your room.\nKeep it on your desk or cash box for business or financial growth.\nUse during meditation or intention‑setting to amplify manifestation.\nGift it to someone seeking success, style, and meaningful decor.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There’s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pyrite-pyramid', 'Pyrite Pyramid_1.jpg', 'Pyrite Pyramid_2.jpg', 'Pyrite Pyramid_3.jpg', 'Pyrite Pyramid_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(208, 'Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka On Raw Pyrite Frame', 'lakshmi-ji-charan-paduka-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 1999.00, 999.00, '5,21,22', 'Invite divine blessings and prosperity into your home with the Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka Frame. This sacred symbol represents the footprints of Goddess Lakshmi, bringing wealth, positivity, and harmony. Perfect for home or workplace altars, it’s designed to attract abundance and create a peaceful spiritual atmosphere.', 'Symbolizes the divine arrival of Goddess Lakshmi, welcoming fortune into your space.\nActs as an auspicious decor element, enhancing the sacred beauty of your altar.\nCrafted with fine detailing, making it a perfect blend of spirituality and art.\nBrings a sense of calmness and faith to your daily worship rituals.', 'Keep chanting “Om Shreem Hreem Shreem Kamale Kamalalaye Praseed Praseed, Om Shreem Hreem Shreem Mahalakshmaye Namah” to set clear intentions and continuous energy flow.\nInstall the frame facing east or north direction for maximum spiritual benefits.\nClean gently with a soft, dry cloth to maintain its shine and purity.\nYou can place it near your cash box, locker, or business desk for prosperity.\nRecite Goddess Lakshmi’s mantra while offering flowers or lighting a diya nearby.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lakshmi-ji-charan-paduka-on-raw-pyrite-frame', 'Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka On Raw Pyrite Frame_1.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka On Raw Pyrite Frame_2.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka On Raw Pyrite Frame_3.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka On Raw Pyrite Frame_4.jpg', 'Lakshmi Ji Charan Paduka On Raw Pyrite Frame_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(209, 'Clear Quartz Tower', 'clear-quartz-tower', 999.00, 949.00, '4', 'The Clear Quartz Tower is a stunning crystal that channels pure, positive energy. Known as the \"master healer,\" this crystal amplifies your intentions, bringing clarity and balance to your life. Its beautiful tower shape radiates healing energy, transforming any space into an altar of peace, protection, and spiritual growth.', 'Amplifies energy and intentions, helping you manifest your desires. \nKnown as the “master healer,” it promotes emotional and physical healing. \nProtects against negative energy and brings clarity to your mind and thoughts. \nIdeal for use during meditation to clear blockages and restore balance.', 'Place the Clear Quartz Tower in your living room or workspace to enhance energy flow. \nRecharge it under the full moon or on a selenite plate to renew its energy. \nUse it during healing sessions to amplify the energy of other crystals.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'clear-quartz-tower', 'Clear Quartz Tower_1.jpg', 'Clear Quartz Tower_2.jpg', 'Clear Quartz Tower_3.jpg', 'Clear Quartz Tower_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(210, 'Howlite Pendant', 'howlite-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '41,24', 'The Howlite pendant is a calming and stylish accessory that promotes relaxation, patience, and emotional healing. Known for its soothing energy, this howlite stone necklace helps reduce stress, improve focus, and encourage mindful living. Set in a durable stainless steel frame and chain, this aesthetic neckpiece is lightweight, stylish, and perfect for daily wear or gifting.', 'Promotes relaxation, calmness, and inner peace. \nHelps reduce stress, anger, and negative thoughts. \nSupports patience, focus, and mindful living. \nEncourages emotional healing and self-awareness.', 'Wear your howlite necklace daily to absorb its calming vibrations. \nKeep it close during meditation or yoga to deepen focus and mindfulness. \nCleanse the howlite stone regularly by placing it under clean running water or smudging it with sage. \nRecharge under moonlight or on a selenite plate to restore its soothing energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'howlite-pendant', 'Howlite Pendant_1.jpg', 'Howlite Pendant_2.jpg', 'Howlite Pendant_3.jpg', 'Howlite Pendant_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(211, 'Black Sun Stone Pendant', 'black-sun-stone-pendant', 1499.00, 999.00, '29,24', 'The beautiful Black Sun Stone Pendant is known for strength, energy, and protection. This crystal is believed to remove negativity while inspiring confidence and determination. Its dark, shiny tones add bold elegance to any outfit. The pendant comes with a chain, making it perfect for daily wear and gifting.', 'Protects from negativity and strengthens inner willpower. \nBoosts energy, motivation, and confidence during tough times. \nBalances energy flow, promoting emotional stability and focus.', 'Wear the pendant regularly to enhance strength and protective energy. \nUse incense or natural water to clean and refresh the crystal’s energy. \nRecharge under sunlight or moonlight to boost its grounding properties. \nAvoid rough handling to protect both the pendant and chain from damage.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'black-sun-stone-pendant', 'Black Sun Stone Pendant_1.jpg', 'Black Sun Stone Pendant_2.jpg', 'Black Sun Stone Pendant_3.jpg', 'Black Sun Stone Pendant_4.jpg', 'Black Sun Stone Pendant_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(212, 'Universal Chain', 'universal-chain', 999.00, 599.00, '24', 'This premium stainless steel chain is designed for everyday wear and pairs perfectly with your favorite pendants. Its sleek finish and sturdy build offer a modern look that rocks any outfit you wear. Lightweight yet durable, it’s ideal for casual outings, special occasions, and gifting purposes.', 'Crafted from high-quality stainless steel for lasting shine and strength. \nComplements pendants beautifully without overshadowing their design. \nLightweight and comfortable, suitable for daily wear or events. \nResistant to tarnish, making maintenance simple and hassle-free.', 'Attach any pendant securely to the chain’s clasp before wearing. \nPair with gemstone or spiritual pendants to enhance their visual appeal. \nClean occasionally with a soft cloth to maintain its natural luster. \nStore in a dry pouch to protect from scratches and moisture damage.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'universal-chain', 'Universal Chain_1.jpg', 'Universal Chain_2.jpg', 'Universal Chain_3.jpg', 'Universal Chain_4.png', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(213, 'Rhodonite Bracelet', 'rhodonite-bracelet', 1999.00, 1249.00, '7,34', 'Designed specifically for Taurus, this Rhodonite bracelet promotes emotional healing, self-love, and inner peace. Its soothing energy helps release past emotional wounds, fostering compassion and forgiveness. Add the aesthetic appeal to your outfit that aligns with your grounded nature as a Taurean!', 'Encourages emotional healing and self-love. \nFosters compassion and forgiveness. \nEnhances emotional balance and inner peace.', 'Wear on your left wrist to connect with the heart chakra. \nUse during meditation to enhance emotional clarity. \nCleanse regularly with sage or moonlight to maintain energy. \nStore in a soft pouch to protect from scratches.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rhodonite-bracelet', 'Rhodonite Bracelet_1.jpg', 'Rhodonite Bracelet_2.jpg', 'Rhodonite Bracelet_3.jpg', 'Rhodonite Bracelet_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(214, 'Pearl (Keshi)', 'pearl-keshi', 7632.00, 7632.00, '23,43', 'The Keshi Pearl Stone is a natural, lustrous gem known for its elegance and beauty. It is considered a symbol of purity, peace, and emotional healing. The pearl stone is believed to enhance mental clarity, balance emotions, and promote overall well-being. With its smooth surface and radiant shine, the natural pearl stone is perfect for anyone looking to improve relationships and boost self-confidence.', 'Promotes emotional healing, calming the mind, and reducing stress.\nEnhances mental clarity, improving focus and decision-making skills.\nBrings harmony and balance in relationships, fostering love and understanding.\nStrengthens intuition and self-confidence, helping you stay grounded.', 'Wear the pearl stone as a pendant or in a ring to activate its healing properties. \nSet the Keshi Pearl in silver or gold jewelry for enhanced energy. \nRecharge the natural pearl stone by placing it under moonlight or using a Selenite Plate. \nClean the gemstone regularly with a soft cloth to maintain its shine and purity.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pearl-keshi', 'Pearl (Keshi)_1.jpg', 'Pearl (Keshi)_2.jpg', 'Pearl (Keshi)_3.jpg', 'Pearl (Keshi)_4.jpg', 'Pearl (Keshi)_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '1', 1),
(215, 'Blue Sapphire/Neelam (Bangkok)', 'blue-sapphireneelam-bangkok', 7632.00, 7632.00, '42,23', 'The Bangkok Blue Sapphire (Neelam Ratna) is a premium gemstone known for its powerful energies, elegance, and modern appeal. Sourced from Bangkok, this neelam stone supports mental clarity, prosperity, and protection. With its deep blue charm, this trendy gemstone adds both aesthetic beauty and positive energy to your life.', 'Boosts focus, discipline, and confidence in personal and professional life. \nAttracts name, fame, wealth, prosperity, and long-term stability. \nProtects from negativity, stress, and emotional blockages. \nEnhances intuition, clarity, and spiritual growth. \nRadiates positive vibrations.', 'Wear the Bangkok Neelam Ratna as a ring or pendant set in silver or gold to absorb its energies. \nKeep the Bangkok Blue Sapphire in your workspace or home to enhance focus and positivity. \nUse during meditation to deepen concentration and spiritual awareness. \nClean gently with water and a soft cloth to maintain its shine. \nRecharge regularly by placing it on a selenite plate or exposing it to sunlight for a few minutes.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'blue-sapphireneelam-bangkok', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Bangkok)_1.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Bangkok)_2.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Bangkok)_3.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Bangkok)_4.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Bangkok)_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '1', 1),
(216, 'Ruby (Bangkok)', 'ruby-bangkok', 8886.00, 8886.00, '23', 'The Bangkok Ruby is a radiant gemstone admired for its deep red color and natural charm. Wearing an original ruby stone is believed to bring confidence, success, and energy. Known for its astrological significance, this natural ruby stone is also cherished as a timeless symbol of love, passion, and strength.', 'Enhances self-confidence and leadership qualities, attracting success in life. \nBrings positivity, prosperity, and protection from harmful negative influences. \nStrengthens energy, supporting overall physical and mental well-being. \nThe benefits of ruby stone include improved focus, determination, and clarity in decisions.', 'Wear a natural ruby stone in gold or copper for maximum astrological benefits. \nConsult an astrologer to confirm suitability, correct weight, and the best wearing finger. \nClean gently with a soft cloth, avoiding chemicals to preserve the ruby’s natural brilliance. \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight for a few hours to restore positive energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'ruby-bangkok', 'Ruby (Bangkok)_1.jpg', 'Ruby (Bangkok)_2.jpg', 'Ruby (Bangkok)_3.jpg', 'Ruby (Bangkok)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '1', 1),
(217, 'Hessonite/Gomed (Srilanka)', 'hessonitegomed-srilanka', 15364.00, 15364.00, '23', 'The Sri Lankan Hessonite (also called Gomed Gemstone) is a powerful gemstone known for its distinctive warm orange-brown color. Highly regarded in astrology, the Hessonite Gemstone is believed to provide numerous benefits and is perfect for those seeking to enhance their confidence, achieve success, and improve their emotional well-being.', 'Helps clear obstacles and bring prosperity in both personal and professional life. Boosts confidence, enhances self-esteem, and helps with decision-making. Relieves stress and promotes emotional healing by stabilizing mood and energy. Enhances spiritual growth, improving mental clarity and focus.', 'Wear the Gomed Gemstone on the middle or ring finger of the right hand for best results.\nSet the Hessonite Gemstone in a gold or silver ring to amplify its energy.\nRecharge the Sri Lankan Hessonite by placing it under moonlight or with a Selenite Plate.\nClean the gemstone regularly with a soft cloth to preserve its natural luster and power.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'hessonitegomed-srilanka', 'HessoniteGomed (Srilanka)_1.jpg', 'HessoniteGomed (Srilanka)_2.jpg', 'HessoniteGomed (Srilanka)_3.jpg', 'HessoniteGomed (Srilanka)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '1', 1),
(218, 'Emerald/Panna (Zambia)', 'emeraldpanna-zambia', 20136.00, 20136.00, '23', 'This Zambian Emerald (also known as Panna Gemstone) is popular for its rich green hue and exceptional quality. Sourced directly from Zambia, the natural Zambian Emerald is known for its healing properties and ability to promote prosperity. Consider it worthy for enhancing wisdom, boosting confidence, and bringing mental clarity.', 'Enhances intelligence and improves concentration, promoting clear thinking. \nAttracts abundance, success, and good fortune into your life. \nPromotes emotional healing and balance, relieving stress and anxiety. \nStrengthens relationships and fosters harmonious communication.', 'Wear the Panna Gemstone on the little finger of the right hand for optimal results. \nSet the original Panna gemstone in a gold or silver ring to enhance its energy. \nRecharge the emerald stone by placing it under the moonlight or using a Selenite Plate. \nClean the gemstone regularly with a soft cloth to maintain its brilliance and energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'emeraldpanna-zambia', 'EmeraldPanna (Zambia)_1.jpg', 'EmeraldPanna (Zambia)_2.jpg', 'EmeraldPanna (Zambia)_3.jpg', 'EmeraldPanna (Zambia)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '1', 1),
(219, 'Rose Quartz Tower', 'rose-quartz-tower', 999.00, 849.00, '27', 'This large Rose Quartz Tower is a stunning piece for any room and a thoughtful gift. Known as the stone of love and joy, it balances your heart chakra and helps create a peaceful, heart-centered environment. Its gentle energy supports emotional healing while beautifully complementing your home or workspace décor.', 'Encourages self-love and strengthens relationships with gentle energy.\nPromotes inner peace and emotional healing for a balanced heart.\nHelps create a warm, welcoming atmosphere in any space.', 'Place the tower in your bedroom or living room to attract loving energy. \nKeep it on your work desk to maintain a calm and positive mindset. \nRecharge monthly under moonlight or on a selenite plate for renewed energy. \nWipe gently with a soft, dry cloth to preserve its natural shine.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rose-quartz-tower', 'Rose Quartz Tower_1.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Tower_2.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Tower_3.jpg', 'Rose Quartz Tower_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(220, 'Blue Lace Agate Tumble', 'blue-lace-agate-tumble', 699.00, 599.00, '23', 'The Blue Lace Agate Tumble is known for its soft, soothing energy that brings calmness and peace. This gentle crystal helps ease worries, supports open communication, and reduces emotional tension. Easy to carry or place at home, it’s a wonderful stone for relaxation and positivity.', 'Encourages clear, confident, and positive communication with others. \nHelps calm anxious thoughts and promotes inner peace naturally. \nSupports emotional healing by gently releasing stress and tension. \nInspires positivity and balance in daily life experiences.', 'Carry the blue lace agate tumble in your pocket to ease daily stress. \nHold during meditation to invite relaxation and mental clarity. \nKeep it on your bedside table to encourage restful and peaceful sleep.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'blue-lace-agate-tumble', 'Blue Lace Agate Tumble_1.jpg', 'Blue Lace Agate Tumble_2.jpg', 'Blue Lace Agate Tumble_3.jpg', 'Blue Lace Agate Tumble_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '1', 1),
(221, '7 Chakra Pyramid', '7-chakra-pyramid', 1999.00, 1549.00, '4', 'Balance your mind, body, and energy with our beautiful 7 Chakra Pyramid. Crafted with seven crystals, this 7 chakra crystal pyramid harmonizes energy flow and promotes positivity. Known for its healing and balancing qualities, it is ideal for meditation, Reiki, or home décor, and also makes a thoughtful spiritual gift.', 'Balances all seven chakras for overall energy alignment and healing. \nEnhances focus, positivity, and emotional stability during daily practices. \nSupports meditation, Reiki, and spiritual growth with calming vibrations. \nPromotes harmony, balance, and wellness in the home or workspace.', 'Place the 7 Chakra Pyramid in your home, workplace, or meditation space to balance energies. \nKeep it on your work desk to enhance focus, clarity, and positive vibrations. \nUse during Reiki or healing sessions for chakra alignment and energy flow. \nCleanse regularly with moonlight or incense to maintain its healing properties.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-pyramid', '7 Chakra Pyramid_1.jpg', '7 Chakra Pyramid_2.jpg', '7 Chakra Pyramid_3.jpg', '7 Chakra Pyramid_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(222, '13 Mukhi Rudraksha', '13-mukhi-rudraksha', 10841.00, 10841.00, '20', 'The 13 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and sacred bead, revered for its energy of wealth, success, and protection. This premium-quality Rudraksha enhances focus, determination, and confidence, attracting abundance and positivity. Ideal for meditation, business, or daily wear, it balances mind, body, and soul while supporting spiritual and material growth.', 'Encourages confidence, focus, and determination in personal and professional life.\nAttracts wealth, prosperity, and success in ventures.\nReduces stress, negativity, and obstacles from life.\nOffers protection from negative energies and promotes inner strength.\nBalances mind, body, and soul for overall well-being.', 'The 13 Mukhi Rudraksha benefits you with positive vibrations when worn close to your heart on a thread, silver, or gold chain, or as a bracelet. \nUse it during meditation or prayers to enhance focus, determination, and spiritual growth. \nPlace the bead in your workplace or worship space to attract success, positivity, and protection. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge the Rudraksha by placing it on a selenite plate in sunlight for a few minutes, or keep it near you while chanting mantras.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '13-mukhi-rudraksha', '13 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '13 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '13 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(223, '4 Mukhi Rudraksha', '4-mukhi-rudraksha', 743.00, 743.00, '20', 'The 4 Mukhi Rudraksha is a divine and premium-quality bead that carries spiritual energy and blessings. Known for boosting creativity, confidence, and stability, it supports personal growth and mental clarity. Ideal for meditation, worship, or daily wear, this sacred Rudraksha attracts positivity, balance, and divine protection in your life.', 'Enhances creativity, focus, and self-confidence. \nPromotes emotional stability, calmness, and mental clarity. \nProtects from negative energies and stress. \nSupports spiritual growth and divine blessings. \nEncourages balance between mind, body, and soul.', 'Wear the 4 Mukhi Rudraksha original bead on a silver or gold chain, close to your heart, to absorb its divine vibrations. \nUse during meditation or prayer to boost concentration, mental clarity, and spiritual energy. \nPlace in your worship space or home for continuous positivity, protection, and blessings. \nClean occasionally with clean water and gently wipe with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by keeping it in sunlight for a few minutes or by chanting mantras near it.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '4-mukhi-rudraksha', '4 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '4 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '4 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '4 Mukhi Rudraksha_5.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(224, 'Camphor', 'camphor', 799.00, 549.00, '5', '<p>This premium camphor brings purity, positivity, and a refreshing atmosphere to your space. With its natural, divine fragrance, it is perfect for prayers, meditation, and daily rituals. Known as kapur, karpoor or kapoor for pooja, it uplifts energy, removes negativity, and creates a sacred environment, making every moment spiritually enriching and soothing.</p>', 'Purifies surroundings with a refreshing, divine fragrance. \nRemoves negativity and attracts positivity during prayers. \nEnhances meditation, focus, and inner peace. \nCreates a spiritual and calming ambiance at home or the workplace.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'camphor', 'Camphor_1.jpg', 'Camphor_2.jpg', 'Camphor_3.jpg', 'Camphor_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 0),
(225, 'Lavender Incense Stick', 'lavender-incense-stick', 299.00, 249.00, '5', '<p>The lavender incense stick fills your space with a refreshing, calming, and divine fragrance. Its premium quality ensures a clean, long-lasting burn, making it perfect for meditation, prayers, or daily relaxation. A spiritual companion, this incense promotes peace, positivity, and balance while uplifting your mood with its delightful aroma.</p>', 'Creates a peaceful and spiritual environment for prayers, worship, and meditation. \nRefreshes your mind and uplifts your mood with a soothing fragrance. \nPromotes relaxation, stress relief, and emotional balance naturally.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'lavender-incense-stick', 'Lavender Incense Stick_1.jpg', 'Lavender Incense Stick_2.jpg', 'Lavender Incense Stick_3.jpg', 'Lavender Incense Stick_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 0),
(226, 'Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra', 'lakshmi-charan-paduka-and-sampoorna-yanra', 2499.00, 1649.00, '14', 'Create a space filled with blessings and abundance with the Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra. The Lakshmi Charan symbolizes the arrival of prosperity and good fortune into your home, while the Sampooran Yantra represents balance, harmony, and positive energy. Together, this combo is designed to support a peaceful environment, financial stability, and a welcoming atmosphere for growth and happiness in your living space.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Homeowners who value auspicious home décor\n\n Families seeking prosperity and positive energy\n\n Individuals setting up a new home or office\n\n Anyone looking for a meaningful housewarming gift\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nPure brass and Metal Sheet\n\nDimension\n\nMata Charan: Diameter - 1.5 inches\nFrame: 19*19 cm \n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace in pooja room, entrance, or living room area\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep clean and wipe with soft dry cloth', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'lakshmi-charan-paduka-and-sampoorna-yanra', 'Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra_1.jpg', 'Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra_2.jpg', 'Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra_3.jpg', 'Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra_4.jpg', 'Lakshmi Charan Paduka & Sampoorna Yanra_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(227, 'Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set', 'ganesha-and-7-chakra-evil-eye-protection-set', 2999.00, 1899.00, '14,19', 'Create a peaceful and protected home environment with the Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set Collection. The 7 Chakra Evil Eye Hanging is designed to shield your space from negative influences while supporting balanced energy. Paired with the Brass Ganesha Idol, a symbol of wisdom and good fortune, this combo helps bring positivity, stability, and blessings into your home. Together, they create a calm, welcoming atmosphere suitable for daily living and prayer.\n\n \n\nWho Is It For?\n\nHomeowners who value positive energy décor\n\nFamilies who are seeking protection and blessings\n\nIndividuals who need to set up a pooja or a living space\n\nAnyone looking for a meaningful gift option for housewarming, birthdays, anniversaries or any special occasion. \n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Stones, Glass, Brass Ganesha Idol\n\nDimension\n\nHanging: Height - 35 cm\nIdol: Height - 6.5 cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nHang at the entrance; place the idol in the pooja or living area\n\nCare Instruction\n\nClean gently with a dry cloth; avoid moisture; use brass polish to maintain the idol\'s shine.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'ganesha-and-7-chakra-evil-eye-protection-set', 'Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set_1.jpg', 'Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set_2.jpg', 'Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set_3.jpg', 'Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set_4.png', 'Ganesha & 7 Chakra Evil Eye Protection Set_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(228, 'Divine Drive Protection Combo', 'divine-drive-protection-combo', 1999.00, 1349.00, '14,18,20', 'Drive with faith and confidence using the Divine Drive Protection Combo. The 5 Mukhi Rudraksh Mala hung on the rear view mirror represents spiritual protection and calm focus, while the Karungali Trishul placed on the dashboard symbolizes divine strength and courage. Together, they create a protective presence inside your car, helping you travel with positivity, a steady mind, and a sense of safety on every journey.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Individuals who travel daily\n\n Devotees who prefer spiritual car accessories\n\n Drivers who want a protection-focused setup\n\n Anyone gifting a car blessing combo\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural 5 Mukhi Rudraksha Beads & Natural Ebony\n\nDimension\n\nMala: 8mm 108 beads, Vel: 9.5cm\n\nHow to Use\n\nWear it around your neck or hang it on your car\'s rear view mirror.\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep away from moisture and perfumes. Clean it with a dry and soft cloth.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'divine-drive-protection-combo', 'Divine Drive Protection Combo_1.jpg', 'Divine Drive Protection Combo_2.jpg', 'Divine Drive Protection Combo_3.jpg', 'Divine Drive Protection Combo_4.jpg', 'Divine Drive Protection Combo_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(229, '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate', '7-chakra-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 2499.00, 1549.00, '14', 'Astrologer RaajeevG\'s 7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate is designed for those who want to maintain balance and clarity in their daily life. The 7 Chakra Bracelet represents the seven energy centers of the body, helping you stay calm, focused, and emotionally steady. The Selenite Charging Plate is used to refresh and cleanse the bracelet regularly, so it can be worn with the same intention every day. Together, this set supports balance, relaxation, and a clear state of mind.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Individuals practicing meditation or mindfulness\n\nPeople who are working on emotional balance\n\nThose who prefer to wear chakra accessories daily\n\nAnyone who prefers energy-focused accessories\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Stone beads & Raw Selenite Plate\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm Bead, Dia - 7cm, Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-bracelet-with-charging-plate', '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate_1.jpg', '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate_2.jpg', '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate_3.jpg', '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate_4.jpg', '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate_5.png', '7 Chakra Bracelet with Charging Plate_6.png', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(230, 'Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate', 'love-and-money-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 2499.00, 1549.00, '14', 'The Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate is designed for those who want to stay focused on both emotional happiness and financial growth. The Love & Money Bracelet combines stones associated with affection, confidence, and prosperity, helping you stay positive and goal-oriented. The Selenite Charging Plate is used to refresh the bracelet regularly so it can be worn with clear intention. Together, this set supports balance between relationships, personal mindset, and financial focus.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals working on love and financial goals\n\nPeople who believe in intention-based accessories\n\nThose who wear crystal bracelets daily\n\nAnyone who wants balance in life and work\n\n \n\nAttribute\n\nDetails\n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Stone beads & Raw Selenite Plate\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm bead size, Dia - 7cm \n\nCharging Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; place on a plate to refresh', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'love-and-money-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 'Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate_1.jpg', 'Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate_2.jpg', 'Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate_3.jpg', 'Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate_4.jpg', 'Love & Money Bracelet with Charging Plate_6.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(231, 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate', 'evil-eye-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 1999.00, 1049.00, '14,19', 'Stay protected and balanced with the Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate The Evil Eye Bracelet is worn as a symbol of protection against ill intentions, helping you maintain a calm and positive mindset. Paired with the Selenite Charging Plate, it allows you to cleanse and refresh the bracelet’s energy regularly. Together, this combo supports daily protection, emotional balance, and a clean, positive environment.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nIndividuals who believe in energy protection\n\nThose who love to wear spiritual accessories daily\n\n People who prefer cleansing their accessories regularly\n\nAnyone looking for a meaningful protection-focused gift option\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nPure Stone Bracelet & Selenite Plate\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: 8mm Bead, Dia - 7cm, Plate: Dia - 7cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear the bracelet daily; keep the plate in a clean/sacred space\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water & chemicals; use plate for cleansing', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'evil-eye-bracelet-with-charging-plate', 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate_1.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate_2.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate_3.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate_4.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate_5.jpg', 'Evil Eye Bracelet with Charging Plate_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(232, 'Karungali Mala and Trishul Travel Blessing', 'karungali-mala-and-trishul-travel-blessing', 1999.00, 1249.00, '14,18,6', 'Travel with a sense of strength and protection with this Karungali Mala and Vel Travel Blessing. The Karungali Mala with 108 beads is traditionally known for grounding energy and spiritual protection, while the Trishul placed on the dashboard symbolizes divine power and courage. Together, this combo creates a protective shield for your journeys, helping you stay calm, focused, and safeguarded during travel.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Individuals who travel frequently\n\nDevotees who prefer spiritual protection while driving\n\nCar owners who value symbolic safety accessories\n\nAnyone gifting a travel protection set\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural Karungali Beads & Ebony wood\n\nDimension\n\nMala: 8mm 108 beads, Vel: 9.5cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nHang the mala from the rearview mirror and place the Trishul on the dashboard.\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep the items dry and wipe gently with soft cloth', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'karungali-mala-and-trishul-travel-blessing', 'Karungali Mala and Trishul Travel Blessing_1.jpg', 'Karungali Mala and Trishul Travel Blessing_2.jpg', 'Karungali Mala and Trishul Travel Blessing_3.jpg', 'Karungali Mala and Trishul Travel Blessing_4.jpg', 'Karungali Mala and Trishul Travel Blessing_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(233, 'Maa Durga Brass Idol', 'maa-durga-brass-idol', 5999.00, 3999.00, '5', 'Bring divine strength and protective energy into your space with the Maa Durga Brass Idol. Maa Durga symbolizes courage, protection, and victory over negativity. Placing her idol in your home, pooja room, or workspace is believed to create a powerful and positive environment. Designed with authentic brass, this idol represents devotion, strength, and spiritual confidence, making it suitable for daily worship, home décor, or gifting.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Devotees who keep divine idols at home\n\n Families seeking protection and positive energy\n\nIndividuals setting up a pooja space\n\n Anyone looking for a meaningful spiritual gift\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nPure brass\n\nDimension\n\n4x4 inches\n\nBest Spot\n\nPlace in pooja room, entrance, or living room area\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep clean and wipe with soft dry cloth', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'maa-durga-brass-idol', 'Maa Durga Brass Idol_1.jpg', 'Maa Durga Brass Idol_2.jpg', 'Maa Durga Brass Idol_3.jpg', 'Maa Durga Brass Idol_4.png', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(234, 'Om Shakti Car Blessing Combo', 'om-shakti-car-blessing-combo', 2499.00, 1599.00, '14,18,6', 'Drive with faith and protection by your side with this powerful combo. The Om Trishul Karungali Mala symbolizes divine strength and grounding energy, while the Murugan Vel placed on your dashboard represents courage and protection during travel. Together, they create a powerful spiritual shield for your car, supporting safe journeys, calm driving, and positive energy wherever the road takes you.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\nCar owners who value spiritual protection\n\nDevotees of Shiva and Murugan\n\nFrequent travelers seeking symbolic safety\n\nAnyone gifting a new car blessing set\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nOriginal Karungali Beads\n\nDimension\n\nMala: 6mm 54 beads, Vel: 10cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nHang the mala from the rearview mirror and place the Trishul on the dashboard.\n\nCare Instruction\n\nKeep dry and wipe gently with soft cloth', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'om-shakti-car-blessing-combo', 'Om Shakti Car Blessing Combo_1.jpg', 'Om Shakti Car Blessing Combo_2.jpg', 'Om Shakti Car Blessing Combo_3.jpg', 'Om Shakti Car Blessing Combo_4.jpg', 'Om Shakti Car Blessing Combo_5.jpg', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1);
