(235, 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo', 'rudraksha-harmony-combo', 2499.00, 1449.00, '14,20', 'The Rudraksha Harmony Combo brings together the 7 Mukhi Rudraksha Bracelet and the 7 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant to create a complete personal wealth-aligned set. Made from the natural 7 Mukhi Rudraksha bead, which is traditionally associated with prosperity, financial stability, and emotional grounding. This combo will help you stay aligned with your wealth goals throughout the day. Consider it perfect if you want to strengthen your focus on financial growth while maintaining emotional balance and steady decision-making.\n\nWho Is It For?\n\n Individuals looking for authentic products that attract wealth and financial stability\n\nProfessionals working toward steady income growth\n\nThose who prefer wearing spiritually meaningful accessories daily\n\nAnyone choosing a personal prosperity-focused set for gifting purposes\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nNatural 7 Mukhi Rudraksha Beads\n\nDimension\n\nBracelet: Dia - 7cm, 10-12mm Bead size, Pendant: 20-22mm Bead size\n\nHow to wear\n\nWear daily on wrist & around neck\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, chemicals & perfumes. Store in a clean, dry place.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rudraksha-harmony-combo', 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo_1.jpg', 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo_2.jpg', 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo_3.jpg', 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo_4.jpg', 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo_5.jpg', 'Rudraksha Harmony Combo_6.jpg', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(236, 'Siddh 1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra', 'siddh-1-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant-with-mantra', 11999.00, 8999.00, '16', 'This 1 Mukhi Rudraksha locket is made with a natural Ek Mukhi Rudraksha and a Maa Lakshmi pendant, traditionally associated with clarity, prosperity, and spiritual focus. Worn close to the heart, it is believed to support disciplined thinking, inner calm, and mindful actions. The pendant has been energized and blessed by a priest through sacred Vedic rituals at a temple, filling the locket with positive energy. It is perfect for daily wear by anyone seeking balance and purpose\n\nWho Is This For?\n\nIndividuals on a spiritual or devotional path\n\nPeople who meditate, chant, or practice mindfulness\n\nThose seeking meaningful jewelry with spiritual value\n\nAnyone looking for a thoughtful and sacred gift', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-1-mukhi-rudraksha-pendant-with-mantra', 'Siddh 1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_1.png', 'Siddh 1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_2.png', 'Siddh 1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_3.png', 'Siddh 1 Mukhi Rudraksha Pendant with Mantra_4.png', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(237, 'Siddh 14 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-14-mukhi-rudraksha', 700.00, 590.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 14 Mukhi Rudraksha is a sacred and premium-quality bead imbued with divine energy. Known for promoting wealth, spiritual protection, and mental clarity, this original 14 Mukhi Rudraksha is ideal for meditation, worship, or daily wear. It enhances focus, balance, and positivity in life while attracting prosperity and divine blessings.', 'Brings financial prosperity, success, and abundance. \nEncourages spiritual growth, focus, and inner strength. \nOffers protection from negative energies and obstacles. \nPromotes mental clarity, confidence, and emotional stability. \nEnhances harmony between mind, body, and soul.', 'Wear the 14 Mukhi Rudraksha on a thread or gold/silver chain close to your heart to absorb its divine energy. \nUse during meditation or prayers to deepen focus and spiritual connection. \nKeep it in your worship space for continuous blessings and protection. \nCleanse with water occasionally and gently wipe with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight for a few minutes or chanting mantras near it.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-14-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 14 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 14 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 14 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(238, 'Siddh 13 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-13-mukhi-rudraksha', 16000.00, 13999.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 13 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and sacred bead, revered for its energy of wealth, success, and protection. This premium-quality Rudraksha enhances focus, determination, and confidence, attracting abundance and positivity. Ideal for meditation, business, or daily wear, it balances mind, body, and soul while supporting spiritual and material growth.', 'Encourages confidence, focus, and determination in personal and professional life.\nAttracts wealth, prosperity, and success in ventures.\nReduces stress, negativity, and obstacles from life.\nOffers protection from negative energies and promotes inner strength.\nBalances mind, body, and soul for overall well-being.', 'The 13 Mukhi Rudraksha benefits you with positive vibrations when worn close to your heart on a thread, silver, or gold chain, or as a bracelet. \nUse it during meditation or prayers to enhance focus, determination, and spiritual growth. \nPlace the bead in your workplace or worship space to attract success, positivity, and protection. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge the Rudraksha by placing it on a selenite plate in sunlight for a few minutes, or keep it near you while chanting mantras.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-13-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 13 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 13 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 13 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(239, 'Siddh Gauri Shankar Rudraksha', 'siddh-gauri-shankar-rudraksha', 15000.00, 13499.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The Gauri Shankar Rudraksha is a sacred bead symbolizing the divine union of Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati. This naturally joined twin bead is revered for its spiritual significance and is believed to bring harmony, love, and peace into the wearer\'s life. It\'s a powerful tool for enhancing relationships and fostering emotional balance.', 'Strengthens marital bonds and promotes family harmony. \n Enhances spiritual growth and deepens meditation practices. \n Balances emotional energies, reducing stress and anxiety. \n Attracts positive energy and removes obstacles from life.', 'Wear the Gauri Shankar Rudraksha as a pendant or bracelet, ensuring it touches your skin. \n Cleanse the bead with Ganga Jal or holy water before wearing it for the first time. \n Chant the mantra \"Om Gauri Shankaraya Namah\" 108 times during energization. \n Keep the bead in a clean and sacred place when not in use.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-gauri-shankar-rudraksha', 'Siddh Gauri Shankar Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh Gauri Shankar Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh Gauri Shankar Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(240, 'Siddh 12 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-12-mukhi-rudraksha', 12000.00, 9999.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 12 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and trendy bead known for its divine energy and spiritual influence. It enhances focus, confidence, and personal growth while attracting wealth and protection. Ideal for daily wear, meditation, or keeping in your sacred space, it brings balance, positivity, and prosperity into your life.', 'Encourages spiritual growth, self-confidence, and mental clarity. \nSupports success in career, business, and financial decisions. \nReduces stress, anxiety, and negative energies. \nAttracts prosperity, wealth, and abundance. \nPromotes harmony in relationships and life decisions. \nEnhances focus, discipline, and determination for personal goals.', 'Wear the 12 Mukhi Rudraksha as a bracelet or close to your heart on a thread, or a silver/gold chain, to absorb its powerful vibrations. \nUse during meditation or prayers to enhance focus, confidence, and spiritual connection. \nKeep it in your office, home, or place of worship for continuous positive energy and protection. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight for a few minutes, or on a selenite plate.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-12-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 12 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 12 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 12 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(241, 'Siddh 11 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-11-mukhi-rudraksha', 9500.00, 10999.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 11 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful, divine bead that brings spiritual energy, protection, and focus. Known for enhancing intuition, courage, and leadership qualities, this premium-quality Rudraksha supports meditation, worship, and daily wear. Ideal for connecting with higher energy, it promotes inner strength, positivity, and balance in life.', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-11-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 11 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 11 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 11 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(242, 'Siddh 10 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-10-mukhi-rudraksha', 9000.00, 8120.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 10 Mukhi Rudraksha is a sacred bead known for its spiritual power and connection with Lord Vishnu. This original 10 Mukhi Rudraksha is known for its ability to provide protection from negative energies and enhance one\'s spiritual growth. Also, there are numerous benefits of 10 Mukhi Rudraksha (scroll down), and it is highly beneficial for anyone seeking mental peace, protection, and spiritual awakening.', 'Promotes mental peace, helping to calm the mind and reduce stress. Enhances spiritual growth and deepens meditation practices. Clears karmic influences and offers protection from past life issues.', 'Wear the 10 Mukhi Rudraksha as a pendant or bracelet for constant protection and spiritual growth. \nPlace it in your meditation space to create a focused, calm environment. \nCleanse the Rudraksha by placing it on a selenite plate overnight to recharge its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-10-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 10 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 10 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 10 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', 'Siddh 10 Mukhi Rudraksha_5.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(243, 'Siddh 8 Mukhi Rudraksha', 'siddh-8-mukhi-rudraksha', 9000.00, 7149.00, '16', 'This product has been Siddh through sacred Vedic Puja, mantra jaap, and energization at a temple.The 8 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and sacred bead known for removing obstacles and attracting success. Blessed with divine energy, this premium-quality 8 Mukhi Rudraksha original bead supports clarity, courage, and spiritual growth. Ideal for meditation, prayers, or daily wear, it balances energy, protects from negativity, and promotes prosperity.', 'Removes obstacles and brings clarity in decision-making. \nEncourages courage, focus, and confidence in daily life. \nSupports spiritual growth, peace, and positive energy. \nAttracts success, prosperity, and protection from negativity. \nBrings balance to the mind, body, and soul while enhancing stability.', 'Wear the 8 Mukhi Rudraksha as a necklace or bracelet on a silk/cotton thread or silver/gold chain for the best results. \nUse during meditation or prayers to deepen focus, peace, and spiritual connection. \nKeep it in your worship space for continuous blessings and protection from the divine. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and gently wipe with a soft cloth. \nRecharge under gentle sunlight for a few minutes or by chanting mantras near it.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'siddh-8-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Siddh 8 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Siddh 8 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Siddh 8 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', 'Siddh 8 Mukhi Rudraksha_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
