(252, 'Love Pendant', 'love-pendant', 2499.00, 1599.00, '24', 'The Love Pendant celebrates every beautiful part of you: your laughter, your warmth, your curiosity, your wisdom. You\'re not just one thing, you\'re everything: joyful and thoughtful and growing, all at once. It holds your light, your dreams, your magic. Wear it as your daily reminder that you\'re enough, you\'re loved, you\'re exactly who you\'re meant to be. Every part of you is beautiful. Every moment is yours to shine. Comes in a gift box, perfect for celebrating someone special (especially you).\n\nWho Is This For?\n\nAnyone seeking emotional balance and a deeper connection in a relationship.\n\nPeople practicing mindfulness, relationship harmony, or daily positive affirmations.\n\nThose wanting to build confidence and improve emotional well-being.\n\nAnyone looking for a thoughtful gift option with deeper meaning\n\n \n\nMaterial\n\nGold-plated copper zinc alloy\n\nDimension\n\n4gms (+/- 1gms), 2.2 cm\n\nBest Spot\n\nWear in a chain, close to the heart for emotional comfort\n\nCare Instruction\n\nAvoid water, perfumes, and store safely after use', '', '', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'love-pendant', 'Love Pendant_1.jpg', 'Love Pendant_2.jpg', 'Love Pendant_3.jpg', 'Love Pendant_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '4.5', '0', 1),
(253, 'Picture Jasper', 'picture-jasper', 1999.00, 999.00, '24', 'Bring grounding energy and natural beauty into your style with our Picture Jasper Pendant. Known for its earthy tones and calming presence, picture jasper is believed to promote stability, balance, and inner strength. This jasper pendant makes a meaningful gift or a timeless accessory for daily wear.', 'Picture Jasper Pendant encourages stability, grounding, and emotional balance.\n Natural earthy tones make it a versatile and stylish accessory.\n Believed to inspire confidence, strength, and connection with nature.\n A thoughtful Jasper Pendant gift for those who value healing crystals.', 'Wear the Picture Jasper Pendant daily to stay balanced and grounded.\n Pair with any outfit for a natural and earthy touch of style.\n Gently clean with a soft cloth to preserve shine and beauty.\n Keep pendant stored safely when not wearing to avoid scratches.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'picture-jasper', 'Picture Jasper_1.jpg', 'Picture Jasper_2.jpg', 'Picture Jasper_3.jpg', 'Picture Jasper_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(254, 'Gauri Shankar Rudraksha', 'gauri-shankar-rudraksha', 10705.00, 10705.00, '20', 'The Gauri Shankar Rudraksha is a sacred bead symbolizing the divine union of Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati. This naturally joined twin bead is revered for its spiritual significance and is believed to bring harmony, love, and peace into the wearer\'s life. It\'s a powerful tool for enhancing relationships and fostering emotional balance.', 'Strengthens marital bonds and promotes family harmony. \n Enhances spiritual growth and deepens meditation practices. \n Balances emotional energies, reducing stress and anxiety. \n Attracts positive energy and removes obstacles from life.', 'Wear the Gauri Shankar Rudraksha as a pendant or bracelet, ensuring it touches your skin. \n Cleanse the bead with Ganga Jal or holy water before wearing it for the first time. \n Chant the mantra \"Om Gauri Shankaraya Namah\" 108 times during energization. \n Keep the bead in a clean and sacred place when not in use.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gauri-shankar-rudraksha', 'Gauri Shankar Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Gauri Shankar Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Gauri Shankar Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
