(261, 'White Coral - Triangular', 'white-coral-triangular', 11273.00, 11273.00, '23', 'The White Coral – Triangular is a premium-quality gemstone, also known as white coral stone or white moonga stone. Loved for its stylish and aesthetic appeal, this gemstone is believed to bring peace, protection, and confidence. Perfect for jewelry or personal use, this triangle shaped coral stone combines elegance with powerful energy benefits.', 'Boosts self-confidence, courage, and determination. Helps reduce stress, anxiety, and emotional imbalance. Supports mental clarity and stability in decision-making. Attracts prosperity, peace, and positive energy. Enhances protection from negativity and harmful influences. Balances energy and strengthens mind–body harmony.', 'Wear the White Coral – Triangular stone as a pendant, ring, or bracelet for continuous energy benefits. \nKeep it in your workspace or home to create a peaceful and protective aura. \nUse it during meditation to enhance focus and inner calm. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and a soft cloth. \nRecharge by placing it on a selenite plate or keeping it in natural sunlight for a short while.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'white-coral-triangular', 'White Coral - Triangular_1.jpg', 'White Coral - Triangular_2.jpg', 'White Coral - Triangular_3.jpg', 'White Coral - Triangular_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(262, 'White Coral - Capsule', 'white-coral-capsule', 9500.00, 9500.00, '23', 'The White Coral Stone capsule is a stylish and aesthetic accessory that promotes emotional balance, mental clarity, and overall well-being. Known for its natural calming energy, this White Moonga Stone enhances positivity, focus, and inner strength. Perfect for gifting, meditation, or daily wear, it brings harmony, protection, and style.', 'Supports emotional balance, stress relief, and mental clarity. \nEnhances focus, positivity, confidence, and inner strength in daily life. \nBoosts confidence, motivation, and spiritual growth naturally. \nAttracts positive energy, harmony, and protective vibrations.', 'Wear the White Coral Stone capsule as a pendant or bracelet to stay connected to its calming energy.\nUse during meditation or mindfulness exercises to improve focus and positivity.\nPlace in your workspace, home, or worship space to create a balanced and peaceful environment.\nRecharge the capsule by keeping it on a selenite plate for a few minutes to restore its energy.\nClean occasionally with a soft, dry cloth to maintain its aesthetic shine.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'white-coral-capsule', 'White Coral - Capsule_1.jpg', 'White Coral - Capsule_2.jpg', 'White Coral - Capsule_3.jpg', 'White Coral - Capsule_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(263, 'Moonstone', 'moonstone', 5395.00, 5395.00, '23', 'Moonstone is a mystical white gemstone celebrated for its soothing energy and luminous beauty. Known as the “stone of new beginnings,” this original moonstone enhances intuition, peace, and emotional balance. With its radiant moonstone color, it’s a stylish, trendy, and aesthetic gem, perfect for daily wear, meditation, or spiritual healing.', 'Encourages inner peace, emotional healing, and balance. \nEnhances intuition, creativity, and decision-making. \nSupports restful sleep and helps calm stress and anxiety. \nBrings positivity, prosperity, and protective energy.', 'Wear a moonstone gem as a pendant, bracelet, or ring for continuous benefits. \nUse during meditation to enhance spiritual connection and clarity. \nKeep a moonstone gemstone in your bedroom or workspace for calming energy. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by placing it in moonlight or on a selenite plate to restore its vibrations.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'moonstone', 'Moonstone_1.jpg', 'Moonstone_2.jpg', 'Moonstone_3.jpg', 'Moonstone_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(264, 'Firoza', 'firoza', 11273.00, 11273.00, '23', 'The Firoza gemstone, also called Feroza stone, is a beautiful and powerful crystal known for its calming energy and positivity. This firoza stone original supports protection, peace of mind, and emotional balance. Aesthetic and trendy, it’s perfect for daily wear, meditation, or as a gift, bringing good luck and harmony into life.', 'Promotes peace, positivity, and inner calm. \nProtects from negative energy and brings stability. \nBoosts confidence, communication, and decision-making. \nAttracts prosperity, good fortune, and success. \nSupports emotional healing and strengthens relationships. \nEnhances creativity, focus, and overall well-being.', 'Wear the original Feroza stone as a ring, pendant, or bracelet for maximum benefits. \nPlace the firoza stone in your meditation or workspace to create a calm, protective atmosphere. \nKeep it in your home or office for continuous blessings, prosperity, and harmony. \nClean gently with soft water and a cotton cloth. \nRecharge by placing it under sunlight for a few minutes or on a selenite plate to restore its natural energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'firoza', 'Firoza_1.jpg', 'Firoza_2.jpg', 'Firoza_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(265, 'Amethyst', 'amethyst', 6391.00, 6391.00, '23', 'The amethyst stone is a stunning crystal that radiates calming energy and spiritual balance. Known for enhancing focus, emotional clarity, and inner peace, this original amethyst stone is perfect for meditation, home decor, or daily wear. Its aesthetic and trendy appeal make it an ideal gift for loved ones.', 'Promotes emotional balance, calmness, and mental clarity. \nEnhances focus, intuition, and spiritual growth. \nHelps reduce stress, negativity, and anxiety. \nAttracts positive energy, protection, and well-being.', 'Wear the amethyst crystal as a pendant or keep it in a pocket to absorb its positive vibrations. \nUse during meditation or mindfulness practices to enhance focus, peace, and spiritual connection. \nPlace the amethyst stone in your workspace, bedroom, or home decor for calm and positive energy. \nCleanse with clean water occasionally and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge the amethyst gemstone by placing it on a selenite plate or exposing it to sunlight for a few minutes.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst', 'Amethyst_1.jpg', 'Amethyst_2.jpg', 'Amethyst_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(266, 'Agate', 'agate', 5273.00, 5273.00, '23', 'The Agate Stone is a stunning crystal known for its grounding and protective energy. Perfect for meditation, decor, or personal use, this aesthetic agate gemstone promotes balance, focus, and emotional stability. This trendy black crystal is ideal for daily wear or as a gift, bringing positivity, clarity, and a calming presence into your life.', 'Promotes emotional balance, focus, and mental clarity. \nEnhances energy flow, grounding, and protection from negative vibes. \nSupports calmness, stress reduction, and mindfulness during daily activities. \nAttracts positivity, harmony, and a sense of inner stability.', 'Keep the agate stone close to you during meditation, yoga, or mindfulness practices to enhance focus and grounding. \nWear agate crystals as jewelry or carry the agate gemstone in a pouch to absorb positive energy. \nPlace the stone in your living space or workspace for protection, calm, and balance. \nRecharge the agate stones regularly by placing them on a selenite plate or in sunlight for a few minutes. \nClean gently with a soft cloth and avoid harsh chemicals to maintain its stunning black color.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'agate', 'Agate_1.jpg', 'Agate_2.jpg', 'Agate_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(267, 'Cat&#39;s Eye (Kanak Khet)', 'catand39s-eye-kanak-khet', 187864.00, 187864.00, '23', 'The Cat’s Eye (Kanak Khet) gemstone is a rare and powerful crystal known for its striking shine and protective qualities. This natural cat’s eye stone is believed to bring mental clarity, shield from negativity, and support financial stability. A trusted choice for those seeking balance, strength, and positive transformation through an authentic and meaningful gemstone.', 'Protects from negative energies and promotes emotional stability. \nEnhances focus, determination, and sharp decision-making abilities. \nSupports financial growth and brings stability in professional life. \nEncourages spiritual awareness and strengthens personal intuition.', 'Wear the cat’s eye gem as a ring or pendant for best effects. \nConsult an astrologer to determine the suitable hand and finger placement. \nClean the gemstone regularly with mild soap and water to maintain energy. \nRecharge the cat’s eye gemstone by keeping it under moonlight once a month.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'catand39s-eye-kanak-khet', 'Cat_s Eye (Kanak Khet)_1.jpg', 'Cat_s Eye (Kanak Khet)_2.jpg', 'Cat_s Eye (Kanak Khet)_3.jpg', 'Cat_s Eye (Kanak Khet)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1);
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `product_name`, `slug`, `price`, `sale_price`, `categories`, `description`, `benefit`, `how_to_use`, `return_exchange`, `disclaimer`, `photo_folder`, `photo1`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `is_in_stock`, `product_review`, `is_ratti`, `is_active`) VALUES
(268, 'Yellow Sapphire/Pukhraj (Bangkok)', 'yellow-sapphirepukhraj-bangkok', 27983.00, 27983.00, '23,40', 'The Bangkok Yellow Sapphire, also known as Pukhraj stone, is a beautiful gemstone valued for its bright golden color and astrological benefits. Wearing an original Pukhraj stone is believed to bring wisdom, prosperity, and harmony. This natural yellow sapphire stone not only supports success and positivity but also makes a meaningful and thoughtful gift option.', 'Attracts prosperity, good fortune, and long-lasting financial stability in life. Enhances wisdom, knowledge, and decision-making abilities for better success. Strengthens relationships by bringing peace, harmony, and mutual understanding. The Pukhraj stone benefits also include improved health and overall mental well-being.', 'Wear a yellow sapphire stone in gold on the index finger for the best results. \nConsult an astrologer to ensure the correct weight and suitable time for wearing. \nClean gently with a soft cloth, avoiding strong chemicals to preserve natural shine. \nRecharge by keeping it under early morning sunlight to restore positivity and strength.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'yellow-sapphirepukhraj-bangkok', 'Yellow SapphirePukhraj (Bangkok)_1.jpg', 'Yellow SapphirePukhraj (Bangkok)_2.jpg', 'Yellow SapphirePukhraj (Bangkok)_3.jpg', 'Yellow SapphirePukhraj (Bangkok)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(269, 'Ruby (Mozambique)', 'ruby-mozambique', 269682.00, 269682.00, '33,23', 'The Mozambique Ruby is a stunning gemstone known for its vivid red color and brilliance. Wearing an original ruby stone is said to boost confidence, energy, and leadership qualities. This natural ruby stone is also associated with prosperity and passion. Its beauty and benefits make it a meaningful choice for those seeking both charm and strength.', 'Enhances confidence and leadership, inspiring success in personal and professional life. Attracts prosperity, good fortune, and long-lasting happiness into the wearer’s life. Strengthens energy and overall physical and mental well-being naturally. The benefits of ruby stone include clarity, determination, and stronger decision-making abilities.', 'Wear a natural ruby stone in gold or copper for maximum astrological strength and benefits. \nConsult an astrologer to ensure the correct weight and suitable finger before wearing. \nClean gently with a soft cloth and avoid exposure to harsh chemicals. \nRecharge by keeping in sunlight for a few hours to restore natural energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'ruby-mozambique', 'Ruby (Mozambique)_1.jpg', 'Ruby (Mozambique)_2.jpg', 'Ruby (Mozambique)_3.jpg', 'Ruby (Mozambique)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(270, 'Red Coral/Moonga - Capsule (Italian)', 'red-coralmoonga-capsule-italian', 7386.00, 7386.00, '33,23', 'Italian Red Coral, popularly called Moonga, is a vibrant gemstone known for its deep red color and powerful energy. Wearing original Moonga is believed to bring courage, confidence, and energy while protecting from negative influences. Its natural charm and healing qualities make it a powerful gemstone. This gemstone could be a meaningful and thoughtful gift for loved ones.', 'Boosts courage and confidence, helping you overcome fears and challenges. \nSupports physical strength and power, keeping energy levels naturally high. \nBrings good fortune, success, and protection from negative influences. \nEnhances determination and focus, guiding you toward achi', 'Wear Italian Moonga in a gold or silver ring for maximum astrological benefits.\nConsult an astrologer to confirm the correct weight and finger for wearing.\nClean gently with a soft cloth, avoiding chemicals to maintain natural shine.\nRecharge by placing under moonlight overnight to restore positive energy and strength.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'red-coralmoonga-capsule-italian', 'Red CoralMoonga - Capsule (Italian)_1.jpg', 'Red CoralMoonga - Capsule (Italian)_2.jpg', 'Red CoralMoonga - Capsule (Italian)_3.jpg', 'Red CoralMoonga - Capsule (Italian)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(271, 'Opal (Australia)', 'opal-australia', 7386.00, 7386.00, '23', 'Australian Opal is a beautiful gemstone that shines with many colors, making it truly special. Wearing this natural opal stone is said to bring creativity, confidence, and emotional balance. Loved for both its beauty and meaning, it also makes a thoughtful and memorable gift for your loved ones.', 'Boosts creativity and imagination, helping you explore new opportunities. \n Enhances personal charm, beauty and brings harmony in relationships. \n Attracts financial growth, prosperity, and supports stable emotional well-being. \n Helps balance mood swings and strengthens decision-making abilities naturally.', 'Wear Australian opal stone as a ring in silver to gain maximum benefits. \n Consult an astrologer before wearing to ensure correct weight and compatibility. \n Clean gently with a soft cloth and avoid exposure to harsh chemicals. \n Recharge by keeping under moonlight overnight to restore natural energies and positivity.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'opal-australia', 'Opal (Australia)_1.jpg', 'Opal (Australia)_2.jpg', 'Opal (Australia)_3.jpg', 'Opal (Australia)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(272, 'Pearl (South Sea)', 'pearl-south-sea', 6391.00, 6391.00, '23', 'South Sea Pearl is known for its natural shine, beauty, and elegance. It is one of the rarest pearls, valued for its calming energy and timeless charm. Explore authentic South Sea pearls with genuine quality and discover their benefits at the best South Sea pearl price.', 'Brings emotional balance and promotes calmness in daily life. Enhances personal charm, beauty, and grace with natural elegance. Attracts prosperity, good luck, and supportive positive energies. Supports emotional healing and helps strengthen loving relationships.', 'Wear the South Sea Pearl as a ring or pendant for maximum benefits. \nPlace it in silver or gold jewelry to enhance its natural healing energy. \nClean gently with a soft cloth to maintain shine and long-lasting beauty. \nRecharge by keeping under moonlight overnight for increased positivity and calmness.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'pearl-south-sea', 'Pearl (South Sea)_1.jpg', 'Pearl (South Sea)_2.jpg', 'Pearl (South Sea)_3.jpg', 'Pearl (South Sea)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(273, 'Hessonite/Gomed (Africa)', 'hessonitegomed-africa', 7727.00, 7727.00, '23', 'This African Hessonite (also known as Gomed Gemstone) is a powerful gemstone known for its unique orange-brown hue. Highly valued in Vedic astrology, the hessonite gemstone is believed to bring prosperity, remove obstacles, and provide protection. This African gemstone is a must-have for those seeking spiritual and material growth.', 'Promotes wealth and success, bringing prosperity and financial stability. \nClears obstacles in life, enhancing confidence and personal growth. \nImproves relationships by fostering communication and understanding. \nProvides emotional healing, reducing stress, and promoting inner peace.', 'Wear the Gomed Gemstone on the middle or ring finger of the right hand for best results. \nSet the Hessonite Gemstone in a silver or gold ring to amplify its energy. \nRecharge the African Gemstone by placing it under moonlight or with a Selenite Plate. \nClean the gemstone regularly with a soft cloth to preserve its natural shine and benefits.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'hessonitegomed-africa', 'HessoniteGomed (Africa)_1.jpg', 'HessoniteGomed (Africa)_2.jpg', 'HessoniteGomed (Africa)_3.jpg', 'HessoniteGomed (Africa)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(274, 'Fire Opal (Euthopia)', 'fire-opal-euthopia', 14545.00, 14545.00, '35,23', 'The Ethiopian Fire Opal is a mesmerizing gemstone known for its vibrant, fiery hues and striking play of colors. This fire opal gemstone is highly prized for its beauty and metaphysical properties. You can gift it to someone special or even as a jewelry item, considering its exceptional color and rarity.', 'Boosts creativity and passion, helping to unlock your full potential. \nAttracts prosperity and abundance, enhancing success in all areas of life. \nPromotes emotional healing and reduces stress, bringing emotional balance. \nStimulates the root chakra, fostering vitality, grounding, and stren', 'Wear the fire opal gemstone on the ring or middle finger for optimal energy flow. \nSet the Ethiopian Opal in a gold or silver ring to enhance its power. \nRecharge the gemstone by placing it under direct sunlight or using a Selenite Plate. \nClean the stone regularly with a soft cloth to retain its brilliance and energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'fire-opal-euthopia', 'Fire Opal (Euthopia)_1.jpg', 'Fire Opal (Euthopia)_2.jpg', 'Fire Opal (Euthopia)_3.jpg', 'Fire Opal (Euthopia)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(275, 'Fire Opal (Australia)', 'fire-opal-australia', 24091.00, 24091.00, '23', '<p>This Australian Fire Opal is a stunning gemstone known for its fiery orange-red color and attractive play of colors. Popular as a fire opal gemstone, it is believed to bring passion, creativity, and abundance. The Australian Opal Stone is perfect to be use as jewelry or a healing item</p>', 'Enhances creativity, passion, and inspiration in personal and professional life. \nAttracts wealth and prosperity, making it an excellent stone for success. \nPromotes emotional healing, easing stress and improving mood. \nStrengthens the root chakra, grounding the wearer and promoting vitality.', '', '', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'fire-opal-australia', 'Fire Opal (Australia)_1.jpg', 'Fire Opal (Australia)_2.jpg', 'Fire Opal (Australia)_3.jpg', 'Fire Opal (Australia)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(276, 'Cat&#39;s Eye (Chrysoberyl)', 'catand39s-eye-chrysoberyl', 187864.00, 187864.00, '23', 'The Cat\'s Eye Chrysoberyl is a unique gemstone known for its captivating chatoyancy, resembling the eye of a cat. Often referred to as the Cat\'s Eye Stone, it is believed to offer protection, enhance intuition, and bring good fortune. This Chrysoberyl Cat\'s Eye gemstone is ideal for those seeking to strengthen their inner wisdom and shield themselves from negative energies.', 'Protects the wearer from negative energies and ill-wishing.\n Enhances intuition, allowing better decision-making and clarity.\n Attracts wealth, prosperity, and good fortune into your life.\n Promotes spiritual awakening and a deeper connection with your higher self.', 'Wear the Cat\'s Eye Gemstone on the middle or ring finger for best results. \n Ensure the Chrysoberyl Cat\'s Eye is set in a gold or silver ring to amplify its energy. \n Recharge the stone by placing it under moonlight or using a Selenite Plate for reactivation. \n Clean the gemstone regularly with a soft, dry cloth to maintain its natural shine.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'catand39s-eye-chrysoberyl', 'Cat_s Eye (Chrysoberyl)_1.jpg', 'Cat_s Eye (Chrysoberyl)_2.jpg', 'Cat_s Eye (Chrysoberyl)_3.jpg', 'Cat_s Eye (Chrysoberyl)_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(277, 'Blue Sapphire/Neelam (Srilanka)', 'blue-sapphireneelam-srilanka', 67700.00, 67700.00, '23,37', 'This Sri Lankan Blue Sapphire (Neelam) is a premium gemstone, known for its deep blue color and clarity. Also referred to as Neelam Ratna, it is believed to bring prosperity, wisdom, and spiritual growth. Perfect for those seeking balance, this authentic Ceylon Blue Sapphire from Sri Lanka is a symbol of excellence and power.', 'Enhances mental clarity and wisdom, promoting a peaceful and focused mind. \n Attracts prosperity, wealth, and abundance into the wearer’s life. \n Encourages spiritual growth and alignment with higher energies. \n Shields against negative influences and harmful energies, providing protection.', 'Wear the Neelam Stone on the middle finger of the right hand for optimal results. \n Set the Sri Lanka Neelam Stone in a silver or platinum ring for maximum energy. \n Recharge your Blue Sapphire under the moonlight or using a Selenite Plate for enhanced benefits. \n Clean the Neelam Stone regularly with a soft cloth to preserve its natural luster.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'blue-sapphireneelam-srilanka', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Srilanka)_1.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Srilanka)_2.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Srilanka)_3.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Srilanka)_4.jpg', 'Blue SapphireNeelam (Srilanka)_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(278, 'Gomtichakra Tree', 'gomtichakra-tree', 3999.00, 2049.00, '25', 'The Gomti Chakra Tree, beautifully crafted with natural beads, makes an elegant addition to any space and a meaningful gift. Believed to invite prosperity and harmony, it infuses your surroundings with positive energy and brings a sense of balance while perfectly complementing your home décor.', 'Draws wealth and abundance while fostering spiritual growth. \nEncourages peace & harmony in both home and workspace. \nShields the environment from negativity and unwanted energies.', 'Place the tree in the northeast corner or near the entrance for prosperity. \nDisplay on a work desk or living room shelf to maintain uplifting energy. \nClean gently with a soft, dry cloth to preserve its natural shine. \nRecharge its energy monthly by keeping it under moonlight overnight.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gomtichakra-tree', 'Gomtichakra Tree_1.jpg', 'Gomtichakra Tree_2.jpg', 'Gomtichakra Tree_3.jpg', 'Gomtichakra Tree_4.jpg', 'Gomtichakra Tree_5.jpg', 'Gomtichakra Tree_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(279, 'Amethyst Crystal Tree', 'amethyst-crystal-tree', 1999.00, 1799.00, '25', 'Invite harmony and positivity to your space with this Amethyst Crystal Tree. Made with natural amethyst stones, it enhances peace and clarity while adding beauty to your decor. A thoughtful and meaningful choice, this purple crystal tree also makes an ideal gifting option for loved ones.', 'Promotes calmness and reduces stress for a peaceful mind. \nEnhances clarity, intuition power, and positive energy in your surroundings. \nAttracts spiritual growth and supports emotional healing. \nAdds beauty and elegance to your home or office decor.', 'Place the amethyst tree in your living space to attract positivity and calmness. \nKeep it on your work desk to enhance focus, creativity, and mental clarity. \nRecharge the crystal tree by placing it under moonlight overnight once a month. \nDust gently with a soft cloth to maintain its shine and natural beauty.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'amethyst-crystal-tree', 'Amethyst Crystal Tree_1.jpg', 'Amethyst Crystal Tree_2.jpg', 'Amethyst Crystal Tree_3.jpg', 'Amethyst Crystal Tree_4.jpg', 'Amethyst Crystal Tree_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(280, '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set', '7-chakra-palm-stone-set', 1999.00, 1999.00, '4', 'Bring harmony to your space with this eye-catching yet powerful 7 Chakra Palm Stone Set. Each premium stone resonates with one of the seven energy centers, encouraging balance and calm. Ideal for gifting, it supports mindfulness, stress relief, and daily spiritual practice in a beautifully natural way.', 'Supports balanced energy flow through all seven chakras naturally. \nEncourages deep relaxation and focus during meditation sessions. \nHelps release negative thoughts while inviting positive vibrations.', 'Hold a stone in each hand during breathing exercises for grounding energy. \nKeep the whole set in your sacred space at home or workplace \nPosition stones on their corresponding chakra points for energy healing. \nCleanse and recharge monthly in moonlight or on a selenite plate. \nStore in a dry pouch to keep their natural energy strong', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '7-chakra-palm-stone-set', '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set_1.jpg', '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set_2.jpg', '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set_3.jpg', '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set_4.jpg', '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set_5.jpg', '7 Chakra Palm Stone Set_6.jpg', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(281, 'Blue Onyx Tumble', 'blue-onyx-tumble', 699.00, 599.00, '23', 'Discover the soothing energy of the Blue Onyx Tumble, a natural blue onyx stone known for strength and balance. This calming onyx stone supports clarity, reduces stress, and boosts focus. Easy to carry, the onyx stone blue is perfect for meditation, healing practices, and also a thoughtful gift option.', 'Promotes mental clarity and improves focus during daily activities. \nSupports emotional balance and reduces stress effectively. \nEnhances positivity with the calming vibrations of blue onyx. \nA versatile crystal for meditation, healing, and spiritual growth.', 'Carry a blue onyx tumble in your pocket for strength and focus daily. \nPlace it on your desk or workspace to encourage clarity and productivity. \nHold during meditation to connect with calming and balancing energies. \nKeep it under your pillow for peaceful rest and reduced stress at night.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'blue-onyx-tumble', 'Blue Onyx Tumble_1.jpg', 'Blue Onyx Tumble_2.jpg', 'Blue Onyx Tumble_3.jpg', 'Blue Onyx Tumble_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '1', 1),
(282, 'Gomti Chakra Pyramid', 'gomti-chakra-pyramid', 1999.00, 1549.00, '4', 'The Gomti Chakra Pyramid is a powerful spiritual tool combining natural Gomti Chakra energy with the sacred pyramid shape. Known for attracting prosperity, harmony, and manifestation power, it balances energy and protects against negativity. With its stylish and unique pyramid design, it also adds aesthetic appeal to your home or workspace.', 'Attracts wealth, prosperity, and positive opportunities. \nEnhances manifestation power and goal-setting focus. \nProtects against negative energy and evil eye. \nPromotes harmony, peace, and balanced relationships. \nBrings balance to mind, body, and environment.', 'Place the Gomti Chakra Pyramid in your home, office, or meditation space to channel positive vibrations. \nKeep it on your work desk to attract success, clarity, and financial growth. \nUse during meditation or manifestation rituals to strengthen intentions. \nCleanse it with clean water occasionally and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by keeping it on a selenite plate or under sunlight for a few minutes.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'gomti-chakra-pyramid', 'Gomti Chakra Pyramid_1.jpg', 'Gomti Chakra Pyramid_2.jpg', 'Gomti Chakra Pyramid_3.jpg', 'Gomti Chakra Pyramid_4.jpg', 'Gomti Chakra Pyramid_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(283, 'Rhodochrosite tumbles', 'rhodochrosite-tumbles', 699.00, 699.00, '31', 'Discover the beauty and energy of Rhodochrosite tumbles, known for their vibrant pink hues and healing properties. This powerful Rhodochrosite crystal promotes love, compassion, and emotional balance. Easy to carry and use daily, the Rhodochrosite stone also makes a thoughtful, meaningful gift for anyone on a spiritual journey.', 'Encourages self-love, compassion, and emotional healing naturally. \nSupports stress relief and promotes inner peace daily. \nEnhances positivity and uplifts mood with calming vibrations. \nAids meditation and strengthens spiritual connection effectively.', 'Carry a Rhodochrosite tumble in your pocket for constant supportive energy. \nPlace it on your desk or workspace to encourage positivity and balance. \nHold during meditation to deepen focus and strengthen emotional healing. \nKeep under your pillow to promote restful sleep and peaceful dreams.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'rhodochrosite-tumbles', 'Rhodochrosite tumbles_1.jpg', 'Rhodochrosite tumbles_2.jpg', 'Rhodochrosite tumbles_3.jpg', 'Rhodochrosite tumbles_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(284, 'Lapis Lazuli', 'lapis-lazuli', 699.00, 649.00, '31', '<p>Lapis Lazuli, as deep blue as the ocean, is a powerful stone known for its spiritual and healing properties. This stunning lapis crystal enhances intuition, mental clarity, and wisdom, making it a perfect gemstone for those on a journey of self-awareness. Consider it a symbol of truth and enlightenment, which brings elegance and depth to your life.</p>', 'Enhances intuition, promoting inner wisdom and clarity. \nStimulates the third eye, aiding in spiritual growth and self-awareness. \nPromotes mental clarity, improving decision-making and focus.', '<p>Place Lapis Lazuli on your meditation altar to enhance spiritual practices and wisdom. Carry it with you in your pocket or wear it as jewelry to stay connected to your inner wisdom. Place it under your pillow at night to encourage lucid dreaming and intuitive insights.</p>', '<p>test</p>', '<p>Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There\'s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.</p>', 'lapis-lazuli', 'Lapis Lazuli_1.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli_2.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli_3.jpg', 'Lapis Lazuli_4.jpg', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(285, 'Ganesh Mukhi Rudraksha', 'ganesh-mukhi-rudraksha', 1449.00, 1449.00, '20', 'The Ganesh Mukhi Rudraksha is a sacred bead associated with Lord Ganesha, the remover of obstacles. Known for its divine energy, this Ganesh Rudraksha brings prosperity, success, and spiritual growth. It’s perfect for those seeking to overcome challenges in life and is an essential tool for meditation and prayer.', 'Removes obstacles and clears negative energy from your life. \nBrings success and prosperity in all areas of life. \nEnhances spiritual growth and connects you with divine energy. \nImproves concentration and focus during meditation and prayer.', 'Removes obstacles and clears negative energy from your life. \nBrings success and prosperity in all areas of life. \nEnhances spiritual growth and connects you with divine energy. \nImproves concentration and focus during meditation and prayer.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'ganesh-mukhi-rudraksha', 'Ganesh Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Ganesh Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Ganesh Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(286, 'Nirakari Rudraksha', 'nirakari-rudraksha', 1643.00, 1643.00, '20', 'The Nirakar Rudraksha is a very unique and powerful bead, symbolizing the formless aspect of Lord Shiva and spiritual purity. Ideal for those on a path of self-realization, it helps enhance meditation and strengthen the connection with the divine. This Rudraksha bead can even help you in anger management and keep you worry-free.', 'Supports deep meditation by enhancing spiritual clarity and focus. \nClears mental blockages, promoting emotional and spiritual healing. \nFosters a stronger connection with higher consciousness. \nAids in self-realization and helps achieve mental peace.', 'Wear the Nirakar Rudraksha as a pendant for continuous spiritual connection and energy. \nHold it in your hand during meditation to enhance focus and deepen your practice. \nPlace the Nirakar Rudraksha on a selenite plate overnight to recharge and cleanse its energy.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', 'nirakari-rudraksha', 'Nirakari Rudraksha_1.jpg', 'Nirakari Rudraksha_2.jpg', 'Nirakari Rudraksha_3.jpg', 'Nirakari Rudraksha_4.jpg', 'Nirakari Rudraksha_5.jpg', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(287, '8 Mukhi Rudraksha', '8-mukhi-rudraksha', 5832.00, 5832.00, '20', 'The 8 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and sacred bead known for removing obstacles and attracting success. Blessed with divine energy, this premium-quality 8 Mukhi Rudraksha original bead supports clarity, courage, and spiritual growth. Ideal for meditation, prayers, or daily wear, it balances energy, protects from negativity, and promotes prosperity.', 'Removes obstacles and brings clarity in decision-making. \nEncourages courage, focus, and confidence in daily life. \nSupports spiritual growth, peace, and positive energy. \nAttracts success, prosperity, and protection from negativity. \nBrings balance to the mind, body, and soul while enhancing stability.', 'Wear the 8 Mukhi Rudraksha as a necklace or bracelet on a silk/cotton thread or silver/gold chain for the best results. \nUse during meditation or prayers to deepen focus, peace, and spiritual connection. \nKeep it in your worship space for continuous blessings and protection from the divine. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and gently wipe with a soft cloth. \nRecharge under gentle sunlight for a few minutes or by chanting mantras near it.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '8-mukhi-rudraksha', '8 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '8 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '8 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
(288, '12 Mukhi Rudraksha', '12-mukhi-rudraksha', 8352.00, 8352.00, '20', 'The 12 Mukhi Rudraksha is a powerful and trendy bead known for its divine energy and spiritual influence. It enhances focus, confidence, and personal growth while attracting wealth and protection. Ideal for daily wear, meditation, or keeping in your sacred space, it brings balance, positivity, and prosperity into your life.', 'Encourages spiritual growth, self-confidence, and mental clarity. \nSupports success in career, business, and financial decisions. \nReduces stress, anxiety, and negative energies. \nAttracts prosperity, wealth, and abundance. \nPromotes harmony in relationships and life decisions. \nEnhances focus, discipline, and determination for personal goals.', 'Wear the 12 Mukhi Rudraksha as a bracelet or close to your heart on a thread, or a silver/gold chain, to absorb its powerful vibrations. \nUse during meditation or prayers to enhance focus, confidence, and spiritual connection. \nKeep it in your office, home, or place of worship for continuous positive energy and protection. \nCleanse occasionally with clean water and wipe gently with a soft cloth. \nRecharge by placing it in sunlight for a few minutes, or on a selenite plate.', 'Return & Exchange Policy: Returns or exchanges must be requested within 7 days of delivery. Products must be unused, undamaged, and in original condition.', 'Disclaimer Images are for reference only. There&#39;s no guarantee of the effectiveness of the product.', '12-mukhi-rudraksha', '12 Mukhi Rudraksha_1.jpg', '12 Mukhi Rudraksha_2.jpg', '12 Mukhi Rudraksha_3.jpg', '', '', '', 1, '5', '0', 1),
